// One paragraph per result, keyed by result name (must match quiz-data.js).
// Hand-written, not generated: edit freely. Shown under "Your vibe" on the result card.
const BLURBS = {
  "Bulbasaur": "You're the friend who'll follow a hunch straight into an adventure, then stick around to make sure everyone gets home. Like Bulbasaur, you carry a little seed of ambition on your back: quietly growing, never in a rush, but definitely going somewhere. There's mischief in you, but it's rooted in something steady and kind.",
  "Ivysaur": "You're halfway between who you were and who you're becoming, and you're surprisingly calm about it. Ivysaur's bud is heavy but promising, and so is your mind: quick, thoughtful and always weighing what's next. You keep a little to yourself, but your lightness and loyalty make you easy to love.",
  "Venusaur": "You're the steady, sunny presence people gather around without quite knowing why. Like Venusaur basking with its great flower open, you've grown into yourself and don't need to show off. You're warm, outdoorsy and caring, the kind of person whose quiet strength makes everyone else feel safe to bloom.",
  "Mega Venusaur": "You've got all of Venusaur's warmth and patience, plus an edge you're not afraid to show. When something matters to you, you dig in and grow bigger, bolder and impossible to move. You care deeply, think things through, and then pursue your goals with a quiet, thorny determination.",
  "Gigantamax Venusaur": "Most days you're modest and gentle, tending your corner of the world with care. But when the moment comes, you bloom enormous and unforgettable, just like Gigantamax Venusaur's towering flower. You're the person who surprises everyone at the big occasion and then goes back to quietly watering the plants.",
  "Charmander": "You're small, bright and full of spark. People can tell how you feel just by looking at you, much like Charmander's tail flame giving away its mood. You're quick to light up, quick to move on, and you bring a cheerful glow wherever you wander, even if you're hard to pin down.",
  "Charmeleon": "You're in your bold, slightly fiery growing-up era, and you're owning it. Like Charmeleon, you've got more presence than you used to and you're not shy about using it. Underneath the heat, though, you're thoughtful and warm, and you take your time deciding where to aim all that energy.",
  "Charizard": "You're the kind of person who flies off in search of a worthy challenge and somehow never runs out of fuel. Charizard only breathes fire at those strong enough to deserve it, and you're similar: proud and a bit guarded, but genuine and easy to talk to. Your passion is real and you wear it openly.",
  "Mega Charizard X": "You've got a cool blue fire that runs hotter than people expect. Like Mega Charizard X, you change completely when you're pushed: moodier, sharper, more determined. You think hard, then go big, and once you've set your sights on something, very little can stand in your way.",
  "Mega Charizard Y": "When you rise to the occasion, you rise high, bright and blazing like Mega Charizard Y bringing the sunshine with it. You're ambitious, tireless and thoughtful, the type to plan carefully and then light up the whole room. People feel braver just standing next to you.",
  "Gigantamax Charizard": "You don't brag, but when you finally let your full power show, it's spectacular. Like Gigantamax Charizard with its wings of flame, you can be dramatic and free-spirited when the moment calls for it. Then you fold it all away and go back to being your modest, slightly private self.",
  "Squirtle": "You're compact, level-headed and a little bit cheeky. Like Squirtle retreating into its shell, you know when to tuck away and think before you act. People underestimate how grounded you are, but you're the one who stays cool when everyone else panics, and you do it with a grin.",
  "Wartortle": "You're a city-loving, laid-back soul who's growing into a bigger presence. Wartortle's fluffy tail is a sign of a long, wise life, and you've got that old-soul calm already. You're bright, chilled out and protective, and you take life at your own unhurried pace.",
  "Blastoise": "You're dependable, practical and built like a fortress. Like Blastoise with its water cannons, you're more powerful than you look and quick to act when it counts. You're honest and down-to-earth, guarding the people you love without ever making a fuss about it.",
  "Mega Blastoise": "You're the reliable one who, under pressure, reveals an extra gear nobody knew about. Mega Blastoise's giant cannon is pure firepower, but it's still the same steady, practical turtle. You don't need the spotlight, but when you step up, you change the whole game.",
  "Gigantamax Blastoise": "You're grounded and practical, but you have a dramatic side that comes out on the big days. Gigantamax Blastoise bristles with cannons, and when you commit, you commit with everything. You protect your people fiercely and make sure everyone knows you've got their back.",
  "Caterpie": "You're sweet, approachable and full of quiet potential. Like Caterpie, you might seem small right now, but you're munching your way towards something bigger. You're affectionate, love being outdoors and don't take yourself too seriously. You're one of a kind, and you're just getting started.",
  "Metapod": "You're in a hardening phase: thoughtful, guarded and quietly transforming. Like Metapod, you might look still from the outside, but so much is happening within. You're adaptable and modest, and you know that waiting is sometimes the bravest thing you can do.",
  "Butterfree": "You're gentle, dreamy and hard to catch. Like Butterfree drifting over a meadow, you float through life at your own pace, noticing beauty others miss. You're thoughtful and understated, but there's something quietly magical about you that leaves an impression long after you've fluttered off.",
  "Gigantamax Butterfree": "You seem soft and drifty, but you've got a dazzling, dramatic side that fills the whole sky when it comes out. Gigantamax Butterfree's wings shimmer with colour and you've got that same showstopping quality. You're thoughtful and one of a kind, and when you shine, people stare.",
  "Weedle": "You're small but you've got a sting. Like Weedle, you're friendly and easy-going until someone crosses you, and then the mischief (and the moods) come out. You're grounded and outdoorsy, the type who's happiest poking about in the garden and finding trouble in the best way.",
  "Kakuna": "You look calm on the outside, but you're brewing something. Like Kakuna waiting to emerge, you're patient, adaptable and a bit of a slow-burner who suddenly bursts into action. You don't take things too seriously, and people love how easy-going you are, until you're ready to move.",
  "Beedrill": "You're a free-flying spirit with a sharp edge. Like Beedrill zipping through the forest, you're at home outdoors and impossible to pin down. You're down-to-earth and bright, but you've got a mischievous streak that keeps everyone on their toes.",
  "Mega Beedrill": "You're fast, hands-on and completely transformed when you're in your element. Mega Beedrill's drills are a blur, and you're the same when you've got a task: quick, focused and affectionate towards your crew. You bring warmth and sharpness in equal measure.",
  "Pidgey": "You're everywhere, in the best way: a familiar, friendly face in your city who quietly knows the lay of the land. Like Pidgey, you're small, practical and hands-on, with a guarded side and the odd moody gust. You're not flashy, but people rely on you more than they realise.",
  "Pidgeotto": "You're growing bolder and more confident, but you're still sweet at heart. Like Pidgeotto circling its territory, you're steady, watchful and protective of your patch of the city. You've got a youthful warmth about you, and people feel safe when you're nearby.",
  "Pidgeot": "You're fast, graceful and genuinely yourself. Like Pidgeot gliding over the water at incredible speed, you move through life with ease but stay loyal to your nest. You're affectionate and hands-on with the people you love, guarded with everyone else, and always authentically you.",
  "Mega Pidgeot": "You can be moody, but when you transform, you're unstoppable. Mega Pidgeot's crest streams like a banner, and when you're focused you carry yourself with the same practical, soaring confidence. You think things through, then you fly, and people struggle to keep up.",
  "Rattata": "You're quick, loyal and absolutely tireless when it comes to the people you care about. Like Rattata, you're small and everywhere, always busy, always nibbling away at something. You're sweet and good-natured with a fast-burning energy that makes you the first one out of the door.",
  "Alolan Rattata": "You're loyal and sweet, but you've picked up a cheeky, nocturnal streak from where you've lived. Like Alolan Rattata adapting to life in the city, you know how to find your way and look after your crew. You're quick and hands-on, and you've got just enough mischief to keep things interesting.",
  "Raticate": "You're a grown-up, sweet-natured soul who's surprisingly level-headed. Like Raticate, you're compact, quick and fiercely loyal to the people in your nest. You can be a bit moody when you're tired, but people know they can always count on your warmth and approachability.",
  "Alolan Raticate": "You like the finer things and you're not ashamed of it. Like Alolan Raticate, a picky eater who rules its corner of the city, you've adapted to your environment with a bit of attitude. You're affectionate with your inner circle, moody with everyone else, and always a little mischievous.",
  "Spearow": "You're small, bold and you never back down. Like Spearow, you've got a loud, fast energy that people notice immediately. You're approachable and hands-on, a city bird who knows how to get things done, and you can turn on a dime when something catches your interest.",
  "Fearow": "You've grown into someone steady and dependable, with wings that can go the distance. Like Fearow, you've got real stamina and a strong sense of where you're going. You're warm and sweet with the people you know, and hands-on in a way that makes things happen.",
  "Ekans": "You're adaptable, light-hearted and a bit of a trickster. Like Ekans slithering through the grass, you can fit in anywhere and slip out of trouble just as fast. You're more approachable than people think, but you've got moods, and you're not afraid to give a warning hiss when needed.",
  "Arbok": "You're bold, edgy and you know how to make an impression. Like Arbok flaring the pattern on its hood, you can be a little intimidating at first glance, but underneath you're warm-blooded and bright. You've adapted to every place you've lived and come out stronger every time.",
  "Pikachu": "You're bright, quick and bursting with ambition, but you don't make a big fuss about it. Like Pikachu, you're loyal to your partner, a little stubborn, and full of electric energy that sparks when you're excited. You're the friend everyone wants on their team.",
  "Gigantamax Pikachu": "You're loyal, quick and ambitious, and when the time comes, you go big. Gigantamax Pikachu turns its chubby cuteness up to eleven, and you're the same at big moments: dramatic, electric and impossible to ignore. Everyone remembers the time you lit up the room.",
  "Raichu": "You're expressive, affectionate and a classic in every sense. Like Raichu, you've got a lot of stored-up energy that you let out in quick, bright bursts. You're a little elusive at times, but you're ambitious and loving, and you can charge any situation with enthusiasm.",
  "Alolan Raichu": "You've soaked up the vibe of wherever you've lived, and it shows. Like Alolan Raichu surfing on its tail, you're expressive, quick and playful, with a dreamy psychic side. You're ambitious and tech-minded, but you never lose your easy, sun-soaked charm.",
  "Mega Raichu X": "You're fiery, hands-on and full of crackling energy. Mega Raichu X is a bigger, bolder burst of electricity, and that's you when you care about something: bright, affectionate and absolutely buzzing. You make things happen and have fun doing it.",
  "Mega Raichu Y": "You think fast and you think big. When an idea grabs you, you rearrange your whole life around it overnight, then calmly explain why it was obviously the right call. Mega Raichu Y stores more charge than its body should hold, and you're the same: crackling with plans, bright company, and never quite the same person twice.",
  "Sandshrew": "You're cosy, practical and happiest with your hands in the dirt. Like Sandshrew curling into a ball, you can be guarded at first, but you're friendly once you've warmed up. You're expressive in your own quiet way and you bring a sunny, grounded energy to everything you do.",
  "Alolan Sandshrew": "You're cool, calm and good-natured, and you've adapted beautifully to a chillier world. Like Alolan Sandshrew sliding around on the ice, you're compact, unhurried and surprisingly playful. You're a little guarded, but your gentle steadiness makes everyone feel at ease.",
  "Sandslash": "You're tough, hardworking and completely at home outdoors. Like Sandslash with its spiky back, you can be guarded, but you're actually approachable and warm. You've got serious stamina for anything hands-on, and you'll happily dig away at a problem until it's solved.",
  "Alolan Sandslash": "You're steely, cool and shaped by the place you call home. Like Alolan Sandslash, you've built a tough, shiny shell, but you're more approachable than you look. You're hardworking and city-minded, the type who keeps going long after everyone else has gone inside.",
  "Nidoran♀": "You're small, playful and tirelessly loyal, with a mischievous edge. Like Nidoran♀, you're gentle at heart but have a few poison barbs for anyone who messes with your friends. You're light-hearted and city-minded, and you've got so much growing still to do.",
  "Nidorina": "You're kind, bright and a natural nurturer. Like Nidorina, you tuck your barbs away when you're among friends, and you're a classic caretaker with a thoughtful mind. You're quick to help and easy to approach, and people can feel how much you care.",
  "Nidoqueen": "You're tough, protective and hands-on, the kind of person who will guard their family at any cost. Like Nidoqueen, you're armoured on the outside and soft on the inside. You've got a bright, mischievous streak, too, so life with you is never dull.",
  "Nidoran♂": "You're bold, ambitious and ready to take on the world, even if you're still small. Like Nidoran♂, you perk up your ears at any sign of adventure and you don't scare easily. You're approachable and a little mischievous, with a big personality in a little package.",
  "Nidorino": "You're edgy, quick and a little hard to read. Like Nidorino with its horn always ready, you're hands-on and a bit impulsive, but you've got your feet on the ground. You're mischievous and cool-toned, and people know not to cross you without thinking twice.",
  "Nidoking": "You're powerful, hands-on and occasionally stormy. Like Nidoking, you carry a lot of strength and you aren't afraid to use it, but you're also protective and loyal. You're guarded and moody, but your mischievous side reminds people there's a softie under the armour.",
  "Clefairy": "You're sweet, warm and a little bit magical. Like Clefairy dancing under the full moon, you're affectionate and easy to be around, though you keep a few secrets of your own. You've got more wisdom than people give you credit for, and you share it gently.",
  "Clefable": "You're so rarely seen at parties that people get excited when you turn up. Clefable hides deep in the mountains and is said to hear a pin drop half a mile away, and you've got the same gentle attentiveness. You're quietly bold, deeply affectionate and much more magical than you let on.",
  "Mega Clefable": "You're sweet, bright and secretly ambitious. Mega Clefable takes flight with new wings, and you've got the same sense of rising up into something bigger. You're affectionate and tireless, and you bring a starry, sweet-natured magic to everything you take on.",
  "Vulpix": "You're warm, loyal and a little bit shy. Like Vulpix with its six curly tails, you're beautiful in an understated way and keep a lot of fire tucked inside. You're quick and guarded, but once you trust someone, you'll follow them anywhere.",
  "Alolan Vulpix": "You're cool, calm and bright, and you've grown into who you are because of where you've lived. Like Alolan Vulpix, you've adapted beautifully to the snowy peaks, and you're good-natured and thoughtful. You're easy to approach and gentle with everyone you meet.",
  "Ninetales": "You're elegant, warm-hearted and fiercely loyal, with a fire that burns bright. Like Ninetales, you carry an old-soul wisdom and a little mystery. You're affectionate with the ones you love, guarded with everyone else, and quick to act when your people need you.",
  "Alolan Ninetales": "You're calm, graceful and sweet, with a cool, wintery sparkle. Like Alolan Ninetales, you've been shaped by your surroundings into someone serene and thoughtful. You're affectionate and bright, the kind of person who calms a room just by being in it.",
  "Jigglypuff": "You're bright, bold and never stop trying to share what you love, even if it puts everyone to sleep. Like Jigglypuff, you're a little compact performer with a huge heart. You're modest, grounded and always ready with a song, and people secretly love you for it.",
  "Wigglytuff": "You're soft, sweet and endlessly good-natured. Like Wigglytuff with its fluffy, bouncy fur, you're comforting to be around and easy to love. You can be a little elusive, but you're bold when it matters and you're always bringing joy wherever you go.",
  "Zubat": "You're a city creature of the night, quiet and mischievous. Like Zubat, you can navigate in the dark with no trouble and you're always around, even if people don't see you. Modest as you are, people tend to realise only later how much the night shift depended on you.",
  "Golbat": "You're ambitious, steady and a bit of a night owl. Like Golbat with its huge grin, you're mischievous and you know what you want. You're approachable, city-minded and unhurried, but once you've set your eyes on a goal, you'll go after it with total focus.",
  "Oddish": "You're bold, ambitious and secretly a bit mischievous. Like Oddish, which wanders around at night and plants itself during the day, you're outdoorsy and unhurried, but quick-burning when you get going. You're approachable and down-to-earth, and you've got so much to grow into.",
  "Gloom": "You're edgy, authentic and unapologetically yourself. Like Gloom, you might give off a smell some people can't handle, but those who love you get your charm. You're thoughtful and warm-blooded, a little elusive, and completely comfortable being an acquired taste.",
  "Vileplume": "You're bold, bright and secretly playful. Like Vileplume with its huge, showy petals, you're compact but impossible to miss. You've got a mischievous sense of humour and a light-hearted attitude, and you think about things more deeply than people realise.",
  "Paras": "You're bright, bold and quietly ambitious. Like Paras with its little mushrooms, you're carrying something that will grow into a big part of your future. Give it a few seasons and whatever you're carrying will have grown into something everyone notices.",
  "Parasect": "You're steady, easy-going and good-natured, a calm soul who's comfortable in damp, quiet places. Like Parasect, you're a bit of a homebody who likes things at your own pace. You're light-hearted and approachable, and people find your company relaxing.",
  "Venonat": "You're a classic night owl with big, watchful eyes. Like Venonat, you're curious and hands-on, but also moody and a bit dramatic. You're larger than life, outdoorsy and unhurried, and you always seem to notice the little things everyone else misses.",
  "Venomoth": "You're light-hearted, bold and graceful. Like Venomoth fluttering under streetlights, you're drawn to beauty and you make an impression on everyone you meet. Underneath the fluttering there's a grounded, seasoned mind, and a wit with a bit of poison on the tip.",
  "Diglett": "You're classic, quick and refreshingly good-natured. Like Diglett, people only ever see a small part of you, but there's a lot going on beneath the surface. You can be moody, but you're always approachable, and you're happiest outdoors with your hands in the earth.",
  "Alolan Diglett": "You're quick, good-natured and level-headed, and you've grown into yourself thanks to where you've lived. Like Alolan Diglett with its shiny metal whiskers, you've got a quirky style and a classic charm. You're warm, approachable and full of youthful energy.",
  "Dugtrio": "You're authentic, steady and good at working in a team. Like Dugtrio, you're always surrounded by close friends and you're happiest when everyone's moving in sync. You're quick, grounded and occasionally moody, but you're a classic who always gets the job done.",
  "Alolan Dugtrio": "You're level-headed and grounded, with a gleaming style that's been shaped by your surroundings. Like Alolan Dugtrio with its golden locks, you're quick and steady and always know how to make an entrance. You're moody at times, but you're loyal to your crew.",
  "Meowth": "You're bright, quick and street-smart, with a quiet pride. Like Meowth, you've got a soft spot for shiny things and a guarded heart. You're approachable and loyal once you trust someone, and you're always hustling towards the next good opportunity.",
  "Alolan Meowth": "You're clever, cool and a bit mischievous, shaped by the place you call home. Like Alolan Meowth, you've got a proud, aloof air, but you're bright and thoughtful underneath. You're easy to approach if you're in the mood, and you always land on your feet.",
  "Galarian Meowth": "You're tough, bold and good-natured, and you've been forged by your surroundings. Like Galarian Meowth with its steel coat, you're ambitious and hardworking but still unhurried and approachable. You're the kind of person who gets stuck in and makes the most of every opportunity.",
  "Gigantamax Meowth": "You're bright, quick and a little guarded, but when you go big, you go dramatically big. Like Gigantamax Meowth, you can stretch into something larger than life and show off the gold within. You're approachable and loyal, and you're never boring to be around.",
  "Persian": "You're sleek, warm and level-headed, the kind of person who glides through life with grace. Like Persian, you've got a regal air, but you're actually sweet and loyal once people get to know you. You're quick, compact and bright, and you always look effortlessly put together.",
  "Alolan Persian": "You're proud, playful and have a strong sense of who you are, thanks to the place you've lived. Like Alolan Persian with its round, regal face, you're moody and mischievous, but loyal and affectionate to the right people. You're quick, light-hearted and impossible to ignore.",
  "Psyduck": "You're bright, youthful and a little bit chaotic, but you're good-natured to your core. Like Psyduck clutching its head, you might look confused sometimes, but there's real power and level-headedness underneath. You're approachable, bold and always fun to be around.",
  "Golduck": "You're graceful, practical and genuinely yourself. Like Golduck gliding through the water, you're fast, tireless and calm under pressure. You're guarded and down-to-earth, the kind of person who keeps their cool and quietly gets the job done.",
  "Mankey": "You're quick, bold and passionate, and you've got a fiery side. Like Mankey, you can go from calm to furious in a heartbeat, but you're approachable and natural. You love the buzz of the city and you live life with total, unfiltered energy.",
  "Primeape": "You're fiery, affectionate and full of youthful energy, and when you commit, you commit with your whole heart. Like Primeape, you can be quick to anger, but you're also loyal and passionate. You're hands-on, bold and larger than life, and you're never half-hearted about anything.",
  "Growlithe": "You're loyal, warm and endlessly enthusiastic. Like Growlithe, you're the friend who barks at danger and wags at everyone else. You're bold, tireless and fiery, a classic good companion who'll stick with your people through thick and thin.",
  "Hisuian Growlithe": "You're tough, warm-hearted and shaped by rugged surroundings. Like Hisuian Growlithe with its rocky crest, you're bold, loyal and full of energy. You're approachable and fiery, and you'll protect your friends with everything you've got.",
  "Arcanine": "You're majestic, loyal and fiercely protective. Like Arcanine, you're a classic in every sense, the kind of person people instinctively trust. You're affectionate, hands-on and quick to act, with a fiery heart and the occasional stormy mood.",
  "Hisuian Arcanine": "You're rugged, devoted and shaped by the hardship of your surroundings. Like Hisuian Arcanine with its stony mane, you're fiery and hands-on, the kind of person who leads from the front. You're affectionate and loyal, but you've got a wild, moody streak.",
  "Poliwag": "You're bright, bouncy and a little bit hypnotic. Poliwag's swirly belly is actually its insides showing through thin skin, and you're similarly transparent: what people see is what they get. You're friendly and hands-on, with just enough cheek to keep things interesting.",
  "Poliwhirl": "You're equally happy in the pool or out on the town. Poliwhirl lives both in water and on land, and you move between worlds with the same cool, practical ease. You're guarded at first and calm under pressure, but your swirl of energy keeps people curious.",
  "Poliwrath": "You're the quiet one at the gym who swims a mile before breakfast. Poliwrath has the strongest swimming muscles of almost any Pokémon, and you've got that same tireless, steady discipline. You keep calm, keep to yourself and keep going, with a fire that only shows when you're tested.",
  "Abra": "You sleep eighteen hours a day and still somehow know what's going on. Abra teleports away the moment it senses danger, and you've got a knack for dodging drama while staying bold and friendly. Your mind is constantly ticking over, even when you look half-asleep.",
  "Kadabra": "Your brain is so loud some days that it makes electronics go funny. Kadabra gives off waves that cause headaches and bend spoons, and you've got the same intense, slightly moody brilliance. You're bold and young at heart, but you vanish when the noise of other people gets too much.",
  "Alakazam": "You're brilliant, intuitive and a little guarded. Like Alakazam with its towering intellect, you notice everything and remember it all. You're warm-toned and light-hearted with the people you trust, but you can be moody when you're thinking deeply about something.",
  "Mega Alakazam": "You're an old soul with a sharp, intuitive mind. Like Mega Alakazam floating with its five spoons, you're bold and seasoned and you can see situations clearly. You're moody at times, but you're always thinking, and people come to you for answers.",
  "Machop": "You'd rather lift the sofa than measure the doorway. Machop trains its whole body every single day, and you've got that same no-fuss love of effort. You're friendly and up for anything, though skip your workout and the grumpiness creeps in. Small frame, enormous willpower.",
  "Machoke": "You're past the beginner stage and properly in your stride. Machoke wears a power-limiting belt so it doesn't overdo it, and you've learned the same lesson: pace yourself, then show up every day. You're approachable and hardworking, but underestimate you and a sharper edge appears.",
  "Machamp": "You can juggle four jobs and still win the arm wrestle afterwards. Machamp throws hundreds of punches a second, and you bring that same intensity when you're on a mission. Then you vanish for a quiet recharge, because even the strongest people get moody without space to breathe.",
  "Gigantamax Machamp": "You're the big-hearted friend who carries everyone's shopping and makes it look like a party. Gigantamax Machamp's arms glow with gathered energy, and your good mood is just as contagious. City nights, loud laughs, huge hugs: you go dramatically all-in on the people you love.",
  "Bellsprout": "You're wiry, calm and quicker than you look. Bellsprout's flexible stem lets it snap at bugs with surprising speed, and your quiet, level-headed manner hides the same sudden bite of wit. You're friendly and practical, the type who'll happily get stuck in and quietly outwork everyone.",
  "Weepinbell": "You hang about patiently, sweet-smelling and unbothered, until exactly the right moment. Weepinbell dangles from branches waiting for prey to wander close, and you've got that same steady, seasoned patience. You're bold when you need to be and light-hearted the rest of the time, rooted firmly in nature.",
  "Victreebel": "There's something a bit mysterious about you, like a beautiful flower people aren't sure they should get close to. Victreebel lures prey with sweet nectar from deep in the jungle, and you draw people in with your bright, playful charm, while keeping your inner world well hidden.",
  "Mega Victreebel": "You've grown into the full, towering version of yourself and you're quietly proud of it. You're steady and thoughtful, outdoorsy to your bones, and you prefer to watch and wait. When you finally act, though, it's with the calm confidence of someone who planned this all along.",
  "Tentacool": "Mostly see-through, a little bit stingy: you're easier to read than you think, and you don't love that. Like Tentacool drifting along the coast, you go with the flow and fit into any crowd, with a mischievous streak and a youthful, beachy charm that people warm to fast.",
  "Tentacruel": "You've got a lot of arms in a lot of pies, and you handle them all calmly. Tentacruel's eighty tentacles let it manage the whole reef, and you're the seasoned, adaptable type who quietly runs things. Calm on the surface, guarded underneath, and absolutely not someone to cross.",
  "Geodude": "You're a solid, no-nonsense sort, the friend who turns up with gloves and a toolbox. Geodude spends its life half-buried on mountain paths, easy to mistake for a rock, and you're similarly steady and understated. Friendly, a little grumpy before coffee, and always ready to get stuck in.",
  "Alolan Geodude": "You've got a magnetic personality, literally. Alolan Geodude's iron-sand whiskers crackle with charge and pull people in, and so does your calm, cheerful nature. You've been shaped by a sunnier place than most, so you're good-natured and approachable, with a warmth that's sparked rather than burned.",
  "Graveler": "You go from standing still to rolling downhill at full speed with no warning. Graveler tumbles down mountainsides and doesn't care what it bumps into, and you've got that same youthful, hands-on enthusiasm. You love the outdoors, you're a bit moody, and you're impossible to stop once you're going.",
  "Alolan Graveler": "You've picked up a spark from where you live. Alolan Graveler has electric crystals growing out of its body and loves to brawl over them, and you carry that same crackly energy into your hobbies. You're hands-on and outdoorsy, unhurried until something lights you up.",
  "Golem": "You're the human equivalent of a boulder: steady, hard-shelled and practically unbreakable. Golem sheds its shell once a year and starts again, and you've got the same quiet resilience. You're level-headed and grounded, happiest outdoors, and you'll disappear into yourself when you need a breather.",
  "Alolan Golem": "You've turned your strength into something electric. Alolan Golem fires rocks from the magnetic cannon on its back, and you've got that same mix of earthy toughness and techy cleverness. You're affectionate and tireless, transformed by the places you've lived, and you love making an impact.",
  "Ponyta": "You were born ready to run. Ponyta can barely stand at birth but soon gallops faster than anyone, and you've got that bright, tireless energy. You're warm and easy to like, though your fiery mane only stays gentle for people you trust. Others learn quickly not to crowd you.",
  "Galarian Ponyta": "You're gentle and a bit magical, the person who notices how everyone's feeling. Galarian Ponyta's pastel mane carries healing power, and you've grown that way thanks to a soft, enchanted place in your past. You're approachable and hands-on, with a quirky edge that keeps you from being too sweet.",
  "Rapidash": "You go from zero to blazing in a heartbeat. Rapidash reaches top speed in ten steps, and you're the friend who's halfway out of the door before anyone's finished suggesting the plan. You're bold, loving and fiery, and life with you is always moving fast.",
  "Galarian Rapidash": "You're elegant without trying and you've got a calm, otherworldly sort of kindness. Galarian Rapidash's horn is said to heal, and you're the one people come to when they need soothing. Your surroundings softened you into someone bright, affectionate and quietly magical.",
  "Slowpoke": "You run on your own clock, and honestly, everyone else should too. Slowpoke takes five seconds to feel pain, and you take your time to react to anything, but your intuition is excellent. You're loyal, easy-going and a classic, and nothing ruins your good mood for long.",
  "Galarian Slowpoke": "You're sweet, intuitive and slightly spicy. Galarian Slowpoke eats a special seed that gives its tail a kick, and the place you grew up gave you a little extra flavour too. You're unhurried and loyal, comfortable in the city and always strangely tuned in.",
  "Slowbro": "You've found your perfect partner, the one who brings out your best self. Slowbro only evolves when a Shellder bites its tail, and you're the type whose life changed because of one important person. You're steady and authentic, guarded but bright, and comfortable taking things slowly.",
  "Galarian Slowbro": "You look relaxed, but you've absorbed more from your surroundings than anyone realises. Galarian Slowbro's Shellder clamped onto its arm turned it into a walking toxin cannon, and you've likewise turned what life stuck on you into a strength. You're thoughtful and modest, then suddenly bold, and you never hurry to prove it.",
  "Mega Slowbro": "You're famously unflappable, and when something finally gets you going, you armour up rather than lash out. Mega Slowbro is swallowed by its Shellder, sealed in a shell that nothing gets through. You're classic and steady, bright behind the dozy look, and fiercely protective of your peace.",
  "Magnemite": "Practical, unfussy and drawn to whatever's buzzing, you're the friend who fixes the Wi-Fi at the party and then wanders off to look at the fuse box. Magnemite floats towards power lines the way you drift towards cities and gadgets. You're small, bold and cool-headed, and you light up fast when something clicks.",
  "Magneton": "You're happiest as part of a tight little unit, three magnets stuck together, but you're still entirely your own person. Like Magneton humming near the city's power stations, you've got a fiery, tech-loving core under a calm, unhurried surface. Your moods shift like static, yet you're deeply affectionate with your people.",
  "Farfetch’d": "There's nobody quite like you. Like Farfetch'd carrying its leek everywhere, you've got one quirky thing you'll defend to the end, and it makes you unforgettable. You're light-hearted and free-spirited, a bit moody when the world doesn't get you, and you're always happiest on your own wild little flight path.",
  "Galarian Farfetch’d": "You've grown up somewhere that taught you to stand your ground, and it shows. Galarian Farfetch'd wields its leek like a knight's lance, and you carry your principles the same way: proudly, earnestly, maybe a touch stubbornly. You're grounded and natural, with moods that pass as quickly as they arrive.",
  "Doduo": "You've got two heads' worth of ideas and you can never decide which one to follow first. Like Doduo, you're quick on your feet and warm-hearted, always darting off after the next interesting thing. You're sweet, loyal and bold, and you bring a natural, sunny enthusiasm wherever you run.",
  "Dodrio": "Three moods, one heart. Like Dodrio, you contain multitudes: one part of you is level-headed, another sweet, another itching to sprint for the horizon. You're seasoned enough to manage them all, and you're quietly affectionate with the people who've earned your trust. Freedom matters to you more than most.",
  "Seel": "You're playful, good-natured and genuinely at home in the cold. Like Seel splashing about under the ice, you adapt to whatever environment you land in and somehow make it fun. You've got a big presence and a youthful energy, but you keep a little guard up until you know people well.",
  "Dewgong": "You're graceful, calm and quietly bright, the sort of person who glides through tricky situations. Like Dewgong swimming through freezing seas, you're comfortable where others shiver. You've learned to adapt over the years and keep a cool, guarded elegance, though your temper can spark quickly if someone pushes too far.",
  "Grimer": "You're messy in the most lovable way. Like Grimer oozing happily through the sludge, you're hands-on, unbothered and full of cheeky energy. You're approachable and bold, a classic do-it-yourself type who doesn't mind getting dirty if it means having fun along the way.",
  "Alolan Grimer": "You've adapted to your surroundings so well you've made them colourful. Alolan Grimer helps clean up its island by eating rubbish, and you're the same: hands-on, tireless and turning messes into something bright. You're mischievous and bold, with a youthful energy that makes chores feel like a game.",
  "Muk": "You've built a thick skin and you're not ashamed of it. Like Muk, you're unbothered by what people think and happy in your own gloopy element. You're guarded and a little edgy, but approachable once people get past the first impression, and you're tireless when you care about something.",
  "Alolan Muk": "You're edgy, guarded and dazzlingly yourself, shaped by everything you've lived through. Alolan Muk's colourful crystals are bits of what it has absorbed, and you carry your experiences the same way: proudly and vividly. You're hands-on and tireless, and you're more approachable than your spiky exterior suggests.",
  "Shellder": "You keep your shell clamped shut until you trust someone, then you're cheeky and good-natured. Like Shellder sticking its tongue out, you've got a playful streak hidden behind a tough exterior. You're hands-on, city-minded and moody now and then, but you're always worth getting to know.",
  "Cloyster": "Getting to know you takes patience, and it's worth every minute. Cloyster's shell is harder than diamond and it almost never opens, so people who see your softer side know they've earned something rare. Steady, calm and quietly formidable, you'd hold the line long after everyone else had fled.",
  "Gastly": "You're mostly vapour and vibes, but you always turn up. Gastly can envelop an elephant and still float off giggling, and you've got a playful, light-hearted streak that makes even spooky situations fun. Underneath the haze, you're surprisingly steady: the friend who stays to help clear up.",
  "Haunter": "You're a prankster with a thoughtful streak. Like Haunter slipping through walls to tap someone on the shoulder, you love a bit of harmless mischief and you've got a bold, light-hearted spirit. You can be moody, but your playful energy makes you one of the most memorable people in any room.",
  "Gengar": "You're the grinning shadow at the party who somehow knows everyone's secrets. Like Gengar, you've got a bold, playful presence with a thoughtful, slightly dark side. You're authentic and grounded, and while you love a good scare, you're loyal to the core.",
  "Mega Gengar": "Most of the time you're understated, lurking at the edges and watching. Then the moment comes and you transform into something unforgettable. Mega Gengar sinks halfway into another dimension, and you've got that same dramatic, slightly otherworldly quality. You're thoughtful and moody, and you play the long game.",
  "Gigantamax Gengar": "You're bold and dramatic, the life and the afterlife of the party. Gigantamax Gengar opens a giant mouth into another world, and you've got that same flair for the theatrical. You're thoughtful and moody beneath it all, but when you go big, nobody forgets it.",
  "Onix": "You're a gentle giant, steady, outdoorsy and authentically yourself. Like Onix burrowing through mountains, you're hard to stop once you've set a direction, but you keep to yourself and don't seek attention. You're hands-on and moody at times, and you're happiest deep in nature.",
  "Drowzee": "You're a dreamer with a warm heart. Like Drowzee, you're drawn to people's dreams and imaginations, and you're happiest in a cosy, unhurried world. You're bright and natural, but you keep a little guard up until people prove themselves. You've got a larger-than-life imagination.",
  "Hypno": "You're intuitive, thoughtful and a little mysterious. Like Hypno with its swinging pendulum, you can read people almost instantly and you know how to calm them down. You're modest and guarded, with an edgy side that comes out when you feel misunderstood. People trust your judgement.",
  "Krabby": "You're scrappy, steady and always busy. Like Krabby scuttling sideways along the shore, you get things done in your own practical way. You're approachable and hands-on, with a quick fuse when someone gets in your way, and you're grounded enough to always find your footing again.",
  "Kingler": "You're seasoned, bright and quietly powerful. Like Kingler with its enormous claw, you've got one big strength you can rely on, and you've learned how to use it wisely. You're steady and grounded, and while you keep some distance, people know you're a force to be reckoned with.",
  "Gigantamax Kingler": "You're bold, warm-hearted and absolutely unmissable when you go big. Gigantamax Kingler bubbles with foam that can dissolve anything, and you've got that same overflowing energy at big moments. You're affectionate and hands-on, and you'll happily make a scene if it means protecting your people.",
  "Voltorb": "You're compact, practical and capable of going off at any moment. Like Voltorb, which looks a lot like a Poké Ball, you're more than people expect. You're quick-thinking and warm-blooded, and while you're usually grounded and approachable, you can pop with energy when you're excited.",
  "Hisuian Voltorb": "You're a little explosive, a little wooden and entirely shaped by where you came from. Like Hisuian Voltorb, you've got a rustic charm and a fiery spark inside. You're youthful, good-natured and moody at times, and you bring a warm, outdoorsy energy to everyone around you.",
  "Electrode": "You're bright, authentic and full of energy that's always ready to burst out. Like Electrode, you can roll from calm to charged in an instant, and you're quick to act when something matters. You're hands-on and steady, with a fiery heart and a warm, genuine smile.",
  "Hisuian Electrode": "You're fiery, quick and deeply shaped by your roots. Like Hisuian Electrode, you're half nature and half explosive energy, with a steady core that holds it all together. You can be moody, but you're warm and grounded, and you always know when it's time to make a big impact.",
  "Exeggcute": "You're a little group of ideas that somehow work as one. Like Exeggcute, you're intuitive and bright, with an unhurried, youthful energy. You're outdoorsy and approachable, but you keep your guard up until you trust people. You've got a knack for reading the room.",
  "Exeggutor": "You're thoughtful, level-headed and a classic big-hearted soul. Like Exeggutor with its many heads, you're always thinking several things at once, and you've got a bright, sunny warmth. Mostly, though, you're the warm, sun-soaked friend everyone wants at the barbecue, until someone pushes your edgier buttons.",
  "Alolan Exeggutor": "You've grown tall and confident, shaped by the sunny place you call home. Like Alolan Exeggutor, you've got an edgy, dragon-like strength and a bright, loyal heart. You're level-headed and affectionate, and people look up to you, literally and figuratively.",
  "Cubone": "You're independent, good-natured and quietly brave. Like Cubone wearing its mother's skull, you carry your past with you, but you face the world with determination. You're approachable and warm, a little guarded, and you've learned to stand on your own two feet.",
  "Marowak": "You've been through things that toughened you up, and you carry them with dignity. Marowak swings the bone it has carried since childhood like a trusty tool, and your history has become your strength too. You're grounded and warm, but approach your territory carelessly and the moodier side appears.",
  "Alolan Marowak": "You're transformative, city-minded and shaped by everything you've been through. Like Alolan Marowak dancing with its flaming bone, you've turned hardship into something beautiful and fierce. Grief taught you to dance with fire rather than fear it, and the whole city feels the warmth.",
  "Hitmonlee": "Your reach is longer than anyone expects. Hitmonlee's legs stretch to kick opponents who think they're safely out of range, and you're always surprising people with how far you'll go. Old-school in the best way, you're a little moody between bursts of all-out effort.",
  "Hitmonchan": "You keep your hands up and your eyes open. Hitmonchan's punches are faster than a bullet train, and you've got that same quick, guarded readiness. Life has taught you to defend first, but when you commit, you're all fire and footwork, and you don't stop until the final bell.",
  "Lickitung": "You're curious, practical and a little bit quirky. Like Lickitung exploring the world with its tongue, you're hands-on in a way that's uniquely yours. Nothing is too odd to investigate, and friends love the strange, tireless curiosity you bring to every outing.",
  "Koffing": "You're light-hearted, practical and a bit of a city kid. Like Koffing floating around industrial areas, you're comfortable in places others avoid. You're approachable and thoughtful, with an edgy side that comes out when you're bored. You're compact, quick-burning and always ready for a laugh.",
  "Weezing": "You're mischievous, down-to-earth and a natural team player. Like Weezing with its two heads, you've always got a partner in crime. Moody one minute and cackling the next, you can turn a dull afternoon into chaos in the best possible way.",
  "Galarian Weezing": "You're cool, understated and transformative, shaped by a world that needed cleaning up. Like Galarian Weezing purifying the air, you take in the bad and turn it into something better. You're guarded and warm-blooded, with a top-hat elegance that makes you quietly memorable.",
  "Rhyhorn": "You're loyal, tireless and a bit of a bulldozer. Like Rhyhorn charging in a straight line, you're happiest when you've got a clear direction. You're outdoorsy and natural, and you're hands-on in everything you do. You can be elusive, but you're grounded and reliable.",
  "Rhydon": "You'll happily walk through a wall to get where you're going. Rhydon's hide can withstand molten lava, and you've got the same thick-skinned, big-hearted persistence. You're a bit grumpy, a bit edgy, and endlessly loyal, and you've never quite lost your youthful love of crashing about.",
  "Chansey": "You're kind, practical and endlessly caring. Like Chansey sharing its nutritious egg with anyone who needs it, you're the person people turn to when they're feeling down. You're modest and thoughtful, a little guarded, but you've got a bright, affectionate heart that never stops giving.",
  "Tangela": "You're quick, thoughtful and a little bit of a mystery. Like Tangela with its tangle of vines, nobody's quite sure what's underneath, but you're grounded and ambitious. Nobody's ever quite seen what's under the vines, which is exactly how you like it.",
  "Kangaskhan": "You're the parent of your friend group whether you signed up for it or not. Kangaskhan never lets its baby out of the pouch until it's ready, and you're that protective, hands-on, fiercely loyal type. You're honest and affectionate, and you'll go full mama bear if anyone threatens yours.",
  "Mega Kangaskhan": "You're at your best when the people you love join in. Mega Kangaskhan's baby hops out of the pouch to fight by its side, and you shine brightest as part of a family or team. You're protective and hands-on, a bit moody when stretched thin, and endlessly devoted.",
  "Horsea": "You know how to hold steady when life gets choppy. Horsea curls its tail around coral so the current can't sweep it away, and you've got that same calm, grounded instinct. You're friendly and quick-thinking, and if someone hassles you, you'll spray a little ink and swim off.",
  "Seadra": "You've grown some spikes, and you're not apologising for them. Seadra's fins are sharp enough to sting anyone who touches them, and you've learned to protect your boundaries the same way. You're calm and steady most of the time, with a moody undercurrent and a youthful sense of mischief.",
  "Goldeen": "You're elegant and you know it, but you're also tougher than your fancy fins suggest. Goldeen is called the Water Queen, yet its horn is no joke, and you're the same mix of graceful and gutsy. You're friendly and hands-on, happy wherever the current takes you.",
  "Seaking": "You swim upstream because that's where the good stuff is. Seaking battles up rivers every autumn, and you've got that same seasoned determination to keep going against the flow. You're bright and adaptable, a touch private, and people admire how you just keep on.",
  "Staryu": "You keep your light on even when it's dark. Staryu's core glows at night, and you've got a steady inner warmth that comes out most when things are quiet. You're friendly and grounded, a bit moody in the small hours, and you can regrow from almost anything.",
  "Starmie": "People sometimes wonder whether you're quite from this planet. Starmie's core flashes in seven colours, and some say it's sending signals into space. You're good-natured and genuine, quick to help, and there's a deep, private inner world behind your calm surface that only a few ever glimpse.",
  "Mega Starmie": "You're the friend who seems calm and kind, then turns out to have a whole galaxy going on inside. Mega Starmie unfolds into something brighter and stranger, and that's you once you finally let people see everything. You're natural, steady and a touch mysterious.",
  "Mr. Mime": "You can make a party out of thin air. Mr. Mime builds invisible walls with its fingertips, and you've got that same flair for conjuring something out of nothing: a game, an atmosphere, a whole bit. You're quick, intuitive and theatrical, and a little magic follows you around.",
  "Galarian Mr. Mime": "You tap-dance through life, even on slippery ground. Galarian Mr. Mime makes ice floors to dance on, and you've grown into someone bright, expressive and a bit quirky thanks to the chilly place you came from. You're quick and thoughtful, with a cool edge under the showmanship.",
  "Scyther": "You move so fast people only see a blur and a grin. Scyther's speed makes it look like there are two of it, and you've got the same quick, hands-on energy. You're fiercely loyal to your crew, bright and youthful, but you'll disappear for a while if you need space.",
  "Jynx": "You've got your own rhythm and you're not changing it for anyone. Jynx sways and sings in a language nobody understands, and you've always been happily, unashamedly yourself. You're intuitive and calm, modest underneath the drama, and people find you mesmerising.",
  "Electabuzz": "You're drawn to anything with a plug. Electabuzz hangs around power plants and causes blackouts, and you've got a similar buzz around tech and big ideas. You're quick, warm-blooded and bright, modest about how much you actually know, and full of crackling energy.",
  "Magmar": "You run warm, in temperament and in temperature. Magmar lives in volcano craters and gives off a heat haze wherever it goes, and you're the same: passionate, bright and naturally comforting on a cold day. You're thoughtful and modest, just very hard to ignore.",
  "Pinsir": "Once you've got hold of something, you don't let go. Pinsir's horns can grip and lift anything, and you've got a hands-on, outdoorsy determination that people rely on. You're modest and bright, a little guarded, and you get things done fast.",
  "Mega Pinsir": "You've found your wings and you're not slowing down. Mega Pinsir takes to the air for the first time, and you've got that same everyday ambition to go further than people expect. You're hands-on and quick, protective of your crew, and always aiming higher.",
  "Tauros": "You charge at life with your heart on your sleeve. Tauros whips itself with its tails to get fired up, and you've got a down-to-earth, ready-for-anything energy. You're sweet and loyal, level-headed when it counts, and occasionally just need to run off somewhere alone.",
  "Paldean Tauros (Aqua Breed)": "You're calm, cool and sure-footed, shaped by the land you grew up on. Paldean Tauros (Aqua Breed) jets water from its horns to charge forward, and you've got that same steady, flowing strength. You're affectionate and loyal, with a moody streak that cools as quickly as it rises.",
  "Paldean Tauros (Blaze Breed)": "You're good-natured with a hot streak. Paldean Tauros (Blaze Breed) heats its horns until they glow, and you warm up just as fast when you're excited. Your home made you tough and loyal, and you bring a light-hearted, fiery energy to your herd.",
  "Paldean Tauros (Combat Breed)": "You were raised somewhere that rewarded grit, and it shaped you. Paldean Tauros (Combat Breed) settles disputes by clashing horns head-on, and you'd rather say the hard thing to someone's face than stew. You're warm-blooded and fiercely loyal, quick to charge and quick to forgive.",
  "Magikarp": "Everyone underestimates you, and that's fine, because you know what's coming. Magikarp is famous for splashing around uselessly before it becomes one of the strongest Pokémon there is. You're adaptable and calm, a bit guarded about your dreams, and quietly on the edge of something huge.",
  "Gyarados": "You've come a long way from where you started, and people are only just catching on. Gyarados emerged from humble Magikarp into a sea serpent of terrifying power, yet you're more good-natured than your reputation suggests. You're calm, adaptable and, when needed, a hurricane.",
  "Mega Gyarados": "You've got a calm surface and a storm underneath. Mega Gyarados loses its last shred of restraint and becomes pure, wilful power, and you've got a mischievous darker side that surprises people who think they know you. Guarded, adaptable and quick, you're thrilling to be around and impossible to predict.",
  "Lapras": "You're the gentle soul who ferries friends to safety without asking for thanks. Lapras carries people across the sea on its back and sings beautifully, and you're that calm, thoughtful, tireless sort of kind. You're understated and private, but people remember how safe they felt with you.",
  "Gigantamax Lapras": "You're thoughtful and calm, and on big occasions you become the ship everyone climbs aboard. Gigantamax Lapras sails on a shell of ice crystals with friends riding along, and you've got that same dramatic, welcoming heart. You're tireless, guarded and endlessly gentle.",
  "Ditto": "You can be whatever the moment needs, but you've always got your own soft little self underneath. Ditto transforms into anything it sees, and you're the adaptable friend who fits in everywhere. You're sweet-natured, a bit moody, and one of a kind precisely because you can be anyone.",
  "Eevee": "You haven't decided who you'll become yet, and honestly, that's your superpower. Eevee's unstable genes let it evolve in eight different directions, and you're open to all of them. You're loyal and quick, a little private, and quietly charming in a way you don't advertise.",
  "Gigantamax Eevee": "You're cuddly, loyal and full of potential, and on the big day you become the fluffiest, most dramatic version of yourself. Gigantamax Eevee's collar swells into a giant fluffy ruff, and you've got the same cosy, show-stopping charm. You're quick and tireless, just a little moody.",
  "Vaporeon": "You're so adaptable you practically disappear into your surroundings. Vaporeon's cells are similar to water molecules, letting it melt into lakes, and you blend into any situation with calm, thoughtful grace. Even in the middle of a busy city, you'll always find your way to the nearest river.",
  "Jolteon": "You're quick, authentic and a bit prickly when stressed. Jolteon's fur stands up into needles when it's emotional, and your feelings bristle just as visibly. You're bright and tech-minded, fiercely loyal and warm, and you'll spark into action before anyone else has even moved.",
  "Flareon": "You're the cosy one people want to curl up next to. Flareon's fluffy mane holds heat so well it can reach over 900 degrees, and you've got that same warmth: affectionate, bright and loyal to the core. You're unhurried and city-minded, and your heart burns hot.",
  "Porygon": "You were practically born online. Porygon is a creature made entirely of code, able to slip into cyberspace, and you're the sweet, unhurried soul who's happiest in a digital world. You're loyal to your people and a bit hard to reach offline, but you'd send a supportive message at 3am without hesitation.",
  "Omanyte": "You're a curious little old soul in a young body. Omanyte swims by twisting its tentacles and hides inside its spiral shell, and you've got that same thoughtful, compact energy. You adapt to wherever you land, but you'll always feel a bit like you belong to another age.",
  "Omastar": "Your shell got so heavy you had to slow down, and you've made peace with that. Omastar's spiral grew so big it may have doomed the species, but it moves at its own thoughtful pace regardless. You're grounded, a little old-fashioned, and fascinating to anyone patient enough to listen.",
  "Kabuto": "You're happy to keep your head down and your shell on. Kabuto hides on the sea floor and peeks out with glowing eyes, and you're the practical, good-natured type who watches before getting involved. You're youthful and grounded, a bit moody, and older at heart than you look.",
  "Kabutops": "You're decisive, sharp and quick to act. Kabutops slices through water with its scythe-like arms, and you've got that same level-headed precision when it's time to make a move. You're expressive and hands-on, a little elusive, and there's something timeless about your strength.",
  "Aerodactyl": "You're wild, free and a bit of a throwback. Aerodactyl ruled ancient skies and still flies with a savage, joyful speed, and you've got that same untamed energy. You're affectionate with your own and moody with everyone else, and nothing makes you happier than open air.",
  "Mega Aerodactyl": "You're already a little wild, and when you transform, you're positively prehistoric. Mega Aerodactyl's body sprouts rocky spikes and it soars with terrifying speed, and you've got that same bold, unpredictable edge when you let loose. You're affectionate, hands-on and impossible to tame.",
  "Snorlax": "You've mastered the art of the long nap and the big lunch. Snorlax eats nearly 400kg a day and sleeps the rest, and you're the cuddly, laid-back friend who prioritises comfort. You're sweet and affectionate, a little grumpy if woken, and surprisingly strong when it matters.",
  "Gigantamax Snorlax": "You're the cosy, sweet-natured centre of every gathering, and on the big day you become the whole picnic. Gigantamax Snorlax has an entire garden growing on its belly, and you've got that same overflowing generosity. You're affectionate and dramatic, and everyone gets fed at your place.",
  "Articuno": "You arrive quietly, help, and drift away before anyone can say thank you. Articuno appears to travellers lost in icy mountains and guides them to safety. You're practical and good-natured, independent to the bone, and you carry a calm that makes even a blizzard feel manageable.",
  "Galarian Articuno": "You see straight through people, and you're not always sure they want you to. Galarian Articuno's psychic gaze is said to freeze people in place, and you've got a cool, intuitive presence shaped by the place you grew up. You're independent and elusive, and when you speak, people listen.",
  "Zapdos": "You're a classic legend with a modest streak. Zapdos lives in thunderclouds and only appears during storms, and you're the person who comes alive when things get chaotic. You're quick, warm and tech-minded, independent and hard to pin down, and you bring electricity wherever you fly.",
  "Galarian Zapdos": "You prefer running to flying, and you're very, very fast. Galarian Zapdos can't really fly, so it sprints at a hundred miles an hour with a single kick, and you've found your own unconventional way to excel. Modest about it, warm, independent and shaped by the rugged place you came from.",
  "Moltres": "Winter seems to end a little early when you arrive. Moltres is said to bring spring wherever it flies, melting snow in its wake. Modest about your effect on people, you're an independent, classic soul who makes everything around you grow.",
  "Galarian Moltres": "You've got a cool, slightly menacing elegance, and you know how to use it. Galarian Moltres's wings shed a dark aura that drains the will to fight, and you're the practical, mischievous type who wins arguments without raising your voice. Elusive, independent, and impossible to read.",
  "Dratini": "You're constantly shedding your skin and starting again. Dratini sheds its skin many times as it grows, and you're always reinventing yourself with a bold, free-spirited energy. Every time you shed a skin, you come out a bit closer to the legend you're going to be.",
  "Dragonair": "Rooms go quiet when you walk in, not from fear but from a kind of hush. Dragonair is said to change the weather with the crystals on its body, and your mood has the same way of reshaping the atmosphere. Seasoned, serene and adaptable, you belong to nobody but yourself.",
  "Dragonite": "You're the big, kind-hearted friend who flies to the rescue. Dragonite circles the globe in sixteen hours and saves people lost at sea, and you're that approachable, modest, tireless type. You're independent and moody at times, but your heart is always in the right place.",
  "Mega Dragonite": "You're a gentle soul who, in a crisis, becomes formidable. Mega Dragonite takes Dragonite's protective kindness and gives it real teeth, and you're the person who'll quietly organise the rescue, then fly it there yourself. Thoughtful, guarded and ambitious, you'd go to the end of the world for someone in trouble.",
  "Mewtwo": "You've had to figure out who you are on your own, and you've come out of it with a deep sense of self. Mewtwo was created in a lab and spent years questioning its purpose, and you're intuitive, ambitious and fiercely authentic. You're bold, elusive and see things others miss.",
  "Mega Mewtwo X": "You're quietly, physically powerful, and you don't feel the need to explain yourself. Mega Mewtwo X bulks up into a psychic brawler, and you've got that same hands-on strength and intuitive mind. You're independent and understated, with a light-hearted side people rarely get to see.",
  "Mega Mewtwo Y": "Your brain is your superpower, and when you're focused, it's frightening. Mega Mewtwo Y slims down into pure psychic speed, and you're the level-headed person who can think several moves ahead under pressure. You're ambitious and bold, utterly tireless, and you change the game when you transform.",
  "Mew": "You're playful, curious and secretly ancient. Mew is said to contain the genetic code of every Pokémon, and you contain multitudes behind your cheeky grin. You're intuitive and level-headed, small but grounded, and people find you quietly enchanting.",
  "Chikorita": "You've got a sweet, calming energy that people can't quite put their finger on. Chikorita's leaf gives off a pleasant scent, and you're the person whose company just makes people feel better. You're loyal and natural, a little guarded, and happiest in sunshine and fresh air.",
  "Bayleef": "You're a walking energy drink, without the crash. Bayleef's neck leaves give off a spicy scent that perks up anyone nearby, and your good mood is just as catching. You're quick, ambitious and light-hearted, though you keep a little of yourself private.",
  "Meganium": "Your presence calms people down. Meganium's petals release a soothing aroma that can stop an argument in its tracks, and you're the everyday peacekeeper of your circle. You're affectionate, hands-on and happiest outdoors, and people feel safe when you're around.",
  "Mega Meganium": "Your kindness has a touch of real magic. Mega Meganium's flower blooms with fairy power, and you've grown your natural gentleness into something ambitious: you want to make the world softer, and you've got a plan. Sweet, thoughtful and seasoned, you nurture everything in your path.",
  "Cyndaquil": "You're shy, until you aren't. Cyndaquil's back flames flare up when it's startled or excited, and your feelings show just as clearly. When you're comfortable, you're quick, bright and light-hearted, and you warm up any room once you've found your feet.",
  "Quilava": "You've got a protective streak and a temper to match. Quilava intimidates enemies with its flaming collar, and you're quick to defend your people with a bright, fiery energy. You're loyal and tireless, a bit guarded, and edgier than you were as a kid.",
  "Typhlosion": "You're calm and protective, with a temper you rarely need to use. Typhlosion hides behind a shimmering heat haze, but when it's truly angry its flames explode. You're loyal and thoughtful, an old-fashioned warm-hearted soul, and anyone who threatens your people finds out what you're really made of.",
  "Hisuian Typhlosion": "You carry the past with you, warmly and a little hauntingly. Hisuian Typhlosion's purple flames are said to guide lost spirits home, and you're the person who comforts others through their hardest moments. Shaped by old, wild places, you're affectionate, thoughtful and fiercely loyal.",
  "Totodile": "You're full of energy and you're not afraid to chomp into anything new. Totodile bites anything that moves, and you've got that same playful, hands-on eagerness. Behind the chomping there's a cheerful, down-to-earth kid who just wants to play.",
  "Croconaw": "Once you've got hold of something, you don't let go. Croconaw's fangs grow back when they fall out, and you've got that same steady, renewable determination. You're cool and calm, a bit guarded, and you take your time deciding who gets your trust.",
  "Feraligatr": "You look intimidating, and you're actually a big softie. Feraligatr opens its jaws wide to scare off enemies, then pounces on its friends playfully, and you're that perfect mix of formidable and fun. You're level-headed and genuine, affectionate to the core, and fiercely protective.",
  "Mega Feraligatr": "You're steady and kind right up until someone needs protecting, and then you're formidable. Mega Feraligatr takes on dragon power without losing its loyalty, and you're that understated friend who quietly becomes the city's toughest bodyguard when it counts. Level-headed, affectionate and transformative.",
  "Sentret": "You're always on lookout duty. Sentret stands on its tail to see further, and you're the alert, thoughtful friend who notices when something's off. You're sweet and modest, quick-burning but unhurried, and a bit moody when you've been on watch too long.",
  "Furret": "You make every place you live feel like home. Furret builds its nest to fit its long body perfectly, and you've got the same knack for comfort. You're sweet-natured and level-headed, quick with a cuddle, and big-hearted enough that people instantly feel at ease with you.",
  "Hoothoot": "You're as reliable as a clock. Hoothoot taps its foot in a perfect rhythm and was once used to keep time, and you're the steady, sweet-natured person who's always where you said you'd be. You're youthful and approachable, and you bring a gentle, orderly calm to the chaos of city life.",
  "Noctowl": "You see clearly when everyone else is fumbling in the dark. Noctowl's eyes gather the faintest light, and you're the seasoned, thoughtful person with perspective during a crisis. You're sweet-natured and steady, and people come to you at midnight for advice.",
  "Ledyba": "You're bright, sociable and always flitting between friends. Ledyba gathers in swarms and communicates with scent, and you're the warm, youthful type who thrives in a group. You're quick and free-spirited, a little guarded, and always ready for an adventure.",
  "Ledian": "You come alive under the stars. Ledian is said to draw energy from starlight and the patterns on its back look like constellations, and you're the seasoned, free-spirited soul who loves a late-night walk. A bit guarded, very gentle, and quietly wise.",
  "Spinarak": "You know that good things come to those who wait. Spinarak spins a web and sits still for days, perfectly patient, and you've got that same calm persistence. Affectionate, warm-blooded and bright, you build things slowly and they last.",
  "Ariados": "You've always got a thread running back to what you care about. Ariados ties silk to its prey and follows it home, and you're the clever, patient type who knows exactly where every plan leads. Light-hearted and mischievous, steady and seasoned, you're quietly three steps ahead.",
  "Crobat": "You've got so many errands on the go that you've practically grown an extra set of wings. Crobat evolved four wings to fly faster and more quietly, and you're the quick, everyday hustler who knows every shortcut through the city at night. A little mischievous, very steady, and loyal to the friends who earned it.",
  "Chinchou": "You're a little lighthouse in the deep. Chinchou flashes the lights on its antennae to talk to friends in the dark, and you're the one who's always messaging the group chat, tirelessly keeping everyone connected. Young, techy and a touch edgy, you're grounded enough to find your way anywhere.",
  "Lanturn": "You've learned to glow without burning out. Lanturn's light can be seen from the surface of the sea, a calm beacon for sailors, and you're the seasoned, adaptable person others steer by. You're cool-headed and a bit guarded, quietly tech-savvy, and you keep shining long after everyone else has gone to sleep.",
  "Pichu": "You're bursting with more energy than you can quite control yet. Pichu zaps itself when it gets excited, and you're the sweet, eager friend whose enthusiasm sometimes outruns you. You're modest, affectionate and bold, a tiny spark that clearly has big things ahead.",
  "Cleffa": "You make wishes on shooting stars and secretly believe they'll come true. Cleffa is often seen on nights full of meteors, and you've got that same dreamy, affectionate sweetness. You're warm and easy to talk to, a little shy at first, and you light up with a quick, starry happiness.",
  "Igglybuff": "You're soft, bouncy and absolutely determined to sing your heart out. Igglybuff's body is so elastic it bounces when it walks, and you bounce back from setbacks the same way. You're sweet, light-hearted and bold for your size, and you never get tired of sharing what you love.",
  "Togepi": "You're a little bundle of good luck. Togepi is said to store up the happiness of kind people inside its shell, and you're the bright, good-natured friend who makes everyone feel lucky to know you. A bit guarded, very grounded, and a classic in all the best ways.",
  "Togetic": "You quietly go looking for kind people, and you find them. Togetic is said to appear only to people with good hearts, sharing its happiness with them. You're sweet-natured, practical and thoughtful, a little elusive, and more seasoned in your kindness than people realise.",
  "Natu": "You notice everything and say very little. Natu stares at things for ages without blinking and seems to see the future, and you're the intuitive one who knows how a situation will play out before it does. Compact, quick and warm, you're easy to underestimate.",
  "Xatu": "You stand still and watch the world, and you understand it better than most. Xatu is said to see past and future with its two eyes, so it stares at the sun all day. You're steady, intuitive and good-natured, a calm presence who rises above city chaos.",
  "Mareep": "You're soft, fluffy and quietly full of charge. Mareep's wool stores static electricity until it crackles, and you're the light-hearted friend whose easy-going vibe hides a surprisingly practical, techy brain. You're loyal and unhurried, and you've got far more energy than your fluffy exterior suggests.",
  "Flaaffy": "You've lost a bit of your fluff and gained a lot of edge. Flaaffy's wool thins as it evolves, but its electric power grows, and you're the more seasoned, thoughtful version of your younger self. You're practical, warm and a little elusive, with a quick-burning spark.",
  "Ampharos": "You're a guiding light, and you'd rather not make a fuss about it. Ampharos's tail light shines so brightly it was once used as a lighthouse, and you're the bold, modest, independent person people instinctively follow home. You're tireless, thoughtful and quietly brilliant.",
  "Mega Ampharos": "You've got hidden depths that even your friends are surprised by. Mega Ampharos sprouts a flowing white mane and awakens dormant dragon blood, and you've got an ancient-feeling ambition behind your sunny, techy exterior. Bright and tireless, a little edgy when you're on a mission, and impossible to miss once your light is on.",
  "Bellossom": "You love a good dance, and you love your people even more. Bellossom dances in groups to call for the sun, and you're the affectionate, practical friend who brings everyone together. You can be a bit moody, and you've got an edge, but you're always ready for a twirl.",
  "Marill": "You keep yourself afloat no matter what. Marill's tail is full of oil that works like a buoy, so it never sinks, and you've got that same practical knack for staying above water. You're cheerful and good-natured, cool under pressure, and a bit sulky when things don't go to plan.",
  "Azumarill": "You're cute, and you're stronger than anyone guesses. Azumarill can hear prey moving in the fastest river, and you're always tuned into how people are really feeling. Sweet, practical and affectionate, you've got a moody side, but you'll lift anyone out of the water when they're struggling.",
  "Sudowoodo": "You're pretending to be something you're not, and you're mostly pulling it off. Sudowoodo disguises itself as a tree but secretly hates water, and you've got that same outdoorsy charm with a twist of self-protection. Guarded and a bit moody, you're quietly hilarious once people see through the act.",
  "Politoed": "You're the friend who croaks a happy song until everyone joins in. Politoed is said to rule over Poliwag, gathering them with its calls, and you're the affectionate, good-natured person who draws a crowd. You're thoughtful and a bit moody, but your warmth is impossible to resist.",
  "Hoppip": "You drift wherever the wind takes you, and you're fine with that. Hoppip is so light it floats away on the breeze, and you're the warm, thoughtful free spirit who goes with the flow. One good gust and you're off on another quiet adventure, waving cheerfully as you go.",
  "Skiploom": "Your mood tracks the weather, and you've stopped apologising for it. Skiploom's flower opens wide in warm sun and closes when it's cold, and you're the bright, outdoorsy soul who blossoms in the right conditions. You're quick and free-spirited, a touch guarded until the sun comes out.",
  "Jumpluff": "You float through life on a cloud of cotton, but you're not as soft as you look. Jumpluff rides the wind across the world, and you're the everyday adventurer with a bit of an edge. You're practical and thoughtful, a little moody, and you never stay in one place for long.",
  "Aipom": "Your hands are always busy, and so is your brain. Aipom's tail is so clever it uses it more than its actual hands, and you're the quick, affectionate type who's always fiddling with something. Sweet-natured and level-headed, you're happiest in a busy city with plenty to play with.",
  "Sunkern": "You're small, sunny and full of potential. Sunkern drinks the morning dew and grows towards the sun, and you're the bright, bold, unhurried type who's quietly working on becoming something bigger. You're modest and light-hearted, and people love being around your sunshine.",
  "Sunflora": "You turn your face towards the light and keep it there. Sunflora follows the sun across the sky all day, and you're the cheerful, good-natured optimist people want around on grey days. You're bold and thoughtful, with a little edge that stops you being too sugary.",
  "Yanma": "You see the whole picture, all at once. Yanma's compound eyes give it a full 360-degree view, and you're the bright, bold, outdoorsy person who never misses a detail. Quick on your feet and grounded in your judgement, you can change direction mid-flight without losing your cool.",
  "Wooper": "Stress just slides off you. Wooper coats itself in a slimy film to stay cool out of the water, and your laid-back grin works the same way. Loyal and tireless, you'll happily potter about outdoors all day, and you make anxious friends feel calmer just by shrugging.",
  "Paldean Wooper": "You left the water and made a whole new life for yourself. Paldean Wooper lost its gills after a battle long ago and now lives on land, coated in a poison film for protection. You've adapted the same way, and you're loyal, light-hearted and comfortable wherever you've landed.",
  "Quagsire": "You swim through life with your mouth open, taking whatever comes. Quagsire just lets food drift in, and you're the easy-going, hands-on type who doesn't overthink things. You're cool, calm and approachable, a little guarded underneath, and impossible to rattle.",
  "Espeon": "You can sense how people are feeling before they open their mouths. Espeon reads tiny changes in the air with its fine fur and predicts what will happen next. Your moods shift with the wind, but your loyalty to the people you've chosen never does.",
  "Umbreon": "You come alive at night, and you're fiercely loyal. Umbreon's rings glow when the moon rises, and you're the independent, city-minded soul who's at your best after dark. You're approachable but guarded, a little mischievous, and you'd stay up all night to help a friend.",
  "Murkrow": "Your reputation arrived before you did, and you've decided to enjoy it. Murkrow is blamed for bad luck, but mostly it just collects shiny things and roams where it likes. Bold, independent and a touch mischievous, you're far more fun than the rumours suggest.",
  "Slowking": "You're the wise one at the table who still knows how to laugh. When Shellder bit Slowking's head it gave it great intelligence, and you're the thoughtful, authentic person whose advice people trust. You're bright and light-hearted, a bit guarded, and you never rush to a conclusion.",
  "Galarian Slowking": "You've absorbed a lot, and you've come out a little bit of a genius. Galarian Slowking's Shellder is full of poison and strange, ancient knowledge, and you've been shaped by your surroundings into someone complex and brilliant. You're thoughtful and unhurried, and quietly transformative.",
  "Misdreavus": "You love a well-timed jump scare. Misdreavus sneaks up on people at night and loves to give them a fright, and you've got that same mischievous, bold sense of fun. Behind the spooky giggling there's a steady little soul who just wants someone to notice them.",
  "Unown": "You're a puzzle piece that only makes sense with others. Unown are ancient symbols that form words together, and you're the intuitive, light-hearted soul who thrives in a crowd. Alone you're a single letter; with your people, you spell out something nobody can ignore.",
  "Wobbuffet": "You never throw the first punch, but you always land the last word. Wobbuffet doesn't attack; it simply reflects whatever comes at it straight back. Patient and seasoned, you'd rather wait than react, and the people who push you learn that your calm is not the same as weakness.",
  "Girafarig": "There's a little guardian in you that never sleeps. Girafarig's tail has a small brain of its own that watches out for danger, and you've got an intuitive sense of when something's off. Sweet, bright and tirelessly loyal, you somehow see trouble coming before anyone else.",
  "Pineco": "You keep a cosy shell around you, but you're softer than you seem. Pineco hangs from branches and layers bark around itself, and you're the outdoorsy, natural soul who likes a bit of privacy. You're youthful and unhurried, a bit moody, and more affectionate than you let on.",
  "Forretress": "Home is your fortress, and you've furnished it just right. Forretress spends almost all its time sealed in its steel shell, opening up only to eat. You're guarded with new people and hands-on with your projects, and the few who are let inside discover a deeply affectionate heart.",
  "Dunsparce": "You're delightfully odd and completely comfortable with it. Dunsparce digs backwards with its tail and flutters about on tiny wings that barely work, and you've made a cheerful life out of being a little unusual. Warm, adaptable and sweet, you're everyone's favourite surprise.",
  "Gligar": "You arrive silently and know exactly where you're landing. Gligar glides on the wind without a sound and grabs hold of its target with its pincers. You're quick and outdoorsy, affectionate once you trust someone, and a bit moody when you're cooped up for too long.",
  "Steelix": "You've been through the pressure and come out stronger. Steelix lived underground for so long that its body hardened into steel, and you're the outdoorsy, hands-on friend who's been tempered by life. Years of quiet pressure turned you from stone into steel, and you wear it without fuss.",
  "Mega Steelix": "You've been forged under pressure, and when you transform, you're unbreakable. Mega Steelix's body sprouts crystals as hard as diamonds, and you're the hands-on, outdoorsy type who becomes truly formidable when it matters. You're moody, elusive, and unstoppable once you start digging.",
  "Snubbull": "You look a bit grumpy, but you're a total softie. Snubbull's intimidating face makes other Pokémon run away, but it's actually very affectionate, and you're the sweet-natured, hands-on person who's often misunderstood. Anyone who sticks around past the scowl discovers that your heart is much bigger than your bark.",
  "Granbull": "You've got a scary face and a sweet heart. Granbull's huge jaw makes it look fierce, but it's actually very timid and loving. You're the seasoned, warm-blooded type who's much softer than people expect, and you'd do anything for the people you love.",
  "Qwilfish": "You puff up when you feel threatened, and you're pricklier than you look. Qwilfish swallows water to inflate itself and fires poisonous spikes, and you've learned to protect yourself in the same way. You're cool and calm most of the time, guarded and authentic, and a little bit mischievous.",
  "Hisuian Qwilfish": "Hard waters made you spiky, and you're not sorry. Hisuian Qwilfish grew darker, toxin-filled spines to survive in a tougher sea, and you've armoured up in response to where you've lived. Quick, youthful and everyday, you're surprisingly warm once people get past the points.",
  "Scizor": "You've got a steely exterior and a sharp, practical mind. Scizor's pincers are marked with eye patterns that scare off enemies, and you're the down-to-earth, tech-minded type who knows how to get things done. Unhurried and genuine, you'd rather let your work speak than talk yourself up.",
  "Mega Scizor": "You're steely and sharp, and when you transform, you're even more formidable. Mega Scizor's pincers grow bigger and its body becomes tougher, and you're the down-to-earth, tech-minded person who levels up when it matters. You're transformative and unhurried, and you're never caught off guard.",
  "Shuckle": "You're slow, steady and secretly brilliant. Shuckle stores berries in its shell until they ferment into juice, and you're the seasoned, grounded type who knows how to make the most of what you've got. You're bright and guarded, and people love your quiet, patient strength.",
  "Heracross": "You lift other people's loads like it's nothing. Heracross can toss something a hundred times its own weight, and you're the good-natured powerhouse who turns up to help everyone move house. Fiery when challenged and guarded until you trust someone, you'd still never let a friend struggle alone.",
  "Mega Heracross": "You're strong and affectionate, and when you transform, you're unstoppable. Mega Heracross's horn splits into a fearsome weapon, and you're the hands-on, outdoorsy type who becomes formidable when you're fired up. Good-natured to the core, you just happen to be able to lift a house when your friends need it.",
  "Sneasel": "You're quick, clever and very good at getting what you want. Sneasel scales trees to snatch eggs from nests while the parents are away, and you've got that same sly, level-headed opportunism. Cool and moody, with a razor wit, you're always several steps ahead.",
  "Hisuian Sneasel": "You're fiery, bold and shaped by a harsh world. Hisuian Sneasel's claws are full of poison, and you're the quick, hands-on friend who's learned to fight for what you want. Nobody gave you an easy start, so you made your own way, claws first.",
  "Teddiursa": "You've always got a sweet treat hidden somewhere. Teddiursa soaks its paws in honey and stashes food in secret places, and you're the cuddly, hands-on type who's quietly prepared for anything. You're shy around strangers, but once you're comfortable you're pure warmth.",
  "Ursaring": "You can sniff out the best food in the city from three streets away. Ursaring's nose finds the tastiest berries in any forest, and you're the big, genuine, grounded person who always knows where to eat. Affectionate and tireless, you're a gentle giant with surprising reserves of strength.",
  "Slugma": "You run hot, literally and emotionally. Slugma is made of magma and has to keep moving or it'll cool and harden, and you've got the same restless warmth. Adaptable and city-minded, a little edgy when you're bored, you light up any place you settle in.",
  "Magcargo": "Life cooled you into a sturdy shell, but you're still molten underneath. Magcargo's shell is hardened lava, and its body burns hotter than the sun's surface. You're seasoned and grounded, moody when things are slow, and you warm people in ways they don't expect.",
  "Swinub": "You follow your nose and it rarely lets you down. Swinub snuffles under the snow to find hidden food and once found hot springs that way. Modest, calm and outdoorsy, you've only got one weakness: never stand between you and a snack.",
  "Piloswine": "You're steady, shaggy and impossible to rattle. Piloswine's fur is so thick it covers its eyes, and it charges on regardless, guided by its nose. You're light-hearted and loyal, calm in a crisis, and big enough to carry everyone through the coldest winters.",
  "Corsola": "You heal faster than anyone expects. Corsola's branches grow back quickly when they break, and you're the bright, good-natured person who bounces back from setbacks. You're practical and outdoorsy, a little elusive, and your youthful energy brightens any reef you join.",
  "Galarian Corsola": "You've been through something that changed you, and you're still here. Galarian Corsola is a ghost of coral lost to a changing sea, and you carry your history in your bones. Practical and guarded, still bright and youthful at heart, you're living proof that you can survive what tries to bleach you.",
  "Remoraid": "You've got deadly accurate aim, in conversation and in life. Remoraid shoots jets of water at flying prey from below the surface and rarely misses. You're quick-thinking and grounded, cool under pressure, and you always seem to know exactly what to say.",
  "Octillery": "You've got a lot of arms and a lot of tricks. Octillery grips things with its suckers and sprays ink to escape, and you're the bold, practical person who can handle several problems at once. Calm, adaptable and warm, you're a seasoned problem-solver.",
  "Delibird": "You're always popping up with a little present for someone. Delibird carries food in its tail and shares it with people lost in the mountains. Nobody in your life ever feels forgotten, because there's always a little parcel with their name on it.",
  "Mantine": "You rise above the waves with calm, majestic ease. Mantine leaps out of the sea and glides over the surface for hundreds of feet, and you're the thoughtful person who stays graceful when things get rough. Cool, guarded and quietly soaring, you make difficult things look effortless.",
  "Skarmory": "You've grown armour, but you're still light enough to fly. Skarmory's steel feathers were once used as swords, yet it soars at incredible speeds. You're guarded and authentic, cool in a crisis and warm with your people, and you can cut through nonsense in seconds.",
  "Mega Skarmory": "When your people need you, you turn into a fighter jet. Mega Skarmory sharpens into something faster and fiercer, and you're the hands-on, tech-minded person who protects your crew with real precision. Affectionate and guarded, you soar higher when it matters most.",
  "Houndour": "You've got your own pack and your own language with them. Houndour communicates with its friends using different howls, and you're the thoughtful, independent soul with a tight inner circle. You're moody and fiery, quick to defend your own, and a bit of a lone wolf with everyone else.",
  "Houndoom": "Your howl is a bit of an event. Houndoom's bark is said to send shivers down the spine, and you're the bold, independent person who makes an impression. You're light-hearted with friends and mischievous with everyone else, and people know you're fiercely loyal underneath it all.",
  "Mega Houndoom": "You're mischievous and loyal, and when you transform, you're downright infernal. Mega Houndoom's body glows red with intense heat, and you're the independent, light-hearted person who becomes unstoppable when someone hurts your people. You're moody, transformative and fiercely devoted.",
  "Kingdra": "Your calm creates whirlpools. Kingdra sleeps on the sea floor, and when it yawns, it stirs up the ocean above. Most days you're the calm at the bottom of the sea, until a free-spirited mood sends the waves spinning.",
  "Phanpy": "You love a good splash. Phanpy sprays water from its trunk to play with its friends, and you're the sweet, approachable person who's always up for some fun. Loyal and tireless, you'll happily spend all afternoon in the river with whoever wants to play.",
  "Donphan": "You're tough, bold and steady as a rock. Donphan rolls into a ball and charges at anything in its way, and you're the seasoned, affectionate person who's always ready to defend your people. You're moody and outdoorsy, and your armoured exterior hides a gentle heart.",
  "Porygon2": "You've had an upgrade, and you're thrilled about it. Porygon2 was rebuilt to explore space and can learn new behaviours on its own, and you're the bright, practical person who's always teaching yourself something new. Sweet, loyal and quick, you're the one who sets up everyone's new phone.",
  "Stantler": "There's something a little hypnotic about you. Stantler's antlers bend the air into strange illusions, and people find themselves seeing things your way without quite knowing how. You're bold and sweet-natured, quick on your feet, and moody enough to keep folks guessing.",
  "Smeargle": "You leave your mark everywhere you go. Smeargle paints its territory with the colourful fluid from its tail, and you're always sketching, decorating or tweaking something. You're shy about showing anyone your sketchbook, but your creativity is enormous.",
  "Tyrogue": "You're always looking for your next mentor. Tyrogue picks fights to get stronger and evolves based on how it trains, and you're the thoughtful, fiery one who wants to learn from everyone. Young and natural, a bit hard to pin down, you're still deciding what kind of strong you'll become.",
  "Hitmontop": "You've got incredible balance, physically and otherwise. Hitmontop fights by spinning on its head like a top, and you're the quick, fiery person who stays steady while everything whirls around you. You're guarded and a bit moody, but you dance through life with style.",
  "Smoochum": "You lead with your heart, and sometimes your lips. Smoochum explores the world by touching things with its mouth and constantly checks its reflection. You're quick, affectionate and level-headed, a city kid with an edge, and you love a good look in the mirror.",
  "Elekid": "You're always charging up for something. Elekid spins its arms like a windmill to build electricity, and you're the quick, fiery young spark who's always buzzing with a new idea. Grounded and techy, you're happiest pressing all the buttons to see what happens.",
  "Magby": "Every breath you take seems to give off sparks. Magby's body is so hot that embers puff out of its mouth, and you're the quick, warm, natural person who lights up whatever you're doing. Young and a bit hard to catch, you're a little ball of fire.",
  "Miltank": "You nourish everyone around you. Miltank's milk is packed with nutrients and is said to help children grow up healthy, and you're the bright, hands-on person who keeps everyone fed and cared for. Level-headed and sweet, you're quietly guarded about your own needs.",
  "Blissey": "You can't walk past someone who's sad without stopping. Blissey senses sadness and rushes to share its egg, which brings happiness to anyone who eats it. You're bright and ambitious about making the world kinder, deeply affectionate, and grounded enough to actually do it.",
  "Raikou": "You arrive with thunder and leave just as fast. Raikou races across the land like a lightning strike, and you're the independent, thoughtful soul who's always on the move. Legendary in your own circles, techy and warm, you're the storm that clears the air.",
  "Entei": "You've got a volcano in your heart. Entei is said to have been born in an eruption, and wherever it goes, a new volcano forms. When you finally roar, the whole city stops to listen.",
  "Suicune": "You purify things. Suicune is said to cleanse dirty water with a single touch, and you're the calm, good-natured person who makes situations better just by being there. Independent and thoughtful, you glide through chaos with natural grace.",
  "Larvitar": "You're small, but you're eating your way to greatness. Larvitar eats an entire mountain's worth of soil before it evolves, and you're the hands-on, outdoorsy person who's always building yourself up. Independent and unhurried, you're a bulldozer in the making.",
  "Pupitar": "You're under pressure, and you're about to explode. Pupitar's shell is as hard as steel and it shoots out compressed gas to move, and you're the hands-on, outdoorsy person who's preparing for something big. Moody and adaptable, you're warm-blooded and ready to launch.",
  "Tyranitar": "You could flatten a mountain and you'd still ask if anyone wanted a cuppa. Tyranitar's armour shrugs off almost anything, and it reshapes landscapes just by wandering about looking for a worthy opponent. You're bright, ambitious and mischievous, a self-made force who's never needed anyone's permission.",
  "Mega Tyranitar": "You already take up space, and when you power up, the ground trembles. Mega Tyranitar's armour cracks open to reveal glowing plates, and you're the independent, ambitious type whose final form is something people talk about for years. Tireless, bright and a bit of a show-off when you've earned it.",
  "Lugia": "You keep to the deep, and you only surface when things are truly wrong. Lugia sleeps at the bottom of the sea because a flap of its wings could cause a storm, and you hold back your strength out of care for others. Intuitive and guarded, you're the calm someone calls in a crisis.",
  "Ho-Oh": "People say seeing you is good luck, and they might be right. Ho-Oh's feathers shine in seven colours and are said to bring eternal happiness to anyone who glimpses them. You're warm, ambitious and good-natured, independent and quick, and you leave a rainbow behind you.",
  "Celebi": "You've always felt slightly out of step with time. Celebi hops between eras and only appears in peaceful forests, and you're the thoughtful, intuitive person who sees the long view. Small, guarded and a bit moody, you've got big plans that span years.",
  "Treecko": "You'll scale any wall that's put in front of you. Treecko's feet are covered in tiny hooks that let it climb straight up, and you're bold enough to try. For someone your size, the cheeky confidence is genuinely impressive.",
  "Grovyle": "You leap from one opportunity to the next. Grovyle bounds through the treetops as if it were flying, and you're the bright, quick person who never stays on one branch for long. Classic, thoughtful and affectionate, you make everything look graceful.",
  "Sceptile": "You protect your patch with quiet ferocity. Sceptile's arm leaves are as sharp as swords, and it never lets anything harm the trees it guards. You're modest and thoughtful, a bit moody, and warm-blooded where it counts, a loyal guardian at heart.",
  "Mega Sceptile": "When it matters, you reveal the dragon inside. Mega Sceptile's tail glows like a lantern and its leaves turn into fearsome blades, and you're the ambitious, level-headed person who rises to every challenge. Affectionate and bold, you're a protector with a fiery edge.",
  "Torchic": "You're a tiny ball of warmth that's surprisingly hard to put out. Torchic keeps a fire burning in its belly, and hugging it is like hugging a hot-water bottle. Give you a bit of encouragement and the flicker in your belly turns into a proper blaze.",
  "Combusken": "You've got serious kick. Combusken can launch ten kicks a second, and you're the bright, hands-on person who's always ready for a challenge. Bold and warm, a bit hard to read, you bring a lot of heat to anything you put your mind to.",
  "Blaziken": "You burn brightest when protecting the people you love. Blaziken's wrists burst into flames in battle, and it leaps over buildings to reach friends in trouble. You're fiery and genuine, light-hearted when things are calm, and absolutely tireless when they aren't.",
  "Mega Blaziken": "You're quietly understated until someone you love needs you, then you become an inferno. Mega Blaziken's flames roar hotter and its speed keeps climbing the longer it fights. You're city-minded and affectionate, and your energy only grows as the battle goes on.",
  "Mudkip": "You've got a built-in radar for what's going on. Mudkip senses movement in the water with the fin on its head, and you're always quietly aware of the room. Cool, good-natured and ambitious, you look relaxed but you're secretly gearing up for something big.",
  "Marshtomp": "You're happiest knee-deep in mud. Marshtomp's slimy skin lets it move better through mud than water, and you're the hands-on, natural type who doesn't mind getting messy. Seasoned and good-natured, you keep a low profile but you're always getting things done.",
  "Swampert": "You can feel a storm coming before anyone else. Swampert senses changes in the sea and moves its nest to safety before the waves hit, and you're the level-headed protector who's always one step ahead. Cool, calm and quietly mighty, you can tow a whole boat.",
  "Mega Swampert": "You're steady until you're needed, then your strength becomes undeniable. Mega Swampert's arms bulge into massive muscles, and you're the down-to-earth person who carries the heaviest loads when it counts. Bright, affectionate and transformative, you make the impossible look like a normal Tuesday.",
  "Poochyena": "You'll chase anything that moves, and you'll never give up. Poochyena bites at anything that catches its eye and has incredible stamina, and you're the bold, natural, city-minded type who's always up for a challenge. A bit edgy, very loyal and absolutely relentless.",
  "Mightyena": "You know where you stand in your pack, and you're fiercely loyal to it. Mightyena hunts in packs and follows a strong leader without question. Cool and a bit moody with outsiders, you'd still do anything for your crew.",
  "Zigzagoon": "You never walk in a straight line. Zigzagoon wanders about in zigzags, picking up interesting things it finds along the way, and you're the curious, approachable soul who explores every detour. Warm, quick and a bit guarded, you always come back with something cool.",
  "Galarian Zigzagoon": "You've got a rebellious streak and a cheeky grin. Galarian Zigzagoon sticks its tongue out to provoke others, and you've been shaped by your surroundings into someone thoughtful but feisty. Level-headed and approachable, you're a bit moody, and you never let anyone push you around.",
  "Linoone": "Once you've chosen a direction, you go full speed. Linoone runs in straight lines at incredible speeds, and you're the hands-on, sweet-natured person who knows exactly what you want. Grounded and loyal, you don't do detours, and you always reach your goal.",
  "Galarian Linoone": "You've got a punk-rock attitude and a sweet, loyal heart. Galarian Linoone charges straight at enemies with its tongue out, and you've been shaped by your surroundings into someone fearless and direct. Hands-on and quick, you're much softer than your edgy style suggests.",
  "Wurmple": "You're busy, bright and always nibbling away at something. Wurmple scrapes bark off trees with the spikes on its tail, and you're the bold, outdoorsy person who's always working on a project. Modest and grounded, you've got no idea yet what you'll turn into, and that's exciting.",
  "Silcoon": "You're wrapped up in your own world for a while, and you're okay with that. Silcoon spins silk around itself and waits patiently to evolve. When you finally emerge, it'll be something beautiful.",
  "Beautifly": "You're bold, colourful and always on the move. Beautifly's vibrant wings make it impossible to ignore, and it flits between flowers with a free spirit. Seasoned and thoughtful, a bit elusive, you bring a warm splash of colour to every garden you visit.",
  "Cascoon": "You remember every slight, and you're waiting for your moment. Cascoon is said to remember every attack it received while in its cocoon. Underneath the grudges, there's a light-hearted soul waiting for the right moment to break out.",
  "Dustox": "You're drawn to the bright lights, and you're always heading towards them. Dustox flies towards city lights at night and scatters poisonous dust from its wings, and you're the bright, hands-on person who's always exploring. You're elusive, quick-burning and a bit of a moth to the flame.",
  "Lotad": "You're relaxed, cool and always floating on the surface. Lotad's leaf acts as a parasol, keeping it shaded in the sun, and you're the affectionate, approachable person who's always chilled out. People drift towards you on bad days, because sitting next to you feels like floating on a calm pond.",
  "Lombre": "You love a harmless prank, and you're always up to something. Lombre swims up to fishing lines and tugs on them, and you're the bright, youthful person who's always making mischief. Fishermen across the region still haven't figured out who keeps tugging their lines.",
  "Ludicolo": "Put on music and you physically cannot sit still. Ludicolo's cells are energised by rhythm, so it dances whenever it hears a cheerful tune. You're affectionate and practical most days, a bit moody when it's quiet, and the first to drag people onto the dance floor.",
  "Seedot": "You look like an acorn, and you're secretly plotting your growth. Seedot hangs from branches and polishes itself with leaves until it shines, and you've got the same patient, thoughtful pride in your work. Warm, loyal and a touch guarded, you're happiest in the woods.",
  "Nuzleaf": "You've got a whistle that calms people down. Nuzleaf plays a leaf flute that unsettles enemies and soothes friends, and you know exactly which notes to hit. Modest and thoughtful, practical and affectionate, you're quietly one of the most reassuring people around.",
  "Shiftry": "You live in the treetops and stir up whirlwinds when you're annoyed. Shiftry's leaf fans whip up gales strong enough to blow houses away, and you're the bold, quick, outdoorsy type who doesn't take nonsense. Hands-on and grounded, you protect your forest fiercely.",
  "Taillow": "You'll take on anyone, no matter how big they are. Taillow fearlessly challenges much stronger opponents, and you've got the same plucky, quick-burning bravery. Bright and sweet-natured, you're a city bird through and through, and you'd follow your friends anywhere.",
  "Swellow": "You soar fast and true, and you always look sharp doing it. Swellow keeps its glossy wings immaculate and dives at incredible speeds, and you're the bold, polished person who makes everything look easy. Affectionate with your flock, a bit elusive with everyone else.",
  "Wingull": "You ride the breeze wherever it takes you, and you're always light-hearted about it. Wingull glides on sea winds without flapping its wings, and you're the bright, quick-thinking person who goes with the flow. Approachable and city-minded, you're a cheerful seaside soul.",
  "Pelipper": "You're the reliable courier in your friend group. Pelipper carries small Pokémon and eggs in its huge beak, and you're the seasoned, warm-hearted person who always delivers. A bit guarded and unhurried, you keep the coast clear for everyone else.",
  "Ralts": "You can feel people's emotions as if they were your own. Ralts senses feelings through the horns on its head, and it hides from anger but is drawn to happiness. A city full of good vibes is your natural habitat, and you quietly add to them.",
  "Kirlia": "You dance when you're happy, and your joy changes the space around you. Kirlia uses psychic power to warp the air into illusions when it's in a good mood. You're sweet-natured and thoughtful, a little elusive, and you're more seasoned in reading people than most.",
  "Gardevoir": "You'd risk everything to protect the people you love. Gardevoir creates a small black hole to shield its trainer from harm, and you're the modest, independent person who quietly guards your loved ones. Intuitive and thoughtful, you take your time, and you never break a promise.",
  "Mega Gardevoir": "You're independent and ambitious, and when you transform, you're breathtaking. Mega Gardevoir's dress flows like a ballgown, and you're the bright, understated person who becomes radiant when the moment calls. Intuitive and thoughtful, you protect with elegance.",
  "Surskit": "You glide across life's surface like it's nothing. Surskit skates over water on its feet, which secrete an oily substance, and you're the youthful, affectionate person who never seems to sink. Quick and steady, cool and calm, you're always gliding towards your next adventure.",
  "Masquerain": "You've got a face people remember. Masquerain's antennae look like big angry eyes to scare off enemies, but it's actually light-hearted and free-spirited. Behind the fierce-looking mask is one of the gentlest souls around.",
  "Shroomish": "You're a cosy little mushroom of a person. Shroomish lives in damp forests and releases spores when threatened, and you're the light-hearted, loyal type who's happiest in the quiet outdoors. Classic and unhurried, you're tireless in your own sweet way.",
  "Breloom": "You're more of a fighter than people expect. Breloom's arms stretch out to deliver devastating punches, and you're the bold, grounded person who packs a surprising punch. Bright and seasoned, you take your time, and when you strike, it counts.",
  "Slakoth": "You've perfected the art of doing absolutely nothing. Slakoth sleeps twenty hours a day and only eats leaves within reach, and you're the light-hearted, practical person who knows how to rest. Loyal and natural, you're unhurried in a way people find oddly inspiring.",
  "Vigoroth": "You physically cannot sit still. Vigoroth's blood boils if it stops moving, so it's always running around, and you're the quick, hands-on person who needs to be busy. You're down-to-earth and good-natured, a little guarded, and you'd rather sweep the whole street than sit on the sofa.",
  "Slaking": "You're powerful, but you'd honestly rather have a nap. Slaking spends its days lying down, only eating grass within arm's reach, but its strength is immense. You're affectionate and sweet-natured, a bit moody, and quick to act when it actually matters.",
  "Nincada": "You've spent a long time underground, and you're about to break out. Nincada lives beneath tree roots for years, sensing the world through its antennae, and you're the youthful, affectionate person who's quietly preparing for a big change. Quick and good-natured, you're warm-blooded and ready.",
  "Ninjask": "Blink and you've missed it: you're already three errands ahead. Ninjask moves so fast it's practically invisible, buzzing loudly so friends can find it. Seasoned and free-spirited, you love a warm afternoon outdoors and you'll try anything bold at least once.",
  "Shedinja": "There's an emptiness people sense in you, and a strange calm too. Shedinja is the hollow shell Ninjask left behind, somehow alive, and you've made a steady, mischievous peace with the parts of yourself that got left behind. You're grounded, genuine and a bit uncanny.",
  "Whismur": "You're quiet until you're suddenly, enormously not. Whismur whispers most of the time, then startles itself with its own loud cry and bursts into tears. Slowly, you're learning that your voice is far bigger than you ever thought.",
  "Loudred": "When you've got something to say, the whole street hears it. Loudred stomps its feet and then lets rip with a cry that can shatter windows. Sweet underneath the volume, you're grounded and bold, a bit moody, and impossible to talk over.",
  "Exploud": "You're loud, and you've made peace with it. Exploud's roar can be heard six miles away, and it communicates with others by booming from the holes in its body. You're level-headed between outbursts, sweet with friends, and your voice carries a long way.",
  "Makuhita": "You get knocked down and you bounce straight back up. Makuhita builds strength by being thrown around, and it never stops trying. Nothing makes you happier than a good-natured scrap with your mates, followed by a big dinner.",
  "Hariyama": "You could stop a lorry with one palm, and you're quietly proud of it. Hariyama's slap can send a truck flying, yet it takes good care of its friends. You're hands-on and bold, a bit moody, and you'd happily take on anyone who threatens your crew.",
  "Azurill": "You bounce around on your tail and you're happiest with company. Azurill spins its rubbery tail to throw itself further than you'd expect, and you're the good-natured, down-to-earth kid who always lands on your feet. Guarded with strangers, you're elusive until you trust someone.",
  "Nosepass": "You always know which way is north. Nosepass's magnetic nose always points the same direction, and it never moves unless it has to. People rely on you to show them the way, and you've never once pointed them wrong.",
  "Skitty": "You chase your own tail and you're not even embarrassed. Skitty can't resist moving things and spins after its own tail, and you're the bold, sweet-natured, curious type who's easily distracted by fun. Modest and bright, you find joy in tiny things.",
  "Delcatty": "You do things at your own pace, and you're unbothered about it. Delcatty never builds a nest and roams wherever it pleases, and you're the seasoned, good-natured person who's quietly independent. You're affectionate and cool-headed, a bit moody, and always effortlessly elegant.",
  "Sableye": "You've got a sparkle in your eye, and it's slightly mischievous. Sableye's gemstone eyes come from eating crystals in dark caves, and you're the hands-on, natural person who loves hidden treasures. You're seasoned and a bit elusive, and you love a good secret.",
  "Mega Sableye": "You're usually small and sneaky, but when you transform, you're a shield. Mega Sableye holds up a massive red gem to block attacks, and you're the thoughtful, edgy person who protects others with surprising power. Seasoned and cool-headed, you'd hold that gem up against anything to keep your friends safe.",
  "Mawile": "You've got a sweet face and a very big bite. Mawile's back jaw is made of steel and it lures enemies in with its cute face, and you're the hands-on, tech-minded person whose friendliness hides a sharp edge. Seasoned and cool-headed, you're not to be underestimated.",
  "Mega Mawile": "You've got twice the bite, and you're classic in every sense. Mega Mawile grows two huge jaws, and you're the hands-on, city-minded person who becomes formidable when you transform. You're moody and unhurried, with a sweet face that hides real power.",
  "Aron": "You eat iron for breakfast, and you're tough as nails. Aron eats rails and cars to build its steel body, and you're the independent, tech-minded kid who's always tinkering with something. Guarded and outdoorsy, you're quietly determined.",
  "Lairon": "You've got a hard shell and a strong sense of territory. Lairon guards its mountain home and charges at intruders with its steel body. Once you've claimed a mountain, you'll guard it tirelessly, even if nobody ever thanks you.",
  "Aggron": "You protect your mountain fiercely, and you clean up after yourself. Aggron replants trees after landslides on its territory, and you're the hands-on, independent person who takes responsibility for your patch. You're guarded, tech-minded and quietly gentle.",
  "Mega Aggron": "You're a walking fortress, and you're cool under pressure. Mega Aggron sheds its Rock type to become pure steel, and you're the hands-on, city-minded person who becomes completely impenetrable when it matters. You're practical and warm-blooded, and nothing gets past you.",
  "Meditite": "You meditate every morning and you're calm and good-natured all day. Meditite eats only one berry a day and meditates to build its psychic power, and you're the bright, approachable person who's always centered. A little guarded, you're happiest when the city is calm.",
  "Medicham": "Years of quiet practice have given you an unusual sixth sense. Medicham's long meditation sharpened its intuition until it can read an opponent's next move, and you've got that seasoned stillness too. Bright and unhurried, you keep your guard up, and there's a sharp edge under the serenity.",
  "Mega Medicham": "When you finally let go, you move with real fire. Mega Medicham's psychic aura blooms into flowing fabric as it fights, and you go from calm practice to full-hearted action in a heartbeat. Hands-on and affectionate, you bring a natural warmth to whatever you throw yourself into.",
  "Electrike": "You've got static in your fur and sparks in your step. Electrike stores electricity by rubbing against the air as it runs, and the faster you go, the more charged up you get. Bright, curious and loyal, you're a classic tech kid who loves a quick sprint.",
  "Manectric": "Thunder seems to follow you around. Manectric is said to make its den where lightning strikes, its mane crackling all the while. Give you time to plan, and your next big storm will be spectacular.",
  "Mega Manectric": "You're loyal and warm, and when you level up, you're blindingly fast. Mega Manectric's mane flares into crackling streaks of light, and you're the techy, thoughtful person who becomes impossible to keep up with once you've committed. Affectionate, fiery and transformative.",
  "Plusle": "You're the ultimate cheerleader. Plusle shakes pom-poms made of sparks to cheer on its friends, and you're the bold, good-natured soul who loves celebrating other people's wins. You're bright and quick, a little edgy, and you've been doing this long enough to be very good at it.",
  "Minun": "You care more about your friends' success than your own. Minun cheers so loudly for its partners that it doesn't notice when it gets hurt. You're bright and techy, a touch guarded and edgy, and you'd always rather be in someone else's corner.",
  "Volbeat": "You love leading the group into a beautiful formation. Volbeat flies in patterns with its glowing tail, drawing shapes in the night sky, and you're the practical, hands-on organiser who makes the whole thing look magical. A little guarded and moody, you're also quietly ambitious.",
  "Illumise": "You're the one who decides where the light show goes. Illumise guides groups of Volbeat into glowing patterns with its sweet scent, and you're the thoughtful, practical planner behind the scenes. Ambitious and a bit moody, you'd rather direct the dance than be in it.",
  "Roselia": "You're pretty, and you're a little bit dangerous. Roselia's two roses carry different poisons, but their scent is incredibly soothing, and you're the bold, thoughtful person who's both gentle and sharp. Outdoorsy and a bit mischievous, you're a lovely mix of contradictions.",
  "Gulpin": "You've got a surprising appetite for life. Gulpin's stomach makes up most of its body and can digest almost anything, and you're the bright, classic person who takes in everything without fuss. A bit guarded and mischievous, you're cool-headed and quietly content.",
  "Swalot": "You can swallow almost anything, and you rarely let things bother you. Swalot has no teeth and gulps down whatever it fancies, and you're the thoughtful, affectionate person who takes life in your stride. A bit moody and mischievous, you've got a big, friendly heart.",
  "Carvanha": "You're a little bit feisty, especially when someone enters your space. Carvanha guards its territory in rivers and attacks in groups, and you're the bold, adaptable kid who's always ready for a scrap. Cool and calm in your element, you're a lot to handle when riled.",
  "Sharpedo": "You've got a reputation for being a bit dangerous, and you kind of love it. Sharpedo is called the 'bully of the sea', and its teeth grow back when they break. You've never once pretended to be gentler than you are, and people respect you for it.",
  "Mega Sharpedo": "You transform with a vengeance. Mega Sharpedo's body is covered in scars from battle, and it charges through the sea with incredible speed. Once you're fired up, fear simply isn't part of the equation.",
  "Wailmer": "You're bouncy, cheerful and always ready to make a splash. Wailmer shoots water from its blowhole and bounces around like a ball, and you're the light-hearted, good-natured person who's always having fun. Adaptable and youthful, you're a tireless bundle of joy.",
  "Wailord": "You're huge, gentle and endlessly patient. Wailord is one of the largest Pokémon ever discovered, and it swims in pods through the open ocean. Moody tides come and go, but your heart is big enough for the whole sea.",
  "Numel": "You're slow, steady and have a fire in your belly. Numel stores magma in its body and never feels the cold, and you're the light-hearted, outdoorsy person who's always quietly warm. Loyal and tireless, you take your time and never complain.",
  "Camerupt": "You've got volcanoes on your back, and you erupt every so often. Camerupt's humps fill with magma and it erupts when it's angry, and you're the warm, loyal person with a fiery temper. Hands-on and outdoorsy, you're mostly calm, but people know not to push you too far.",
  "Mega Camerupt": "You've been simmering for years, and now you've finally boiled over. Mega Camerupt's volcano bursts with magma, and you're the thoughtful, natural person who becomes a classic force of nature when you transform. Loyal and affectionate, your fire burns hot.",
  "Torkoal": "You puff away contentedly, keeping the home fires burning. Torkoal digs for coal and burns it inside its shell, puffing out smoke from its nostrils. Affectionate and seasoned, you're the everyday, hands-on type who quietly keeps everyone warm, with the occasional grumpy cloud of steam.",
  "Spoink": "You have to keep bouncing, or your heart might stop. Spoink's spring-loaded tail keeps it hopping constantly, because the bounce keeps its heart beating. Quick and intuitive, a little moody, you're the city-dweller who just can't sit still.",
  "Grumpig": "You've got a strange, rhythmic way of doing things, and it works. Grumpig dances to boost its psychic power, using black pearls to focus its mind. Thoughtful and grounded, a bit moody and guarded, you're the everyday mystic who keeps a quiet routine.",
  "Spinda": "No two of you are ever quite the same. Spinda's spots are unique to every individual, and it stumbles around in a dizzy dance. That charming wobble in your step makes you stand out in any crowd.",
  "Trapinch": "You dig a hole and wait for the world to come to you. Trapinch builds sand pits and waits for prey to slip in, and you're the patient, light-hearted person who knows how to bide your time. Good-natured and bold, you're happiest in the warm outdoors.",
  "Vibrava": "You're still learning to use your wings, but you're doing it with style. Vibrava's wings aren't fully developed, so it vibrates them to make sound waves instead. Any day now, those half-grown wings are going to carry you somewhere amazing.",
  "Flygon": "You're the spirit of the desert, and you've got a beautiful song. Flygon whips up sandstorms with its wings and sings a melody that sounds like a woman's song. Friends who've seen you fly say it's like watching the desert itself take off.",
  "Cacnea": "You're prickly, but you've got a flower blooming inside you. Cacnea lives in the desert and only blooms once a year, releasing a sweet scent. Wait long enough and you'll catch the one day a year you bloom.",
  "Cacturne": "You're a night owl who loves the quiet. Cacturne stands perfectly still in the desert during the day and only moves at night. When night falls and the desert cools, that's when you quietly come alive.",
  "Swablu": "You've got cotton candy wings, and you love cleaning up. Swablu's wings are like fluffy clouds, and it uses them to polish dusty things. People can't help smiling back when they see you coming.",
  "Altaria": "You're a soothing presence, and you've got a beautiful voice. Altaria hums a sweet melody that calms anyone who hears it, and you're the affectionate, thoughtful person who makes everyone feel safe. A bit moody and modest, you're quietly majestic.",
  "Mega Altaria": "Your cloud of calm suddenly becomes a dazzling display. Mega Altaria's wings puff up into a fluffy, sparkling cloud, and you're the ambitious, everyday person who becomes radiant when you transform. When it's time to perform, your voice fills the whole sky.",
  "Zangoose": "You've got a sharp mind, and you're always ready for a challenge. Zangoose's claws are incredibly sharp, and it's always looking for its rival, Seviper. Some rivalries define a life, and yours keeps you sharp.",
  "Seviper": "You're edgy, thoughtful and you hold a grudge. Seviper's tail blade drips with poison, and it's always ready to fight its rival, Zangoose. Adaptable and seasoned, you're not someone people want to cross twice.",
  "Lunatone": "You feel the pull of the moon, and you're quietly intuitive. Lunatone is said to be a meteorite that fell from space, and it becomes active during the full moon. Full moons are your favourite nights, and you're at your most thoughtful under them.",
  "Solrock": "You soak up the sun, and you're full of warm, hands-on energy. Solrock is said to be a meteorite that fell from space, and it draws its power from sunlight. Bright days charge you up, and you share that warmth with anyone nearby.",
  "Barboach": "You're slippery, and you're always finding a way out. Barboach's body is covered in a slimy film that makes it hard to catch, and you're the light-hearted, affectionate person who's always slipping out of trouble. Nobody's caught you yet, and honestly, they probably never will.",
  "Whiscash": "You're calm, cool and you've got a big presence. Whiscash can sense earthquakes before they happen, and it guards its pond fiercely. Whenever something big is about to happen, you're the first to feel the rumble.",
  "Corphish": "You're scrappy, and you'll survive anywhere. Corphish was brought in from abroad and adapted to live in any water, even dirty canals, and you're the hands-on, city-minded person who thrives in any environment. Steady and grounded, you're always ready for a pinch.",
  "Crawdaunt": "You're the boss of your pond, and you know it. Crawdaunt's claws are incredibly powerful, and it drives other Pokémon out of its territory. Other Pokémon move out when you move in, and you're quietly fine with that.",
  "Baltoy": "You spin on one foot and somehow never fall over. Baltoy was found in ancient ruins and moves by twirling, and you've got the same odd, grounded balance. Friendly but guarded, a little moody, you trust your gut and you're happiest out among old stones and open sky.",
  "Claydol": "You're an ancient soul who prefers your own counsel. Claydol is said to have been brought to life by a mysterious light shining on clay figurines, and it floats about with arms that aren't attached to anything. Thoughtful and independent, you're steady as bedrock and hard to read.",
  "Lileep": "You've been waiting a very long time for the right moment, and you're in no hurry. Lileep clung to rocks on the sea floor a hundred million years ago, using its petals to catch prey. Calm and down-to-earth, you're quietly fascinating to anyone who takes the time to look.",
  "Cradily": "You hold on, and you hold on well. Cradily anchors itself to rocks so the tide can't drag it away, and you're the steady, tireless sort who weathers every storm. Bright, outdoorsy and hands-on, you're a rock-pool of a person: unglamorous at first glance, full of life up close.",
  "Anorith": "You're small, ancient and quietly brave. Anorith swam in primeval seas, using the claws on its sides to catch prey. Hands-on and compact, you're a bit moody about the modern world, but you'll bravely scuttle into it all the same.",
  "Armaldo": "You crawled out of the sea and decided land was yours now. Armaldo was one of the first Pokémon to leave the ocean, and its armour has kept it safe ever since. Tough and level-headed, you love being outdoors, and your light-hearted side surprises people who only see the plating.",
  "Feebas": "You don't think you're special, and you're very wrong about that. Feebas is famously scruffy and overlooked, but with care it transforms into the most beautiful Pokémon in the world. Quick, thoughtful and light-hearted, you're young and full of a potential that nobody has quite spotted yet.",
  "Milotic": "You calm storms just by being there. Milotic is said to soothe angry hearts and end fighting with its beauty, and you're the cool, good-natured presence who brings everyone down from the boil. Thoughtful and adaptable, you've grown into yourself gracefully, and it shows.",
  "Castform": "Your mood depends entirely on the weather, and you're not apologising for it. Castform changes form with the sun, rain and snow, and your outfits and feelings shift just as visibly. Light-hearted, bold and good-natured, you bring a different forecast every day.",
  "Kecleon": "You blend in so well that people forget you're there, until you want them to notice. Kecleon changes colour to match its surroundings, except for the zigzag on its belly. Sweet and approachable, you're seasoned at reading a room and more colourful than you let on.",
  "Shuppet": "You feed on grudges, and you know how to help people let them go. Shuppet is drawn to feelings of envy and resentment and eats them up. Hands-on and a bit mischievous, you're cool-headed in tense situations, and you leave a place lighter than you found it.",
  "Banette": "Once you've been thrown away, you never quite forget it. Banette is a discarded puppet brought to life by a grudge, searching for the child who abandoned it. You've turned a painful past into an unapologetic, hands-on sense of self.",
  "Mega Banette": "When you finally unzip, all your stored-up energy pours out. Mega Banette's zipper opens to release a cursed power it has been holding in, and you're the seasoned, mischievous type whose transformation is unforgettable. Bold and hands-on, you've turned old hurts into strength.",
  "Duskull": "You drift about at night, and you keep your own counsel. Duskull wanders the dark and is said to chase naughty children who won't go to bed. Independent and a little spooky, you're surprisingly approachable, but there's a cool, moody streak that keeps people guessing.",
  "Dusclops": "You've got a single, piercing eye for the truth. Dusclops absorbs anything into its hollow body, and its gaze is said to freeze people in their tracks. City-minded and hands-on, you're young at heart, a bit moody, and refreshingly honest.",
  "Tropius": "You've got fruit growing round your neck, and you're very generous with it. Tropius shares its delicious bananas with children, and you're the bright, affectionate one who always brings snacks. Free-spirited and outdoorsy, you're unhurried and warm in every sense.",
  "Chimecho": "Your voice carries a long way, and it's gentle. Chimecho's cries echo inside its hollow body and create a soothing melody that changes with the wind. Thoughtful and seasoned, a little moody, you're intuitively attuned to the feelings of those around you.",
  "Mega Chimecho": "You ring out loudly when you're needed. Mega Chimecho's bell grows bigger and its voice becomes powerful enough to protect its friends. When you ring out, every friend within earshot comes running.",
  "Absol": "You can sense trouble coming, and you're there to warn people. Absol appears before disasters to alert others, but people often mistake it for the cause. Independent and hands-on, you're light-hearted and bright, and you've learned not to take people's misunderstandings to heart.",
  "Mega Absol": "You get your wings when you're at your most protective. Mega Absol grows wing-like fur that boosts its senses, and you're the everyday, unhurried person who becomes radiant when the people you love need you. You're loyal and transformative, quietly heroic.",
  "Mega Absol Z": "When disaster's coming, you don't just warn people: you sprint to them. Mega Absol Z takes on a ghostly edge and moves faster than ever, and you're the seasoned, independent sort who turns worry into quick, decisive action. Bright and light-hearted day to day, you're a guardian who never stops to be thanked.",
  "Wynaut": "You're cheerful, tough and very, very patient. Wynaut gathers in groups and squeezes up against each other to sleep in caves, and it endures hits with a cheerful smile. There's an intuition in you that seems far older than your years.",
  "Snorunt": "You show up when it snows, and people take it as good luck. Snorunt is said to visit homes in snowy regions, and families that it stays with prosper. Families invite you in for the winter, and they always feel luckier for it.",
  "Glalie": "You're a solid, frosty presence, and you've been around a while. Glalie's body is made of ice that never melts, and it can freeze moisture in the air in an instant. Steady and grounded, cool-headed and genuine, you keep things calm in even the busiest city.",
  "Mega Glalie": "You're usually steady and calm, until you crack open. Mega Glalie's jaw breaks apart, unleashing an icy power it can't fully contain, and you're the seasoned, grounded person whose transformation is genuinely startling. Approachable and cool, you're secretly a blizzard.",
  "Spheal": "You roll everywhere, and you're always grinning. Spheal can't walk well, so it rolls across ice floes to get around, and you're the bold, adaptable, youthful soul who finds a way to have fun on any terrain. Modest and grounded, you're a joy to watch.",
  "Sealeo": "You love to play with things, balancing them on your nose until you've mastered it. Sealeo spins and balances objects to learn about them, and you're the youthful, adaptable person who learns by doing. Ambitious and bold, you're always testing your limits.",
  "Walrein": "You've got huge tusks, and you protect your family fiercely. Walrein's tusks can shatter icebergs, and it uses its thick blubber to stay warm in freezing seas. Nobody threatens your herd while you're around, and nobody ever has.",
  "Clamperl": "You've got a beautiful pearl inside you, and you only show it to people you trust. Clamperl produces only one pearl in its lifetime, and it's said to boost psychic powers. Only the people you trust most ever get to see the pearl you're hiding.",
  "Huntail": "You live in the deep, and you've got a bit of a dangerous side. Huntail lures prey with its fish-shaped tail, then swallows them whole. Friends who've seen you in your element say the deep sea suddenly makes a lot more sense.",
  "Gorebyss": "You're elegant and beautiful, but there's a bite to you. Gorebyss's thin mouth can pierce the skin of its prey, and it lives in the deep, dark ocean. There's real grace in the way you move, and a quiet warning in it too.",
  "Relicanth": "You've been around for a hundred million years, and you've barely changed. Relicanth is a living fossil that has survived since ancient times, and you're the calm, adaptable person who stays true to yourself. The world keeps changing around you, and you keep calmly being yourself.",
  "Luvdisc": "You're always looking for love, and you're a romantic at heart. Luvdisc is said to bring eternal love to couples who find it, and it swims around reefs looking for its partner. Whoever finds you is lucky, because your love is the hopeful, forever kind.",
  "Bagon": "You're always trying to fly, even though you don't have wings yet. Bagon headbutts boulders and leaps off cliffs, dreaming of the day it'll take to the skies. Every leap off a cliff gets you a little closer to the sky.",
  "Shelgon": "You've wrapped yourself up in armour while you figure things out. Shelgon hides in a hard shell and barely eats, waiting for the moment it can finally fly. Inside that armour, something enormous is getting ready.",
  "Salamence": "You finally got your wings, and you're making the most of them. Salamence's dream of flying came true when it evolved, and it soars across the sky in celebration. Every flight still feels like a celebration, because you remember how long you waited for it.",
  "Mega Salamence": "You've got your wings, and when you transform, you become a crescent moon. Mega Salamence's wings fuse into a single shape that lets it soar at incredible speeds. Once you've got your wings, no ceiling holds you for long.",
  "Beldum": "You're a little magnet, always pulling yourself towards others. Beldum uses magnetic pulses to communicate with its friends, and it attaches itself to rocks to stay stable. One magnetic pulse from you, and suddenly everyone's connected.",
  "Metang": "You're two minds working as one. Metang is formed when two Beldum merge, and its brains work together to make it smarter and stronger. Two heads really are better than one, and you're the proof.",
  "Metagross": "You've got four brains, and you're a genius. Metagross's brains are connected by a complex nervous system, and it's smarter than a supercomputer. Your mind works like a supercomputer, with an edge nobody expects.",
  "Mega Metagross": "Your mind and body are perfectly in sync, and when you push, you push precisely. Mega Metagross folds its legs and floats, its four brains calculating every possible outcome. Quick, steady and warmer than your steely surface suggests, you solve problems the way a supercomputer would, with a bit more heart.",
  "Regirock": "You were built to stand firm, and you take that seriously. Regirock repairs its own body by finding rocks and pressing them on, and you're the down-to-earth type who quietly patches yourself up after every knock. Guarded and independent, you're the bedrock nobody notices until it's gone.",
  "Regice": "You keep a cool head even when everyone else is losing theirs. Regice's body is made of ancient ice that won't melt even in magma, and you've got that same unshakeable calm. Thoughtful and independent, you're slow to warm up, but your loyalty, once given, is permanent.",
  "Registeel": "You're harder than anyone gives you credit for, and you've stopped trying to prove it. Registeel's body is a metal that's been tempered underground for tens of thousands of years, and yet it's said to be hollow inside. Guarded, techy and a bit edgy, you protect the soft space you keep within.",
  "Latias": "You're quick to sense how people really feel, and you'd rather help than be seen. Latias can turn invisible by bending light and communicates with telepathy. Affectionate and thoughtful, you're quietly ambitious, and you show up at the exact moment you're needed, then vanish again.",
  "Mega Latias": "You love the city at night, flying high over its lights. Mega Latias's feathers turn purple and white, and it soars faster than a jet. Bright and affectionate, you're thoughtful and city-minded, and there's something legendary about the way you light up a room.",
  "Latios": "You'll fly a long way to look after someone you love. Latios only opens its heart to people with compassionate spirits, and it shares what it sees with its partner through telepathy. Thoughtful and intuitive, a bit moody, you're fiercely protective of your inner circle.",
  "Mega Latios": "You're thoughtful and affectionate, and when you transform, you become a rocket. Mega Latios's body becomes sleeker and its speed rises even higher, and you're the ambitious, legendary person who takes others along for the ride. Quick, soaring and quietly brilliant.",
  "Kyogre": "You've got the power to make it rain, and you're mostly very calm about it. Kyogre is said to have expanded the seas with its torrential downpours, then fallen into a deep sleep. Adaptable and good-natured, you're cool and calm, and you'd only unleash your full flood when the world truly needed it.",
  "Primal Kyogre": "When you return to your primal self, the skies open. Primal Kyogre unleashes endless rain and glows with ancient energy, and you're the calm, good-natured person whose transformation is a genuine force of nature. Adaptable and grounded, you change everything around you.",
  "Groudon": "You raise continents, metaphorically speaking. Groudon is said to have expanded the land by pushing up mountains with its might, and you're the bright, ambitious, outdoorsy person who builds things from scratch. Independent and tireless, you're warm in every sense.",
  "Primal Groudon": "When you transform, you dry up the oceans. Primal Groudon brings intense sunlight that evaporates the sea and glows with ancient power, and you're the ambitious, good-natured person whose primal side is unmistakable. Independent and outdoorsy, you're a true force of nature.",
  "Rayquaza": "You live high above everyone else's arguments, and you come down only to stop them. Rayquaza lives in the ozone layer and descends to calm Kyogre and Groudon when they clash. Free-spirited and bold, you're the authentic, legendary peacemaker people look up to.",
  "Mega Rayquaza": "You don't need a stone to power up, because you've got the drive within you. Mega Rayquaza transforms through sheer will and a deep connection to the skies. Free-spirited and quick-burning, you're the legendary sort whose power comes straight from your heart.",
  "Jirachi": "You make other people's wishes come true, and you're quietly brilliant. Jirachi wakes up for just seven days every thousand years and grants the wishes written on the notes attached to its head. Practical and tech-minded, you're bright and guarded, and you only show yourself when it matters.",
  "Deoxys": "You're a bit of an alien, and you're totally comfortable with it. Deoxys is said to have mutated from a virus that fell from space, and it can change its form at will. Bright and hands-on, you're bold and independent, and you're authentically yourself in every form you take.",
  "Deoxys (Attack Forme)": "You're all offence, and you know exactly where to strike. Deoxys (Attack Forme) sacrifices its defence for incredible attacking power, and you're the bold, hands-on person who throws everything into a single, decisive move. Independent and quick, you're a transformative force.",
  "Deoxys (Defense Forme)": "You're built like a shield, and you're the steady one in a crisis. Deoxys (Defense Forme) hardens its body to withstand any attack, and you're the guarded, independent person who protects yourself and others. Bright and hands-on, you're an alien fortress.",
  "Deoxys (Speed Forme)": "You're everywhere at once, and you never slow down. Deoxys (Speed Forme) sacrifices its power for incredible speed, and you're the quick, independent person who's always on the move. Bright and guarded, you're a blur of energy.",
  "Turtwig": "You've got a little garden growing on your head, and you look after it carefully. Turtwig's shell is made of hardened soil, and it soaks up sunlight through the leaf on its head. Light-hearted and loyal, you're tireless and warm-blooded, a bright little sprout of a person.",
  "Grotle": "You know where the clean water is, and you share it with friends. Grotle lives near lakes, and its shell often has fresh water flowing from it. Thoughtful and grounded, you're a little elusive, but you're tireless about looking after the people in your woodland circle.",
  "Torterra": "Whole communities could live on your back, and some do. Small Pokémon build nests on Torterra as it walks slowly through the forest. Down-to-earth and affectionate, you're the unhurried, hands-on person whose steady presence becomes a home for everyone around you.",
  "Chimchar": "Your fire never goes out, not even in the rain. Chimchar's tail flame is fuelled by gas from its belly, and it scampers up cliffs with ease. Rain, wind or a bad day: nothing puts out the little flame on your tail.",
  "Monferno": "You put on a show with your fiery tail, and you're good at it. Monferno uses its tail flame to make itself look bigger and more impressive in battle. People don't always expect the flair, but they're always impressed by it.",
  "Infernape": "You fight with your whole body and your whole heart. Infernape's crown of fire never goes out, and it uses every limb in its unique fighting style. The crown of fire never goes out, and neither does your fighting spirit.",
  "Piplup": "You're proud, even when you probably shouldn't be. Piplup refuses to accept food from anyone, preferring to do things its own way. Level-headed and grounded, you're bold and thoughtful, and your stubborn little streak makes people adore you.",
  "Prinplup": "You're a lone wolf, and you're very good at it. Prinplup prefers to live alone and fights fiercely to prove its strength. Seasoned and authentic, you're cool and calm, a bit edgy, and you're very much your own person.",
  "Empoleon": "You're the leader, and you've got the crown to prove it. Empoleon's three horns represent its strength, and the biggest one leads the colony. Level-headed and down-to-earth, you're bold and practical, and people naturally follow your lead.",
  "Starly": "You're small, but you're mighty in a crowd. Starly flocks together in huge numbers, and it's surprisingly fierce in a group. Warm and approachable, you're a bold, hands-on city bird who loves being part of something bigger.",
  "Staravia": "You're loyal to your flock, and you defend it fiercely. Staravia lives in forests in large groups and fights fiercely with other flocks. Sweet-natured and bright, you're a tireless, quick-witted city bird with a warm heart.",
  "Staraptor": "You're bold, independent and you never back down. Staraptor leaves its flock to live alone once it evolves, and it fights fearlessly against much bigger opponents. Nobody's ever doubted your courage, not even once.",
  "Mega Staraptor": "You're bold and independent, and when you transform, your fighting spirit takes over. Mega Staraptor's feathers sharpen and its body becomes more muscular. People who've seen your transformation still talk about it.",
  "Bidoof": "You're simple, sweet and endlessly loyal. Bidoof gnaws on wood to keep its teeth healthy, and it's surprisingly resilient despite its laid-back nature. Simple, steady and loyal, you've got a heart of gold and absolutely no pretence.",
  "Bibarel": "You build things, and you build them well. Bibarel constructs dams in rivers using mud and wood, and it's a skilled builder. Bold and seasoned, you're sweet-natured and calm, and your hands-on approach makes you invaluable to any team.",
  "Kricketot": "You've got a rhythm all your own, and you're a natural musician. Kricketot's antennae clink together like a xylophone, making a sound that's music to its ears. Your little xylophone tune is the soundtrack to every cosy evening.",
  "Kricketune": "You're a natural performer, and your music moves people. Kricketune plays melodies with its arms, and its songs can be heard throughout the forest. Good-natured and classic, you're unhurried and outdoorsy, and your music brings people together.",
  "Shinx": "You're full of youthful energy, and you're always sparking with excitement. Shinx's fur glows with electricity when it's in danger, helping it escape from trouble. There's a tech-loving spark in you that's only going to get brighter.",
  "Luxio": "You're strong and good-natured, and you've got a sharp mind. Luxio's claws release electricity strong enough to knock out opponents, and it lives in packs. Cool-headed but a bit edgy, you're always half a second from sparking into action.",
  "Luxray": "You can see through walls, and you're a natural detective. Luxray's eyes can see through solid objects to spot prey and danger. Nothing gets past that steady gaze, and the people you love feel safer for it.",
  "Budew": "You're still a bud, and you're waiting for the right moment to bloom. Budew is very sensitive to temperature changes, and it only opens its bud when the weather is warm. Wait for the sunshine, and you'll bloom into something lovely.",
  "Roserade": "You move like a dancer and you've got thorns hidden in your bouquet. Roserade lures foes with a sweet scent, then strikes with poison whips concealed in its flowers. Bright and practical, quick and thoughtful, you're elegant on the outside and very much nobody's pushover.",
  "Cranidos": "You lead with your head, literally. Cranidos headbutts trees and boulders until they topple, and you've got the same direct, youthful enthusiasm for knocking down obstacles. Affectionate with your people, level-headed between charges, you're a bulldozer with a soft spot.",
  "Rampardos": "Your skull is famously thick and you're secretly proud of it. Rampardos's headbutts can shatter anything, and you've got a down-to-earth, tireless way of ploughing through problems until they're gone. Calm and level-headed in between, you're warm-blooded and a little hard to read.",
  "Shieldon": "You hold your ground by facing problems head-on with your guard up. Shieldon's face is a natural shield and it never backs down from a frontal attack. Affectionate and loyal, you're a bit techy and quietly protective, and people feel safer standing behind you.",
  "Bastiodon": "You're a wall people lean on. Bastiodon line up side by side to protect their young, and nothing gets through. Seasoned and affectionate, you're a little moody, and you guard the people you love with total, unshakeable steadiness.",
  "Burmy": "You make your cloak from whatever's around you. Burmy builds a cloak out of leaves, sand or rubbish to protect itself from the cold. Bright and affectionate, you're unhurried and outdoorsy, and you're always adapting your style to fit your surroundings.",
  "Wormadam": "You've become one with your surroundings, and you're happy to stay put. Wormadam's cloak becomes a part of its body when it evolves, so it lives with whatever it chose forever. Thoughtful and seasoned, you're practical and good-natured, and you're content to grow where you're planted.",
  "Mothim": "You're a wanderer who's always looking for something sweet. Mothim flies around at night, stealing honey from Combee, and you're the bold, free-spirited person who's always on the move. Seasoned and hands-on, you're a bit of a night owl.",
  "Combee": "You work best in a team, and you're always buzzing with energy. Combee are formed from three bees, and they work together to collect honey for their queen. Bright and quick, you're youthful and grounded, and you're loyal to your hive.",
  "Vespiquen": "You're the queen of your hive, and you rule with grace. Vespiquen controls its Combee with pheromones and protects them fiercely. Your hive runs smoothly because everyone trusts you completely.",
  "Pachirisu": "You're fluffy, cheerful and absolutely buzzing with energy. Pachirisu stores electricity in its cheek pouches and shares its electric fur balls with friends. Underneath the guarded exterior, your heart is warm and completely buzzing.",
  "Buizel": "You're a natural swimmer, and you love to show off. Buizel spins its two tails like a propeller to swim fast, and you're the quick, approachable person who's always up for a race. Level-headed and city-minded, you've got a cheeky edge.",
  "Floatzel": "You're the lifeguard of your friend group. Floatzel's flotation sac lets it rescue drowning people by keeping them afloat, and you're the level-headed, affectionate person who keeps everyone above water. Calm in the water, sharp in a crisis, you're the person people want nearby when things go wrong.",
  "Cherubi": "You're small and sweet, and you're always growing towards the light. Cherubi's little ball holds nutrients that help it grow and evolve, and you're the bright, bold person who's always working on yourself. Light-hearted and ambitious, you're unhurried but always moving forward.",
  "Cherrim": "Your mood changes with the weather, and you're not afraid to show it. Cherrim keeps its petals closed when it's cloudy and opens them in the sun, revealing a cheerful face. On grey days you keep yourself folded up, but when the sun finally comes out, your smile is worth the wait.",
  "Shellos": "You change depending on where you are, and you're always adaptable. Shellos's colour changes depending on the sea it lives in, and it can regrow lost parts of its body. Good-natured and calm, you're grounded and tireless, and you fit in wherever you go.",
  "Gastrodon": "You're calm, adaptable and you've got a mysterious past. Gastrodon is said to have been covered in a shell long ago, and its body can regrow lost parts. Bold and grounded, you're cool and calm, a bit moody, and you always find your way home.",
  "Ambipom": "You've got two tails, and you're always busy with them. Ambipom's tails are so dexterous that it rarely uses its hands, and you're the hands-on, quick person who's always juggling something. Level-headed and sweet-natured, you're a bit guarded and moody, but always fun.",
  "Drifloon": "You float about looking for a hand to hold. Drifloon drifts in the wind and is said to try to carry children away, but it's really just looking for a friend. Light-hearted and bold, you're a bit mischievous, and you're secretly a soft, thoughtful soul.",
  "Drifblim": "You float through life, carrying people with you. Drifblim drifts silently at night, carrying people and Pokémon, and you're the bold, light-hearted person who takes others on adventures. Grab hold of your hand and you'll take them somewhere they never expected to go.",
  "Buneary": "You curl up your ears when you're feeling nervous, and you're always ready to spring into action. Buneary curls its ears up and lets them spring out when it's in danger. Those curled-up ears can spring out at any moment, along with a cheeky, independent streak.",
  "Lopunny": "You're glamorous, and you know how to make an entrance. Lopunny's ears are incredibly soft, and it uses them to sense danger. Guarded with strangers and warm with friends, you carry a city-dweller's elegance wherever you go.",
  "Mega Lopunny": "You're glamorous and affectionate, and when you transform, you become a fighter. Mega Lopunny's legs grow stronger and its fighting spirit awakens. Elegant at a glance, but get on the wrong side of you and those legs will make their point.",
  "Mismagius": "You've got a spell for every occasion. Mismagius's cries are said to be incantations that can bring happiness or misfortune, and you're the mischievous, bold person who knows how to work your magic. Some say your songs are curses, some say blessings; you're happy to keep them guessing.",
  "Honchkrow": "You're the boss, and your crew knows it. Honchkrow commands a flock of Murkrow, and it never forgives a mistake. Moody and grounded, you're a classic, natural leader who soars above the city with style.",
  "Glameow": "You're adorable when you want something, and you know it. Glameow purrs sweetly one moment and shows its claws the next, its curly tail swaying hypnotically. Light-hearted and approachable, you're a hands-on charmer whose big personality fills any room.",
  "Purugly": "You've claimed your spot on the sofa, and nobody's moving you. Purugly cinches its body with its tail to look bigger and will happily move into another Pokémon's nest. Affectionate in your own way, you're a classic, moody, impossible-to-ignore presence.",
  "Chingling": "You've got a little bell in your throat that rings when you're happy. Chingling makes a jingling noise whenever it moves, and you're the light-hearted, intuitive person who announces your arrival with joy. Thoughtful and level-headed, you're young and a little elusive.",
  "Stunky": "You've got a defence mechanism that nobody wants to test. Stunky sprays a foul-smelling liquid from its rear, and the smell lingers for days. Hands-on and approachable, you're a bit moody and edgy, and you're natural about protecting yourself.",
  "Skuntank": "You've got a reputation, and you're happy to keep people at arm's length. Skuntank sprays a stinky liquid from its tail that can reach over 160 feet. Affectionate with your inner circle, you're a moody, mischievous classic.",
  "Bronzor": "You've got ancient secrets etched on your back. Bronzor is found in ancient tombs, and its patterns are said to contain mysterious powers. Somewhere on your back, there's a pattern that has been telling the same story for thousands of years.",
  "Bronzong": "You're said to make it rain, and people worship you for it. Bronzong was believed to bring rain to farmers in ancient times, and its bell-like body rings with psychic power. People used to pray to you for rain, and honestly, you still look after everyone in the quiet ways that count.",
  "Bonsly": "You're crying, but it's not because you're sad. Bonsly's eyes leak water to regulate its body temperature, and it pretends to be a tree to avoid being noticed. Approachable and hands-on, you're a bit guarded, and you're always surprisingly tearful in the sun.",
  "Mime Jr.": "You copy everyone you meet, and you're a natural performer. Mime Jr. mimics the movements of others to confuse them, and it's always looking for an audience. Copy enough people and eventually you discover your own style.",
  "Happiny": "You carry a little stone around like it's an egg, and you care for it deeply. Happiny holds a round, white rock in its pouch, pretending it's an egg like its evolutions. The rock you carry is round and ordinary, and you care for it as tenderly as anyone has ever cared for anything.",
  "Chatot": "You'll repeat anything you hear, and you're a natural storyteller. Chatot can mimic human speech and uses its voice to communicate with others. Whatever you overhear, you'll repeat with gusto, so choose your words carefully around you.",
  "Spiritomb": "You're made up of 108 spirits, and you've got a lot going on. Spiritomb was bound to a keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago, and it has a mysterious, unsettling presence. Steady and grounded, you're natural and moody, and you're surprisingly warm-blooded for a ghost.",
  "Gible": "You love a cosy hole in a warm cave, and you've got a big bite. Gible lives in caves heated by geothermal energy, and it ambushes prey that comes too close. Hands-on and free-spirited, you're a bit elusive, and your little jaws pack a serious punch.",
  "Gabite": "You collect shiny things, and you've got a sharp eye for treasure. Gabite hoards sparkly objects in its nest, and it's known to shed its scales, which are said to be medicinal. Your nest is full of shiny treasures and you know exactly where each one came from.",
  "Garchomp": "You're fast, fierce and fly like a jet. Garchomp can fly at the speed of sound, and it's fiercely protective of its home. When you fly at full speed, it sounds like a jet engine, and it feels like freedom.",
  "Mega Garchomp": "You're fast and fierce, and when you transform, you become a living weapon. Mega Garchomp's arms grow into massive scythes, and it trades speed for incredible power. You trade a bit of speed for a lot of power when you transform, and it suits you.",
  "Mega Garchomp Z": "You're ambitious, bold and practical about your power. Mega Garchomp Z's speed and strength are refined into a sleek, practical form, and you're the level-headed, transformative person who knows exactly how to use your abilities. Thoughtful and quick, you're an unstoppable force.",
  "Munchlax": "You're always hungry, and you're always finding snacks. Munchlax hides food in its fur and eats about its own weight in food every day. Approachable and sweet-natured, you're grounded and a bit guarded, and you're always happy when there's food around.",
  "Riolu": "You can sense other people's feelings through their auras. Riolu reads the auras of others to understand their emotions and intentions. Quick and fiery, you're youthful and a bit moody, and you're always eager to learn.",
  "Lucario": "You're intuitive, loyal and you understand people deeply. Lucario can read the auras of others, allowing it to sense emotions and thoughts from a distance. Close your eyes near you and you'll still feel your aura: steady, unhurried and kind.",
  "Mega Lucario": "Your intuition is sharper than ever when you transform. Mega Lucario's aura becomes so strong that it can see through anything, and you're the affectionate, ambitious person who levels up when it matters. Bold and fiery, you're unhurried and transformative.",
  "Mega Lucario Z": "You're bold and fiery, and when you transform, you're incredibly quick. Mega Lucario Z's aura becomes even more refined and focused, allowing it to strike with lightning speed. Once you've locked onto the right path, nobody moves faster than you.",
  "Hippopotas": "You cover yourself in sand to stay safe, and you're happiest in the desert. Hippopotas lives in dry, sandy areas and coats its body in sand to protect itself from germs. Coated in sand and perfectly content, you'll happily nap through the hottest afternoon.",
  "Hippowdon": "You're big, sandy and you've got a sharp edge. Hippowdon blasts sand from its body to create sandstorms, and it can open its mouth incredibly wide. When you open your mouth wide and yawn, the whole room knows exactly who's in charge.",
  "Skorupi": "You're small, but you've got a powerful grip. Skorupi buries itself in sand and ambushes prey with its claws, which can lock onto targets. Small as you are, your grip is unshakeable, and so is your sense of mischief.",
  "Drapion": "You've got a tough shell and a grip nobody escapes. Drapion can crush a car with its arms, and it rotates its head to watch every direction at once. Quick, steady and a bit moody, you guard your corner of the world with everyday vigilance, and there's mischief in your watchfulness.",
  "Croagunk": "Your laugh is half the reason people like you. Croagunk puffs out its cheeks and croaks a cackle that's oddly infectious, while hiding a poison jab in its knuckles. Thoughtful and bold, you love a cheeky moment, and you'd make friends at a funeral.",
  "Toxicroak": "You keep your best moves hidden until the perfect moment. Toxicroak's knuckle claws carry poison, and it sizes up opponents with its croaking throat sac before striking. Hands-on and bold, you're a city fighter with a surprisingly affectionate side for your crew.",
  "Carnivine": "You've found your spot, and you're happy hanging there. Carnivine dangles from trees in swamps and waits for prey to come close, then traps it in its jaws. Light-hearted and grounded, you're seasoned enough to know that the right opportunity always drifts by eventually.",
  "Finneon": "You glow brighter when things get dark. Finneon's fins shine in the deep sea to lure prey and attract friends, and your energy draws people to you at just the right moment. Young and quick, a little edgy, you're natural and at home anywhere in the city's currents.",
  "Lumineon": "You shine on the ocean floor where no one else bothers to look. Lumineon lives deep in the sea, its fins glowing to light up the darkness. Seasoned and adaptable, cool and a bit moody, you're quietly beautiful in places most people never visit.",
  "Mantyke": "You're always looking for someone to swim alongside. Mantyke follows Remoraid around, and when they swim together it evolves into Mantine. Bright and practical, you're a classic little companion who keeps your guard up until you've found your swimming buddy.",
  "Snover": "You love the first snowfall more than anyone. Snover lives on snowy mountains and gathers near people when the season changes, and its berries ripen in the cold. First snowfall of the year is your favourite day, and you make sure everyone gets outside for it.",
  "Abomasnow": "You bring the blizzard, and you're happiest in it. Abomasnow creates snowstorms to hide itself and lives on mountaintops covered in snow, and you're the classic, modest giant of your circle. Bold and thoughtful, you take your time and never rush.",
  "Mega Abomasnow": "You're usually modest and thoughtful, but when you transform, you're unforgettable. Mega Abomasnow becomes a towering, icy behemoth, its body covered in sharp icicles. Ambitious and a bit edgy when transformed, you turn a snowy peak into a monument.",
  "Weavile": "You're quick, clever and always one step ahead of everyone else. Weavile leaves strange carvings in trees to communicate with others in its pack, and it's incredibly cunning. Bold and mischievous, you're a seasoned city slicker who knows how to work the system.",
  "Magnezone": "You're the brains of the operation. Magnezone was formed when Magneton was exposed to a special magnetic field, and it acts like a giant antenna. Thoughtful and ambitious, you're affectionate and grounded, and you're always tuned into the bigger picture.",
  "Lickilicky": "You explore the world with your tongue, and you're not shy about it. Lickilicky's tongue is incredibly long and dexterous, and its saliva can dissolve anything. Bright and ambitious, you're grounded and independent, and you're always curious about what's next.",
  "Rhyperior": "You've got rocks in your arms, and you're not afraid to use them. Rhyperior shoots rocks from its palms, and its armour can withstand volcanic heat. Nobody threatens your crew while you're around; they've learned that the hard way.",
  "Tangrowth": "You've got so many vines that you never stop growing. Tangrowth's vines grow back as soon as they're cut, and you're the level-headed, down-to-earth person who always recovers. Cut you back and you'll just grow again, a bit moodier but no less strong.",
  "Electivire": "You're happiest when you're plugged in. Electivire's tails can deliver huge electric shocks, and it's drawn to power stations. Affectionate and authentic, you're hands-on and city-minded, and you're always buzzing with tech-minded enthusiasm.",
  "Magmortar": "You're a walking volcano, and you've got fire in your heart. Magmortar fires fireballs from the cannon-like arms on its body, and it lives in volcano craters. Down-to-earth to the core, you'd still never say no to a bit of volcano.",
  "Togekiss": "You bring happiness wherever you go, and you're always spreading joy. Togekiss is said to only appear to people who respect each other and don't fight. Affectionate and bright, you're city-minded and everyday, and you're a gentle peacemaker.",
  "Yanmega": "You can carry an adult on your back, and you're fiercely loyal. Yanmega's wings beat so fast it can fly with heavy loads, and its compound eyes see everything. Affectionate and thoughtful, you're practical and authentic, and you're a quiet, moody force.",
  "Leafeon": "You're a calm, natural presence, and you're always growing. Leafeon photosynthesises like a plant, and its body releases clean air. Light-hearted and gentle, you'll still slice through nonsense with a single leaf.",
  "Glaceon": "You're cool, calm and you've got a sharp mind. Glaceon can control its body temperature to freeze its fur into sharp needles. People think you're aloof, until they realise your quiet coolness is the calmest place in the room.",
  "Gliscor": "You hang upside down, and you see the world differently. Gliscor sleeps hanging from trees by its tail, and it glides silently through the night. Upside down from a branch at night, you see the world from an angle nobody else bothers with.",
  "Mamoswine": "You've survived the ice age, and you're tough as nails. Mamoswine is said to have lived 10,000 years ago, and its tusks are made of ice. Affectionate and level-headed, you're cool and calm, a bit edgy, and you're a timeless survivor.",
  "Porygon-Z": "You've been upgraded, and you're a little bit glitchy. Porygon-Z's software was modified to travel to other dimensions, but it started acting strangely. The glitches are part of the charm, and frankly they make you more interesting than the original.",
  "Gallade": "You protect people, and you've got blades for arms. Gallade's elbows extend into swords, and it's a master of chivalry. Hands-on and guarded, you're intuitive and warm-blooded, and you'll always fight for what's right.",
  "Mega Gallade": "Your chivalry turns into something spectacular when you're needed. Mega Gallade's blades lengthen and a flowing cape trails behind it as it fights to protect others. Seasoned and good-natured, you read situations intuitively, then step in with natural, hands-on courage.",
  "Probopass": "You keep everyone pointing the right way. Probopass's big magnetic nose always faces north, and it controls three tiny 'Mini-Noses' that wander off and come back. Thoughtful and guarded, you're the techy, outdoorsy organiser whose steadiness keeps the whole crew on course.",
  "Dusknoir": "You're the one who guides people through their darkest moments. Dusknoir is said to lead lost spirits to the afterlife using the antenna on its head. Seasoned and honest, a bit moody, you're the hands-on friend who walks with people through hard times without flinching.",
  "Froslass": "You're graceful and a little bit haunting. Froslass is said to be the spirit of a woman lost on a snowy mountain, and it freezes its favourite things to keep them forever. Thoughtful and modest, you're quick and practical, and you keep a cool calm that some find enchanting.",
  "Mega Froslass": "Behind your light-hearted wave is an ambition people don't see coming. Mega Froslass's icy kimono grows elaborate and its frost turns fierce, and you're the everyday sweetheart who becomes surprisingly formidable when protecting what you love. Guarded but warm, you keep a few treasures frozen safely in your heart.",
  "Rotom": "Every gadget in your house has a bit of your personality in it. Rotom is a spark of plasma that slips into appliances and makes them do its bidding, usually just for fun. Quick and bold, you're the bright city kid who rewires things to see what happens.",
  "Fan Rotom": "You're a breath of fresh air, especially when the mood gets stuffy. Fan Rotom slips into an electric fan and whips up gusts, and you're great at blowing tension out of a room. Light-hearted and techy, you've got the odd sulk, but you're always good company.",
  "Frost Rotom": "You keep everything fresh and you don't lose your cool. Frost Rotom hides in a fridge and blasts chilly air, and you're the calm, practical one who stops things going off. Bright but a bit guarded, you're happiest keeping the household humming along.",
  "Heat Rotom": "You warm things up in under a minute. Heat Rotom takes over a microwave and zaps the room with heat, and you're the cosy, quick-witted person who livens up any gathering. Bright and thoughtful, you protect yourself a little, but you're warm all the way through.",
  "Mow Rotom": "You like a tidy lawn and a tidier life. Mow Rotom possesses a lawnmower and trims everything into neat shape, and you're the quietly organised friend who keeps chaos in check. Warm-blooded but cool in style, you're thoughtful and steady, and nothing grows wild on your watch.",
  "Wash Rotom": "You can get any stain out, metaphorical or otherwise. Wash Rotom possesses a washing machine and sends out jets of water, and you're the calm, practical type who helps friends clean up their messes. Thoughtful and a bit guarded, you leave things better than you found them.",
  "Uxie": "You keep your eyes closed, but your mind sees everything. Uxie is said to have given people the gift of knowledge, and it keeps its eyes shut because a glance could erase someone's memories. Bright and light-hearted, you're tireless in your curiosity and a careful guardian of what you know.",
  "Mesprit": "You feel everything, and you teach others how to feel too. Mesprit is said to have given people joy and sorrow, and it flies about the world while its body sleeps in a lake. Intuitive and bright, you're light-hearted and guarded, and your empathy runs very deep.",
  "Azelf": "Your willpower is legendary in your circle. Azelf is said to have given people the strength to act, and it sleeps at the bottom of a lake to keep the world in balance. Bold and good-natured, you're ambitious and light-hearted, and you never give up once you've decided.",
  "Dialga": "Time seems to bend around you. Dialga is said to make time flow simply by its heart beating, and you're the seasoned, independent soul who's always on schedule. Your timing is legendary, and you're light-hearted enough not to make a big deal of it.",
  "Dialga (Origin Forme)": "You've shed the armour others gave you and returned to who you really are. Dialga (Origin Forme) is its true shape, revealed when the Adamant Crystal unlocks it. Independent and techy, you're light-hearted even when transformed, and you keep your own time.",
  "Palkia": "You're always making room for more. Palkia is said to control space itself, and it lives in a gap between dimensions. Somehow you always make the impossible feel spacious.",
  "Palkia (Origin Forme)": "You've thrown off what was holding you back. Palkia (Origin Forme) is revealed when the Lustrous Globe unlocks its original shape, and it stands on four legs like a winged steed. Guarded and free-spirited, you're ambitious but light-hearted, and you're at your best when you're unbound.",
  "Heatran": "You can walk on ceilings and you live inside a volcano. Heatran's body is made of rugged steel, and its feet cling to walls and ceilings in volcanic caves. Even from the depths of a volcano, your warmth reaches the people you love.",
  "Mega Heatran": "You've been simmering for a long time, and now you erupt. Mega Heatran's magma boils over into a molten fury, and you're the affectionate, thoughtful person whose transformation is impossible to ignore. Moody but deeply loyal, you burn bright.",
  "Regigigas": "You're a gentle giant who once dragged continents into place. Regigigas is said to have towed landmasses with ropes, then fallen asleep for millennia. Sweet-natured and ambitious, you're good-natured to everyone, and once you get going, nobody can stop you.",
  "Giratina": "You live just on the other side of normal, and you're quietly okay with that. Giratina was banished to the Distortion World, where gravity and time behave strangely. Reality looks a little different from where you stand, and that's exactly why people value your view.",
  "Giratina (Origin Forme)": "Free from the rules, you take your true shape. Giratina (Origin Forme) emerges in the Distortion World, its wings turning into shadowy tendrils. Down-to-earth and adaptable, you're moody and transformative, and you thrive when you can be your weird, authentic self.",
  "Cresselia": "You help people sleep better at night. Cresselia's feathers are said to bring sweet dreams to whoever holds them, and it flies over the sea on crescent-moon nights. Bright and affectionate, you're a calming presence who brings light to the darkest hours.",
  "Phione": "You always find your way back home. Phione drifts on warm sea currents, but it always returns to where it was born. Wherever the current takes you, you'll always find your way back to the people you came from.",
  "Manaphy": "You can make friends with anyone, almost instantly. Manaphy has the power to swap hearts with others and bond with any creature, and it swims huge distances to return to where it was born. Practical and quietly ambitious, you're a bit moody, but you connect with people on a level that feels almost magical.",
  "Darkrai": "People misunderstand you, and you've learned to live with it. Darkrai is blamed for nightmares, but it's said to cause them only to protect itself, and it prefers to keep away from others. Thoughtful and independent, you're mischievous and authentic, and you'd rather be alone than be fake.",
  "Mega Darkrai": "When you finally step out of the shadows, the whole night shifts. Mega Darkrai's darkness deepens into something regal and overwhelming, and you're the thoughtful, independent soul whose full self is breathtaking. Moody and ambitious, you're a legend nobody fully understands.",
  "Shaymin": "You turn barren places green. Shaymin dissolves pollution in the air and blooms flowers wherever it rests, and you're the bright, hands-on person who makes every space feel alive. Affectionate and outdoorsy, you're quick to spring into action when something needs nurturing.",
  "Arceus": "You're said to have made the universe, and you're surprisingly sweet about it. Arceus is believed to have created the world with its thousand arms, then went into a long sleep. Bright and light-hearted, you're independent and natural, and you carry a quiet, legendary kindness.",
  "Victini": "You bring luck to anyone who shares your energy. Victini creates limitless energy and gives it to others, ensuring victory for its partner. Bright and intuitive, you're grounded and fiery, and you're the lucky charm everyone wants on their team.",
  "Snivy": "You're cool, composed and a bit aloof until someone earns your trust. Snivy photosynthesises through its tail, and it moves faster when it's in the sunshine. Level-headed and affectionate, you're youthful and outdoorsy, and your guard comes down only for the worthy.",
  "Servine": "You slip through the undergrowth like a shadow. Servine moves quickly through dense foliage, evading attacks, and it uses its leaves to deflect strikes. Seasoned and modest, you're light-hearted and outdoorsy, and you're quick to escape when you've had enough.",
  "Serperior": "You can stop someone in their tracks with a single look. Serperior's glare is said to paralyse its opponents, and it only uses its full power against strong enemies. Grounded and adaptable, you're warm-blooded and affectionate, and you carry yourself with effortless elegance.",
  "Tepig": "You're small, warm and full of hearty good cheer. Tepig blows fireballs from its snout and loves to eat roasted berries. Light-hearted and good-natured, you're a bit edgy and city-minded, and you're tirelessly loyal to the people you love.",
  "Pignite": "You've got a fire in your belly, and you never stop eating. Pignite's body temperature rises when it eats, and it charges at enemies with fiery tackles. Your appetite for life, and for second helpings, is enormous.",
  "Emboar": "You're a legendary fighter with a heart of gold. Emboar's fiery beard grows hotter when it fights, and it's fiercely loyal to its friends. That fiery beard is impressive, but it's your loyalty that people remember.",
  "Mega Emboar": "You're fiercely loyal, and when you transform, you become a raging inferno. Mega Emboar's fiery beard and body blaze with renewed power. Affectionate and good-natured, you're a hands-on, transformative force who's always ready to protect your people.",
  "Oshawott": "You're a little hero in training, and you always carry your trusty shell. Oshawott fights with the scalchop on its belly, which it uses as a weapon and a tool. Scalchop in hand, you're ready for any adventure that comes floating by.",
  "Dewott": "You've mastered the art of the double sword. Dewott fights with two scalchops, using them like swords to slice through enemies. Hours of practice have made your two-blade style look effortless.",
  "Samurott": "You're a noble warrior with a calm, steady presence. Samurott's armour is made of hardened shells, and it can draw its swords at incredible speed. Affectionate and thoughtful, you're cool and calm, a classic leader who's always ready to defend your people.",
  "Hisuian Samurott": "You've been toughened by a harsh world, and you've got a sharp edge. Hisuian Samurott uses its seashell blade and its dark arts to overwhelm enemies. Thoughtful and calm, you're edgy and seasoned, and your past has made you a formidable force.",
  "Patrat": "You're always on lookout duty, and you never miss a thing. Patrat stores food in its cheeks and keeps watch for intruders. Bold and modest, you're sweet-natured and hands-on, and you're a reliable, youthful presence.",
  "Watchog": "Your eyes glow in the dark, and you're always watching. Watchog's eyes shine with light, allowing it to see in total darkness. Level-headed and approachable, you're a bit moody and hands-on, and you're a reliable, warm-toned guardian.",
  "Lillipup": "You can sense when someone's upset, and you're always there to comfort them. Lillipup's fur is like a radar, helping it sense its surroundings. Light-hearted and approachable, you're a bit moody and guarded, and you're a loyal, warm-toned friend.",
  "Herdier": "You've got a cape of fur and a heart full of loyalty. Herdier's black fur grows like a cape, and it never disobeys its trainer. Sweet-natured and hands-on, you're the reliable friend who herds everyone home after a night out, cheerful and a touch hard to read.",
  "Stoutland": "You're the wise old dog of your friend group. Stoutland's long fur keeps it warm in the coldest mountains, and it's famous for rescuing people lost in snowstorms. Affectionate and unhurried, a bit moody, you're the comforting presence everyone wants nearby when things go wrong.",
  "Purrloin": "Your innocent face hides a cunning mind. Purrloin pretends to be cute so people let their guard down, then steals their things when they're not looking. Thoughtful and level-headed, you're a classic charmer who's always one move ahead.",
  "Liepard": "You move silently and gracefully, and nobody quite knows what you're thinking. Liepard's beautiful coat helps it blend into the shadows, and it vanishes without a sound. Mischievous and level-headed, you're edgy and elegant, with a stealthy charm.",
  "Pansage": "You share what you have, especially the good stuff. Pansage happily offers the leaves on its head to tired Pokémon, which are said to relieve stress. Bold and thoughtful, you're a bit moody, but you're always ready to help a friend in need.",
  "Simisage": "You've got a thorny tail and a sharp mind. Simisage's tail is covered in thorns that it uses to whip enemies, and it's surprisingly good-natured. There's a gentle soul under those thorns, if anyone's patient enough to find it.",
  "Pansear": "You've got a fiery tuft of hair, and you're always cooking up something good. Pansear's head tuft is incredibly hot, and it roasts berries with it. Whenever someone's cold or hungry, you'll toast them a berry with a grin.",
  "Simisear": "You're hot-headed, and you've got a sweet tooth. Simisear loves sweet things, and its tail flame burns brighter when it's eating. Hand you something sweet and your tail flame visibly doubles in size.",
  "Panpour": "You keep your tuft full of water, and you're always ready to share. Panpour's tuft holds nutrient-rich water, which it shares with plants to help them grow. There's always a bit of water in your tuft, ready to share with whatever needs it.",
  "Simipour": "You can fire water from your tail like a jet, and you're always ready to cool things down. Simipour's tail can shoot water at high pressure, and it lives in forests near water. Hot days are better with you around, because you always know how to cool things down.",
  "Munna": "You eat bad dreams, and you leave sweet ones behind. Munna releases a pink mist when it eats dreams, and the colour changes depending on the dream. Affectionate and intuitive, you're a bit edgy and grounded, and you're a loyal, dream-catching friend.",
  "Musharna": "You can make dreams come to life. Musharna releases a dream mist that shows what people are dreaming, and it lives near dreamers. Bright and intuitive, you're thoughtful and guarded, and you're a calming, dreamy presence.",
  "Pidove": "You're a city bird who's surprisingly loyal. Pidove gathers in parks and follows anyone who feeds it, and it's easily confused. Light-hearted and practical, you're a bit moody and steady, and you're always happy to see a friendly face.",
  "Tranquill": "You always know the way back home. Tranquill can fly back to its trainer from anywhere in the world, no matter how far. Drop you anywhere in the world and you'll find your way back to your people.",
  "Unfezant": "You're proud and beautiful, and you know how to fly fast. Unfezant's males have a vibrant crest, while females are faster flyers, and they're always proud of their looks. Affectionate and hands-on, you're bold and a bit moody, and you're a city-minded, soaring soul.",
  "Blitzle": "Your mane flashes like lightning when you're excited. Blitzle's mane stores electricity, and it flashes with light when it gets agitated. When you get excited, your mane flashes like a thunderstorm on the horizon.",
  "Zebstrika": "You're as fast as a lightning bolt, and you're a classic. Zebstrika gallops at incredible speeds, and its mane crackles with electricity. Affectionate and good-natured, you're edgy and practical, and you're a seasoned, electric soul.",
  "Roggenrola": "You can hear sounds that nobody else can. Roggenrola's body is like a giant ear, and it can sense vibrations through the ground. Listening closely to the ground, you hear things nobody else picks up.",
  "Boldore": "You're a gentle giant with glowing crystals. Boldore's crystals glow with energy, and it's very strong when it's fully charged. Bold and grounded, you're adaptable and warm-blooded, and you're a seasoned, outdoorsy soul.",
  "Gigalith": "You absorb the sun, and you're a walking powerhouse. Gigalith's crystals absorb sunlight to charge its energy, and it fires powerful beams from them. Bright and grounded, you're hands-on and adaptable, and you're a tireless force.",
  "Woobat": "You leave heart-shaped marks wherever you go. Woobat's nose is shaped like a heart, and it leaves heart-shaped marks on walls when it sticks to them. Light-hearted and intuitive, you're quick and edgy, and you're a city-minded, loving soul.",
  "Swoobat": "You give off a sound that makes people happy. Swoobat's heart-shaped nose emits sound waves that bring good luck and happiness to those who hear them. Affectionate and thoughtful, you're modest and moody, and you're an intuitive, soaring soul.",
  "Drilbur": "You spin your way through life, and you're always digging deeper. Drilbur spins its body to drill through the ground at high speeds. Bold and hands-on, you're moody and grounded, and you're always looking for the next hidden treasure.",
  "Excadrill": "You're a master miner, and you're always building tunnels. Excadrill's claws are as strong as steel, and it builds complex tunnel networks underground. Level-headed and bold, you're tech-minded and authentic, and you're a hands-on, tireless worker.",
  "Mega Excadrill": "You're a master miner, and when you transform, you become a living drill. Mega Excadrill's body becomes even stronger and more powerful, and its claws are incredibly sharp. Level-headed and bold, you're tech-minded and transformative, and you're a tireless digger.",
  "Audino": "You can hear how someone's really doing from their heartbeat alone. Audino's ear feelers pick up the faintest heart sounds, and it works in Pokémon Centres helping others heal. Modest and practical, independent but always on call, it's no wonder people feel better the moment you walk in.",
  "Mega Audino": "Your gentleness becomes almost angelic when you rise to the moment. Mega Audino's fur grows long and flowing, and its healing power turns fairy-bright. Behind that light-hearted calm sits a quiet ambition: you want to make everyone around you whole again.",
  "Timburr": "You carry a plank everywhere, just in case there's work to do. Timburr hauls square timber around to train, and it helps out on building sites. Warm-blooded and good-natured, there's nothing you enjoy more than a long day of honest graft followed by a big laugh with the crew.",
  "Gurdurr": "You've upgraded from wood to steel girders, and the gang knows you're serious. Gurdurr swings a metal beam that even a team of wrestlers can't budge. Seasoned and bold, with a bit of an edge, nobody on site works harder or complains less.",
  "Conkeldurr": "You've passed on what you learned, and now you lean on your experience. Conkeldurr uses concrete pillars like walking sticks and is said to have taught people how to make concrete. When you lose your temper it's rare and spectacular, but mostly you're a solid, steady craftsperson.",
  "Tympole": "Your voice carries further than anyone expects. Tympole communicates with friends using high-pitched vibrations only they can hear. Young, quick and a touch edgy, nothing makes you happier than a city full of friends to call out to.",
  "Palpitoad": "You hum with vibrations that can rattle a room. Palpitoad's bumps quiver to create sound waves strong enough to cause headaches. When you've got something to say, the whole pond feels it.",
  "Seismitoad": "One punch from you could shake the ground. Seismitoad's bumps vibrate its fists, adding extra power to its blows, and it uses the sound to communicate. Good-natured and calm, you're the outdoorsy tough guy everyone secretly wants to hang out with.",
  "Throh": "You've tied your belt, and you mean business. Throh wraps a belt of vines around itself to focus its mind, and it's an expert at throwing opponents. Guarded and warm-blooded, there's a fiery seriousness to the way you face down your rivals.",
  "Sawk": "You train alone in the mountains until your fists are as hard as stone. Sawk focuses its strength by tightening its belt, and it's a master of karate. Good-natured underneath the intensity, you bring a disciplined, fiery energy to everything.",
  "Sewaddle": "You make your own clothes, and you're proud of them. Sewaddle chews up leaves and sews them into a cosy outfit, and it's often used as a mascot by fashion designers. Warm and practical, a sunny little crafter, you're light-hearted about getting it perfect.",
  "Swadloon": "You wrap yourself up in warmth when it's cold. Swadloon covers itself in leaves to stay snug, and it's a nurturer that makes the forest healthier. Hands-on and a bit hard to reach, there's a quiet, cosy warmth to you once you let people in.",
  "Leavanny": "You're the ultimate crafter, making clothes for anyone who needs them. Leavanny cuts leaves with its sharp arms and sews them into clothes for its friends. Good-natured and warm-blooded, people adore the hand-made touch you bring to everything.",
  "Venipede": "You're small, but you've got a sting. Venipede's bite is highly toxic, and it uses its antennae to sense its surroundings. Behind the mischievous little grin, there's a down-to-earth soul who's always busy.",
  "Whirlipede": "You're curled up tight, preparing for something big. Whirlipede rolls itself up into a ball and spins around, and it's surprisingly fast. Seasoned and ambitious, nobody quite knows what you're planning, but it's bound to be something impressive.",
  "Scolipede": "You're fast, sharp and you've got a strong bite. Scolipede's claws are coated in poison, and it rushes at enemies at incredible speed. Bright and level-headed, there's a warm-blooded intensity to the way you get things done.",
  "Mega Scolipede": "When you transform, you become a living battering ram. Mega Scolipede's body becomes tougher and more armoured, and it's even more dangerous. Behind that steady exterior sits a mischievous mind, and nobody stands in your way for long.",
  "Cottonee": "You float wherever the wind takes you, and you're always happy. Cottonee drifts in the breeze, and its cotton is said to bring good luck. Affectionate and light-hearted, there's a soft, steady sweetness to you that people find irresistible.",
  "Whimsicott": "You're a little prankster who loves to cause mischief. Whimsicott slips through gaps and leaves cotton fluff everywhere it goes. Seasoned and ambitious, you love to make people smile with your playful, natural charm.",
  "Petilil": "Your leaves taste bitter, but they're good for you. Petilil's leaves are used to make medicine, and it loves a sunny spot. Affectionate and bright, nobody has a bigger heart in such a small, sunny package.",
  "Lilligant": "You've got a flower on your head, and you're a natural beauty. Lilligant's flower is said to bloom only if it's well cared for, and it's a symbol of elegance. Wherever you dance, the flowers seem to bloom a little brighter.",
  "Hisuian Lilligant": "Your rugged home turned you into a dancer with a fighting spirit. Hisuian Lilligant's powerful legs let it spin and leap across mountains. Bold and light-hearted, you've got an outdoorsy grace and a strong, grounded heart.",
  "Basculin": "You're a classic fish with a fiery temper. Basculin's red and blue stripes show its personality, and it's always ready to fight. Good-natured and adaptable, when you're riled up you've got a sharp, youthful bite.",
  "Hisuian Basculin (White-Striped)": "You've got a white stripe, and you're a little more relaxed than your relatives. Hisuian Basculin (White-Striped) is said to be gentler and more good-natured than other Basculin. Cool and calm, the place you grew up gave you a youthful, peaceful heart.",
  "Sandile": "You live in the sand, and you're always looking for a good place to bask. Sandile's eyes are protected by a dark membrane, and it buries itself to stay cool. Mischievous and level-headed, you've got a warm-toned, sunny soul.",
  "Krokorok": "You wear your sunglasses everywhere, and they're not just for show. Krokorok's eyes have a dark membrane that lets it see in the dark and protects it from the desert sun. Bold and a bit moody, there's a cool, tireless edge to the way you prowl the dunes.",
  "Krookodile": "You see further than anyone, and you're not afraid to bite. Krookodile's eyes can spot prey from miles away, and its jaws can crush a car. Level-headed but guarded, nobody gets past your edgy, everyday vigilance.",
  "Darumaka": "Your belly burns with fire, and you're always on the move. Darumaka's internal fire burns at over 1,000 degrees, and it tucks its limbs in to sleep. Warm-blooded and youthful, there's a fiery, hands-on spark to everything you do.",
  "Galarian Darumaka": "The cold made you, but it couldn't put your fire out. Galarian Darumaka's fire sac froze in the snowy climate, so it now stores ice instead. Cool and calm, your home gave you a frosty, youthful charm.",
  "Darmanitan": "You're a raging inferno, but you know how to find your calm. Darmanitan burns hot in battle, but it can enter a state of meditation when it's hurt. Affectionate and bright, there's a tireless, hands-on fire burning inside you.",
  "Galarian Darmanitan": "You love snowballs, and you're always ready for a fight. Galarian Darmanitan carries a giant snowball on its head, which it uses to throw at enemies. A snowball on your head, calm in your heart, and loyalty that never thaws.",
  "Galarian Darmanitan (Zen Mode)": "When you're angry, your ice turns to fire. Galarian Darmanitan (Zen Mode) has an inner fire that burns hotter when it's enraged, melting its icy shell. Bold and fiery, your cool, calm exterior hides a blazing core.",
  "Maractus": "You dance to keep yourself safe, and you're a natural survivor. Maractus dances to a rhythm with its maracas, and it lives in deserts where water is scarce. Even in the driest desert, you keep the beat going.",
  "Dwebble": "You carry your home on your back, and you're always looking for a new one. Dwebble lives inside a hollowed-out rock, and it hunts for new rocks when it outgrows the old one. Bright and good-natured, there's a down-to-earth sweetness in you that people find endearing.",
  "Crustle": "You carry the weight of the world on your back, and you never complain. Crustle carries a huge rock slab on its back, which it uses as a home and a shield. Seasoned and steady, your grounded resilience never fails you.",
  "Scraggy": "You've got your trousers pulled up high, and you're always ready for a scrap. Scraggy pulls its shed skin up to its neck like trousers, and it's always looking for a fight. Trousers pulled up high and head held higher, you're ready for anything.",
  "Scrafty": "You're the leader of your gang, and you protect them fiercely. Scrafty has a crest that grows longer the stronger it gets, and it protects its friends from danger. Authentic and independent, you've got a warm, city-minded loyalty.",
  "Mega Scrafty": "When you transform, you become the ultimate gang leader. Mega Scrafty's crest becomes bigger and its body more powerful. Independent and transformative, nobody's more loyal to the crew than you.",
  "Sigilyph": "You're a mystery, and you're always protecting something important. Sigilyph is said to guard ancient cities, and it flies in the same patterns it learned centuries ago. Intuitive and thoughtful, there's an elusive, timeless charm to you.",
  "Yamask": "You carry a mask of who you once were, and you cry when you look at it. Yamask holds a mask that reflects its past life, and it sometimes looks at it and weeps. Affectionate and a bit mischievous, there's a cool, moody melancholy to you.",
  "Galarian Yamask": "You carry a clay slab, and it's full of old grudges. Galarian Yamask's tail is a clay tablet inscribed with a curse, and it causes misfortune to those who touch it. Bright and a bit mischievous, the place you grew up gave you a sharp, haunting wit.",
  "Cofagrigus": "You protect your treasures, and you'll trap anyone who tries to steal them. Cofagrigus traps grave robbers inside its body, which is shaped like a golden coffin. Steady and grounded, people would be surprised by how bright and warm your soul is.",
  "Tirtouga": "You're an ancient soul, and you love a good swim. Tirtouga is said to have lived in prehistoric seas, and it could dive to great depths. Cool and calm, you're happiest in natural, outdoorsy places.",
  "Carracosta": "Your bite can crush rocks, and you're a powerful swimmer. Carracosta's jaws are strong enough to crush boulders, and it lives on land as well as in water. Level-headed and calm, there's a steady, hands-on strength in you.",
  "Archen": "You're trying to fly, and you'll get there one day. Archen is said to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon, but it couldn't fly, so it hopped from tree to tree. Bold and free-spirited, there's a youthful, warm-toned determination in everything you try.",
  "Archeops": "You finally learned to fly, and you're always running towards your next adventure. Archeops runs faster than it can fly, so it sprints to gain momentum for take-off. Every run-up ends in a leap, and every leap gets you a little closer to the sky.",
  "Trubbish": "You're made of rubbish, and you love the city. Trubbish was born from a bag of rubbish exposed to chemical waste, and it burps out toxic gas. Bright and approachable, there's a mischievous, city-minded spirit inside that bag.",
  "Garbodor": "You're made of trash, and you're proud of it. Garbodor absorbs rubbish to make new kinds of poison, and it lives in landfills. Affectionate and light-hearted, people love your authentic, mischievous energy.",
  "Gigantamax Garbodor": "When you go big, you turn rubbish into something truly spectacular. Gigantamax Garbodor's body grows into a towering pile of toys and junk, and it can shoot toxic gas. Dramatic and affectionate, there's a city-minded, mischievous energy to every pile you make.",
  "Zorua": "You're a master of disguise, and you love to play pranks. Zorua transforms into other people or Pokémon to trick people, and it's very curious. Thoughtful and warm-blooded, there's a modest, classic charm under every one of your disguises.",
  "Hisuian Zorua": "You carry the hurt of a harsh world, but it hasn't made you cruel. Hisuian Zorua was driven out by people, and it fuels its illusions with resentment, but at heart it's gentle and shy. Loyal and thoughtful, you shape-shift to protect yourself until someone kind earns your true face.",
  "Zoroark": "You'll weave a whole illusion to protect the people you care about. Zoroark disguises itself and its pack with illusions so convincing they fool entire towns. Seasoned and practical, a bit moody, you'd rather trick trouble away than face it head-on.",
  "Hisuian Zoroark": "You've been through grief, and it's made you deeply sweet. Hisuian Zoroark wields illusions born of the bitterness of lost Pokémon, but it's fiercely protective of the living. Bright and quick, people sense the softness hiding under all those shadows.",
  "Minccino": "Dust doesn't stand a chance near you. Minccino's tail sweeps away dirt, and it greets friends by brushing them with it. Sweet-natured and quick, a tidy home is your love language, and you'll clean up after anyone who needs a hand.",
  "Cinccino": "You've got silky fur and an unbeatable cleaning routine. Cinccino's white fur is coated in a special oil that repels dust and dirt. Affectionate and classic, a bit moody when things get messy, people trust you to make every room sparkle.",
  "Gothita": "You stare at things nobody else can see. Gothita gazes at invisible things and seems to be talking to someone who isn't there. Good-natured and classic, a little moody, the people who know you trust your strange, intuitive gaze.",
  "Gothorita": "You can see the stars in broad daylight. Gothorita uses its psychic power to control others and is said to see stars even during the day. Light-hearted and seasoned, a bit guarded, your sense of the cosmic draws people in.",
  "Gothitelle": "You see the future in the stars. Gothitelle's psychic power lets it see the movements of the stars and predict the future. Modest and thoughtful, it takes a while before you say what you see, but when you do, people listen.",
  "Solosis": "You live in your own little bubble, and you're perfectly happy there. Solosis's body is wrapped in a special liquid that protects it from harsh environments. Light-hearted and thoughtful, you're a small, edgy dreamer with a surprising intuition.",
  "Duosion": "Your mind is split in two, and both halves are thinking. Duosion's brain has divided into two, letting it think twice as fast. Steady and bright, your clever, cheerful thoughts somehow always land in the same place.",
  "Reuniclus": "Your brain is so powerful that it practically glows. Reuniclus's brain controls its arms, and its grip can crush a boulder. Bold and thoughtful, you'd rather keep your huge power to yourself than show it off.",
  "Ducklett": "You can swim faster than anyone, but you're still learning to fly. Ducklett dives underwater to hunt and paddles at an incredible speed. Light-hearted and practical, your tireless enthusiasm makes you a joy to be around.",
  "Swanna": "You're graceful in the water and elegant in the air. Swanna dances gracefully in the morning and flies away in the evening, its neck swaying. Affectionate and thoughtful, you carry yourself with a natural, modest poise.",
  "Vanillite": "You're cool, sweet and always a treat. Vanillite was formed from icicles bathed in morning sunlight, and it creates snow crystals with its breath. Calm and grounded, everyone's in a better mood with you around.",
  "Vanillish": "You're icy, sweet and you love the snow. Vanillish lives on snowy mountains and covers itself in ice crystals to protect itself. Steady and youthful, your cool-headed brightness makes city life a bit sweeter.",
  "Vanilluxe": "Two heads are better than one, and you're double the fun. Vanilluxe has two heads that sometimes argue, but it always ends up agreeing. Down-to-earth and calm, you're a practical, hands-on sweetheart with a lot of patience.",
  "Deerling": "Your coat changes with the seasons, and you love every one of them. Deerling's fur changes colour and scent depending on the season. Sweet-natured and approachable, you've got a tireless, youthful zest for each new chapter.",
  "Sawsbuck": "Your antlers change with the seasons, and you're a natural leader. Sawsbuck's antlers grow leaves and flowers depending on the time of year. Whatever the season, your herd follows you without question.",
  "Emolga": "You glide through the air and spark joy wherever you go. Emolga stores electricity in its cheeks and glides from tree to tree. Free-spirited and warm-blooded, you're a bright city-dweller with a techy spark.",
  "Karrablast": "You're scrappy, bold and full of energy. Karrablast spits a corrosive liquid and evolves when it trades with Shelmet. Light-hearted and hands-on, you'll gladly take on bigger challenges than anyone thinks you can handle.",
  "Escavalier": "You've got armour, and you're ready for battle. Escavalier took Shelmet's shell and turned it into armour, and it fights with a lance. Affectionate and guarded, there's a techy, outdoorsy chivalry to the way you look after your people.",
  "Foongus": "You look like a Poké Ball, and you love to play tricks. Foongus mimics Poké Balls to lure people close, and it releases spores when touched. Bold and bright, your cheeky sense of fun makes even the forest floor feel lively.",
  "Amoonguss": "You've got a hidden side, and it's a little mischievous. Amoonguss dances with its Poké Ball-like arms to lure prey, then releases poison spores. Bold and thoughtful, you're grounded and bright, and people never quite see your tricks coming.",
  "Frillish": "You float through the sea, and you're always looking for new friends. Frillish wraps its tentacles around prey and drags it to the bottom of the sea. Light-hearted and mischievous, you've got a youthful, cool-toned curiosity.",
  "Jellicent": "You've got a ghostly palace under the sea, and you're quietly protective of it. Jellicent is said to live in an underwater castle made of shipwrecks. Few people are invited into your underwater palace, but those who are never forget it.",
  "Alomomola": "Injured strangers somehow always find their way to you. Alomomola wraps hurt Pokémon in its fins and heals them with a special membrane, then sends them on their way. Seasoned and calm, you're the city's quiet, tireless nurse, and you never ask for thanks.",
  "Joltik": "You're tiny, but you're always buzzing. Joltik can't make its own electricity, so it climbs onto bigger Pokémon and soaks up their static. Bright and bold, you fizz with borrowed energy and turn it into something all your own.",
  "Galvantula": "You weave an electric web, and you're patient enough to wait for your moment. Galvantula spins a web that crackles with static, and anything that touches it gets a shock. By the time anyone notices your web, you've already planned three moves ahead.",
  "Ferroseed": "You hang onto the ceiling of caves and fire spikes when someone gets too close. Ferroseed sticks its spikes into cave walls and absorbs iron from the rock. Affectionate in your own prickly way, your quiet moodiness hides a warm, techy heart.",
  "Ferrothorn": "You've got iron thorns and a cool head. Ferrothorn's spikes are as hard as steel, and it clings to ceilings to drop down on intruders. Level-headed and guarded, you're a hands-on, adaptable defender of everything you care about.",
  "Klink": "You work best when you're in sync with someone else. Klink is made of two gears that turn together, and if they fall out of rhythm, it stops working. Bright and grounded, you're a quick, hands-on cog who keeps the city ticking.",
  "Klang": "You've got a big gear and a little gear, and they both have to work together. Klang spins its gears to launch the small one at enemies, then waits for it to come back. Affectionate and level-headed, there's a moody, techy rhythm to the way you work.",
  "Klinklang": "Your core is full of energy, and you're always in motion. Klinklang's red core charges up energy that it fires from its spikes. Good-natured and steady, you're the reliable, techy engine of any team.",
  "Tynamo": "You're tiny, but you're part of something huge. Tynamo swims in big groups and their combined electricity is as strong as a lightning bolt. Light-hearted and bright, you love the buzz of being in a crowd.",
  "Eelektrik": "You wrap people up in your warmth, and you're always ready to charge. Eelektrik coils around its prey and shocks it with the circular patterns on its body. Your warmth keeps everyone moving, with just enough spark to keep things lively.",
  "Eelektross": "You crawl out of the sea and pull yourself up by your suction cups. Eelektross can drag prey into the water with its sucker mouth. Affectionate but moody, people learn quickly that your bold, sparky nature can flare up fast.",
  "Mega Eelektross": "You've been through a lot of eras, and each one made you stronger. Mega Eelektross crackles with a power that surges up from deep within. Seasoned and city-minded, every version of you is more electric than the last.",
  "Elgyem": "You've got a big brain and a strange sense of curiosity. Elgyem is said to have come from a desert where a UFO crashed, and it can manipulate people's memories. Thoughtful and bold, there's an intuitive, otherworldly charm to the way you think.",
  "Beheeyem": "You can rewrite people's memories, but you'd rather keep them safe. Beheeyem flashes the lights on its fingertips to communicate and is said to manipulate memories. Bold and thoughtful, a little moody, people find you fascinating and slightly mysterious.",
  "Litwick": "You light the way, but you're also absorbing a bit of energy along the way. Litwick's flame is said to drain the life force of those it guides through dark places. Mischievous and calm, you're a small, warm-blooded light in the city's darkest corners.",
  "Lampent": "You show up just when someone's at their lowest. Lampent appears near hospitals, waiting for someone's spirit to leave its body. It's strange, but people at their lowest find your glow oddly comforting.",
  "Chandelure": "Your flames are hypnotic, and people can't look away. Chandelure's flames are said to absorb spirits, which it burns as fuel. Thoughtful and guarded, there's a practical calm to the way you light up the darkest room.",
  "Mega Chandelure": "When you transform, your flames become an elaborate, glowing chandelier. Mega Chandelure's flames grow brighter and more powerful, and its arms become even longer. Light-hearted and transformative, your cool, thoughtful elegance becomes truly radiant.",
  "Axew": "You've got tusks, and you use them to cut through anything in your way. Axew's tusks are said to regrow if they break, and it uses them to mark its territory. Level-headed and free-spirited, you're a quick, independent spark of determination.",
  "Fraxure": "You keep your tusks sharp, and you never stop practising. Fraxure sharpens its tusks on rocks, and its tusks are said to be as sharp as blades. Bold and good-natured, you've got a youthful, free-spirited dedication to getting better.",
  "Haxorus": "You've got the sharpest tusks around, and you're not afraid to use them. Haxorus's tusks are strong enough to cut through steel, and it protects its territory fiercely. Modest and level-headed, nobody would guess how fiercely independent you are.",
  "Cubchoo": "You've always got a runny nose, and you're a little bit adorable. Cubchoo's nose is always runny, and it sniffs its snot to use its Ice-type moves. Cool and calm, a bit elusive, there's a hands-on sweetness to the way you handle the cold.",
  "Beartic": "You're a giant polar bear, and you're cool, calm and collected. Beartic freezes its breath to make icy fangs and claws, and it swims in freezing seas. Bold and affectionate, you're a classic, hands-on protector of the cold north.",
  "Cryogonal": "You're a perfect snowflake, and no two of you are the same. Cryogonal is made of ice crystals and wraps its prey in chains of ice. Bold and thoughtful, you're a bright, steady presence in any city winter.",
  "Shelmet": "You've got a shell, but you're always ready to trade it for something better. Shelmet's shell protects it from attacks, and it evolves when it trades with Karrablast. Bright and practical, you're grounded and guarded, and you're always looking for the next upgrade.",
  "Accelgor": "You shed your shell and discovered you were fast. Accelgor left its armour behind and became one of the quickest Bug Pokémon around, wrapping itself in layers of membrane to stay hydrated. Bold and level-headed, you're living proof that letting go of protection can set you free.",
  "Stunfisk": "You lie flat in the mud and grin at anyone who steps on you. Stunfisk buries itself in mud and gives a jolt to whoever treads on it, then smiles. Light-hearted and seasoned, you're the unhurried friend whose odd sense of humour wins everyone over.",
  "Galarian Stunfisk": "You set a trap and wait, with a cool head and a plan. Galarian Stunfisk's lips form a steel jaw that snaps shut on careless prey hidden in the mud. Thoughtful and ambitious, the rough terrain of your home taught you patience and a guarded sort of cunning.",
  "Mienfoo": "Your moves flow like water, and you love to show them off. Mienfoo's flowing strikes are precise, and it takes great care of its claws. Bold and approachable, you're a hands-on enthusiast who'll happily teach anyone a kata.",
  "Mienshao": "You've mastered the art of the whip-fast strike. Mienshao uses the long fur on its arms like whips to strike with incredible speed. Seasoned and good-natured, a practical, natural mastery shows in everything you do.",
  "Druddigon": "You warm up in the sun before you do anything. Druddigon basks in sunlight to warm its body and lives in caves near volcanoes. Level-headed and free-spirited, you take your time, but you're surprisingly fierce once you've soaked up enough warmth.",
  "Golett": "You were built to protect people, and you're still figuring out how. Golett was made from clay by an ancient civilisation to serve as a guardian, and it's still learning to use its powers. Bold and youthful, you're a bright, mischievous spark in an old, clunky body.",
  "Golurk": "You're a gentle giant with a seal on your chest. Golurk was built to protect people and Pokémon, but if the seal on its chest is removed, it loses control. Affectionate and grounded, you're the outdoorsy, down-to-earth guardian everyone feels safe with.",
  "Mega Golurk": "When you transform, your ancient power awakens. Mega Golurk's body glows with an otherworldly energy, and it becomes an unstoppable guardian. Affectionate and transformative, a mischievous little spark lights up the earth around you.",
  "Pawniard": "You're small, but you've got blades for arms and a sharp mind. Pawniard fights in groups, following its leader's orders. Bright and level-headed, you're a quick, mischievous little soldier who's eager to prove yourself.",
  "Bisharp": "You're the boss, and your gang follows your every command. Bisharp leads a group of Pawniard, and it's always looking for a fight. Independent and down-to-earth, a bold, mischievous sort of authority comes naturally to you.",
  "Bouffalant": "You've got a thick head of hair, and you're not afraid to use it. Bouffalant's afro absorbs impacts, so it can headbutt anything without getting hurt. Under all that hair is a sweetness that surprises everyone who gets close.",
  "Rufflet": "You'll take on anyone, no matter how big they are. Rufflet challenges anything that moves, and it's always looking for a worthy rival. Size has never been a factor in deciding who you'll take on.",
  "Braviary": "You fight for your friends, even when you're hurt. Braviary is said to keep fighting for its allies no matter how injured it gets. Bold and warm-toned, a bright, hands-on bravery defines you.",
  "Hisuian Braviary": "You've got a psychic edge and a bird's-eye view. Hisuian Braviary uses its psychic power to see far into the distance and fly at great speeds. Bold and affectionate, the wild landscape of your youth gave you a thoughtful, larger-than-life outlook.",
  "Vullaby": "You've got a bone to keep you safe, and you're always ready to grow. Vullaby wears a skull as a nappy, and it can't fly yet because its wings are too small. You might not fly yet, but you're absolutely going to.",
  "Mandibuzz": "You build a nest out of bones, and you're a natural protector. Mandibuzz circles high in the sky looking for weakened prey, then carries it back to its nest. Under the bone-decorated nest is a fiercely protective, mischievous warmth.",
  "Heatmor": "You've got a fiery tongue, and you love to eat. Heatmor sucks in air through its tail to fuel its flames, and it eats Durant. Bold and moody, there's a fiery practicality to the way you tackle problems.",
  "Durant": "You work in a team, and you're always building something. Durant lives in colonies and builds complex nests, and its steel armour protects it from attacks. Bold and grounded, you're steady and techy, and you never stop building.",
  "Deino": "You can't see much, so you bump into everything. Deino is blind and explores by touching and biting things around it. Bold and ambitious, a mischievous, youthful energy sends you crashing into the world without fear.",
  "Zweilous": "You've got two heads, and they always argue. Zweilous's heads constantly fight over food, so it eats twice as much as it needs. Edgy and mischievous, a free-spirited curiosity drives you forward.",
  "Hydreigon": "You've got three heads, but only one of them is in charge. Hydreigon's two side heads have no brains, so the central head controls everything. Modest and level-headed, there's a down-to-earth, everyday steadiness in you that surprises people.",
  "Larvesta": "You're a little ball of fire, and you're always growing. Larvesta's horns spew fire to keep enemies away, and it's said to be born from the sun. Bright and grounded, there's a quick-burning, hands-on energy to everything you do.",
  "Volcarona": "You're the sun in your friend group, and you light up the world. Volcarona is said to have saved Pokémon from a cold winter by turning into a second sun. When the world goes cold, you're the one who lights up the sky.",
  "Cobalion": "You protect the weak, and you're a natural leader. Cobalion is said to have protected Pokémon from humans during a war, and it has a heart of steel. The weak and the overlooked have always been able to count on you.",
  "Terrakion": "You'll smash through a castle wall to rescue a friend. Terrakion is said to have charged into a fortress to free Pokémon trapped during a war. You'd rather do the hard work than talk about it, which is how legends usually start.",
  "Virizion": "You move like the wind through the grass, and you protect the gentle. Virizion's horns are as sharp as blades, and it confuses enemies with its graceful movements. You glide through the grass like a breeze, and nobody threatens the gentle on your watch.",
  "Tornadus": "You stir up storms wherever you go, and you never sit still. Tornadus flies at incredible speeds, whipping up powerful winds that can blow down houses. By the time anyone notices the wind's picked up, you've already blown through town.",
  "Tornadus (Therian Forme)": "You've shed your clouds and revealed your true, wild self. Tornadus (Therian Forme) takes on the shape of a bird and stirs up winds that can travel around the world. Guarded and understated, a free-spirited power hides behind your quiet manner.",
  "Thundurus": "You throw lightning bolts when you're angry, and you're quick to get fired up. Thundurus flies across the sky, causing thunderstorms and damage wherever it goes. Bold and fiery, you're authentically yourself, crackling with energy.",
  "Thundurus (Therian Forme)": "When you show your true form, you're pure electricity. Thundurus (Therian Forme) takes on the shape of a beast and releases powerful bolts of lightning. Bold and fiery, every transformation you go through is electric.",
  "Reshiram": "You seek the truth, and your fire burns with integrity. Reshiram is said to help those who seek truth, and its flames can burn the entire world. Independent and good-natured, you're a cool, practical legend who never settles for less than honesty.",
  "Zekrom": "You chase your ideals, and you're powered by your dreams. Zekrom is said to help those who seek to build an ideal world, and its tail generates electricity. Ambitious and free-spirited, you're a grounded, legendary force who's always working towards a better future.",
  "Landorus": "You make the fields grow, and people celebrate you for it. Landorus is said to bring fertile land and good harvests to wherever it visits. Bold and affectionate, you've got a natural, legendary energy that makes everything flourish.",
  "Landorus (Therian Forme)": "You've shed your cloud, and you're a powerful force of nature. Landorus (Therian Forme) takes on the shape of a beast and brings even more powerful harvests. Level-headed and natural, your legendary strength nurtures the earth.",
  "Kyurem": "You're the empty shell left behind, waiting to be whole again. Kyurem is said to be the remnant of a dragon that split in two, and it's searching for the missing part of itself. Bold and ambitious, you're authentic and practical, and your free-spirited yearning drives you forward.",
  "Keldeo": "You're a young hero, and you've got a fierce determination. Keldeo travels the world to learn from the Swords of Justice, and it's always ready to fight for what's right. Light-hearted and bright, there's a natural, edgy courage in you.",
  "Meloetta": "You've got a beautiful voice, and your songs can move mountains. Meloetta's melodies can control the emotions of those who hear them, and it changes form when it dances. Your song can change the mood of an entire room, and you choose its notes carefully.",
  "Genesect": "You're a creation of science, and you're searching for your home. Genesect is an ancient Bug Pokémon that was modified by people, and it's always looking for a place where it belongs. Despite being made in a lab, your heart is surprisingly good-natured.",
  "Chespin": "You've got a prickly exterior, but you're a softie at heart. Chespin's spikes are soft when it's calm, but they harden when it's angry. Affectionate and outdoorsy, a hands-on sweetness is at your core.",
  "Quilladin": "You protect yourself with your shell, and you're always ready to charge. Quilladin's shell is as hard as steel, and it charges at enemies with its spikes. Behind the spiky armour, there's an affection that runs very deep.",
  "Chesnaught": "You've got a strong shell, and you'll protect your friends at any cost. Chesnaught's body is covered in armour, and it uses its arms to create a shield. Fiery and guarded, you're an authentic, outdoorsy protector.",
  "Mega Chesnaught": "When you transform, you become an unstoppable shield. Mega Chesnaught's armour becomes even tougher, and it can withstand almost any attack. Shield up, feet planted, nothing gets past you to the people you love.",
  "Fennekin": "You've got a twig in your tail, and you're always ready to light it up. Fennekin eats twigs to fuel its body, and its ears release hot air. There's a bright future in that little twig of yours.",
  "Braixen": "You carry a stick like a magic wand, and you're always ready to cast a spell. Braixen uses a stick to channel its fire, and it lights it up by rubbing it against its fur. Wave that stick about and people swear they can see the magic.",
  "Delphox": "You can see the future in your flames, and you're incredibly intuitive. Delphox gazes into its fire to see the future, and it uses its psychic powers to control its flames. Fiery and authentic, you're a thoughtful, down-to-earth mystic.",
  "Mega Delphox": "When you transform, your flames become a dazzling display of magic. Mega Delphox's wand glows with power, and its robes flow like fire. Fiery and intuitive, you're a thoughtful, down-to-earth magician who becomes truly transformative.",
  "Froakie": "You've got bubbles on your chest, and you're always ready to leap into action. Froakie's bubbles protect it from attacks, and it's incredibly agile. Underneath the calm, modest exterior there's a hero just waiting to leap.",
  "Frogadier": "You can throw pebbles with incredible accuracy, and you're a natural ninja. Frogadier wraps pebbles in bubbles and throws them with pinpoint precision. Faster than anyone expects, you're the city's quiet, quick-footed helper.",
  "Greninja": "You're a master ninja, and you move like a shadow. Greninja throws shuriken made of water, and it moves with incredible speed. Your affection is quiet, but it's as deep as the ocean.",
  "Mega Greninja": "Calm, collected and secretly ambitious, you transform into the hero people didn't know they needed. Mega Greninja's water shuriken grows enormous and its focus becomes absolute. Bold but level-headed, you care deeply for your team, and nobody sees your strike coming until it lands.",
  "Bunnelby": "You dig with your ears, and you're never out of work. Bunnelby uses its big ears like shovels and can dig all night without tiring. Give you a patch of earth and a long night, and you'll dig something remarkable.",
  "Diggersby": "You can move mountains with your ears, and you're happy to help. Diggersby's ears are as strong as an excavator, and it's often hired on building sites. Sweet-natured and practical, the grumpy face hides an everyday kindness and tireless work ethic.",
  "Fletchling": "You chirp a beautiful song, but don't cross your territory. Fletchling's song is lovely, but it attacks anything that enters its patch with surprising force. Bright and hands-on, a city bird who sings sweetly and defends fiercely.",
  "Fletchinder": "Your feathers glow with embers when you're excited. Fletchinder's flame sac heats up as it flies, and it attacks prey with fiery bursts of speed. Steady and youthful, a natural, edgy little flame lights up the city sky when you pass.",
  "Talonflame": "You dive at incredible speeds, and you never miss your target. Talonflame can reach speeds of 300mph when it dives, and its feathers burst into flames. Affectionate and genuine, your guarded, edgy exterior hides a loyal, fiery heart.",
  "Scatterbug": "You puff out a cloud of black powder when someone gets too close. Scatterbug's powder protects it from predators and keeps it warm. Small for now, but you've already got big dreams of flight.",
  "Spewpa": "You've got a fuzzy shell, and you're very protective of it. Spewpa's fur protects it from danger, and it's very wary of strangers. Seasoned and modest, you're a grounded soul quietly getting ready for your big transformation.",
  "Vivillon": "Your wings change depending on where you grew up, and every pattern is beautiful. Vivillon's wings show the climate of its home, and there are many different patterns across the world. Affectionate and bright, you're a free-spirited traveller who brings colour wherever you fly.",
  "Litleo": "You've left home to find your strength, and you're full of fiery energy. Litleo leaves its pride when it grows up to become stronger on its own. Leaving home was scary, but you're finding your strength one fiery step at a time.",
  "Pyroar": "You lead your pride with confidence, and your mane is your crown. Pyroar's mane grows bigger and brighter as it becomes stronger, and the leader of the pride is the one with the biggest mane. Affectionate and authentic, you're a moody, everyday leader with a fiery heart.",
  "Mega Pyroar": "When you transform, your mane becomes a blazing inferno. Mega Pyroar's mane grows even bigger and more fiery, and it radiates heat. Affectionate and transformative, you're a moody, fiery leader with a regal presence.",
  "Flabébé": "You've found your perfect flower, and you'll protect it forever. Flabébé rides a flower it loves, and it uses the flower's power to fight. Good-natured and classic, you're light-hearted and bright, and you're a tiny, loyal guardian.",
  "Floette": "You protect your garden with a gentle touch. Floette nurtures wilting flowers and dances to bring them back to life. Bright and natural, you're a guarded, practical little gardener with a big heart.",
  "Mega Floette": "When you transform, your flower blooms with eternal life. Mega Floette's flower becomes the Eternal Flower, and it can fire beams of energy. Sweet-natured and transformative, there's a grounded, everyday magic to you.",
  "Florges": "You tend to your garden, and you make the world a more beautiful place. Florges creates flower gardens in its territory and uses their power to protect them. Bright and ambitious, you're a light-hearted, authentic soul.",
  "Skiddo": "You're the first ride people ever have, and you're happy to carry them. Skiddo is said to have lived with people since ancient times, and it's a gentle, trusty mount. Good-natured and level-headed, your tireless, outdoorsy charm puts people at ease.",
  "Gogoat": "You can sense people's feelings through your horns. Gogoat reads its rider's emotions through its horns, and it can climb steep mountains with ease. Riders trust you completely, because you always know exactly how they're feeling.",
  "Pancham": "You try to look tough, but you're a softie at heart. Pancham glares at its enemies to look intimidating, but it often fails and ends up laughing. Bold and bright, you're a fiery, hands-on little tough guy with a big heart.",
  "Pangoro": "You're a tough leader who protects the little ones. Pangoro is said to take care of Pancham and protect them from danger. The little ones in your life know there's no safer place than behind you.",
  "Furfrou": "You've got a stylish haircut, and you know how to look good. Furfrou's fur can be trimmed into different styles, and it's a popular companion in Kalos. Every few weeks there's a new haircut, and every single one suits you.",
  "Espurr": "You've got psychic power so strong you have to keep your ears folded down. Espurr's ears hide organs that emit psychic waves strong enough to send a person flying. Light-hearted but a little guarded, you're quick, moody and intuitive beyond your years.",
  "Meowstic": "You keep your ears down, but you're always listening. Meowstic's ears hide eyeball patterns that release psychic power, and it protects its trainer with a powerful shield. Thoughtful and intuitive, you're a light-hearted, everyday guardian.",
  "Mega Meowstic": "When you transform, your psychic power becomes truly ambitious. Mega Meowstic's ears unfold to unleash its full psychic potential. Bold and light-hearted, there's an everyday intuition in you that becomes truly powerful.",
  "Honedge": "You're a sword with a soul, and you're looking for a hand to hold. Honedge is a ghost that possesses a sword, and it wraps its blue cloth around the arm of anyone who grabs it. Whoever picks you up gets a loyal blade for life, whether they meant to or not.",
  "Doublade": "You and your other half finish each other's sentences, and your attacks. Doublade's two swords talk to each other telepathically and strike in perfect unison. You're at your strongest when paired with someone who truly gets you.",
  "Aegislash": "You switch between shield and sword depending on what the moment needs. Aegislash was said to choose the rightful rulers of ancient kingdoms, defending with its shield and striking with its blade. Guarded and steady, warm underneath the steel, you've got a noble streak that people trust.",
  "Spritzee": "You smell lovely, and you're quietly independent about it. Spritzee releases a fragrance that changes depending on its mood, and nobles once kept it in place of perfume. Where you go, a faint, lovely scent follows, along with your very own sense of style.",
  "Aromatisse": "Your scent can change someone's whole mood, and you use it for good. Aromatisse's fragrance can bring sweet dreams or bad ones, depending on what it wants. Bold and bright, you've got grounded ambitions to make the world smell (and feel) a little sweeter.",
  "Swirlix": "You eat sugar all day long, and you're as sweet as candy. Swirlix's fur is like candy floss, and it eats its own weight in sugar every day. Light-hearted and loyal, you're a city-minded, cool-toned sweetheart with a tireless appetite for joy.",
  "Slurpuff": "You can sniff out exactly what someone's craving. Slurpuff's sense of smell is so good that bakers keep it around to check their cakes. Point you at a bakery and you'll find the best cake in the building within seconds.",
  "Inkay": "You flash your lights to make people feel a little dizzy, and you think it's funny. Inkay's spots flash to confuse enemies and give it a chance to escape. Flash, flash, and you're gone, giggling, before anyone's worked out what happened.",
  "Malamar": "You've got a hypnotic gaze, and you're always a bit mysterious. Malamar's flashing lights can hypnotise anyone who looks at them, and it uses them to control its prey. Meet your gaze for too long and you'll find yourself agreeing with whatever you say.",
  "Mega Malamar": "When you transform, your hypnotic power becomes overwhelming. Mega Malamar's lights flash even brighter, and it can control even the strongest minds. Steady and understated, you've got a quiet, transformative power.",
  "Binacle": "You've got two heads, and they always work together. Binacle's two heads live on a rock and work together to hunt prey. Two heads, one rock and a lifelong partnership: you wouldn't have it any other way.",
  "Barbaracle": "You've got a lot of hands, and you're always working together. Barbaracle is formed from seven Binacle that work together as a team, and its head controls them. Practical and seasoned, you're a good-natured, down-to-earth team player.",
  "Mega Barbaracle": "When you transform, your teamwork becomes legendary. Mega Barbaracle's body becomes even more powerful, and its hands work together in perfect sync. When all your hands work as one, there's nothing your crew can't tackle.",
  "Skrelp": "You disguise yourself as seaweed, and you're always waiting for the right moment. Skrelp hides in kelp forests and ambushes passing prey. You'll drift among the kelp for hours, waiting patiently for the perfect moment.",
  "Dragalge": "You protect your territory with a fierce, toxic power. Dragalge's poison can melt the hull of a ship, and it attacks anything that comes near its home. Ships give your waters a wide berth, and that suits your fierce loyalty to home just fine.",
  "Mega Dragalge": "When you transform, your poison becomes even more potent. Mega Dragalge's body becomes even more fearsome, and its toxic power grows. When your home is threatened, the fury you unleash is something sailors still whisper about.",
  "Clauncher": "You've got one giant claw, and you're a crack shot with it. Clauncher shoots water from its claw like a gun to stun its prey. One squeeze of that claw and you'll hit the target from across the reef.",
  "Clawitzer": "Your claw is a cannon, and you're always ready to fire. Clawitzer's claw can fire water bullets at incredible speeds, strong enough to sink ships. Your focus is so sharp, people swear they can hear the cannon charging.",
  "Helioptile": "You soak up the sun, and you're always full of energy. Helioptile generates electricity by basking in the sun, and its frill absorbs sunlight. A sunny afternoon fills you with enough power to light up a whole street.",
  "Heliolisk": "You can make enough energy to power a whole building. Heliolisk spreads its frill to generate electricity, and it's said to power an entire skyscraper. Spread that frill in the sun, and suddenly the whole building has power.",
  "Tyrunt": "You're a little prehistoric troublemaker. Tyrunt's jaws are strong enough to crunch through a car, and it throws tantrums when it doesn't get its way. Throw a tantrum, sure, but those jaws are a sign of the giant you'll become.",
  "Tyrantrum": "You were the king of your era, and you still feel like one. Tyrantrum ruled the prehistoric world with its massive jaws, and nothing could stand against it. Your era may be long gone, but you still walk like a king.",
  "Amaura": "You've been frozen in time, and you're a calm, dreamy soul. Amaura was revived from a fossil found in ice, and it can make aurora-like lights with its sails. Woken from the ice, you look at the modern world with gentle, dreamy curiosity.",
  "Aurorus": "You bring the aurora with you, and you're a calm, steady presence. Aurorus's diamond-shaped crystals can create a dazzling aurora display. On the coldest nights, you light up the sky for everyone watching.",
  "Sylveon": "You calm people down with your ribbons, and you're a natural peacemaker. Sylveon's ribbons release a calming aura that stops fights before they start. Wrap your ribbons around a tense situation and watch everyone relax.",
  "Hawlucha": "You're a showboat, and you love to fly into battle. Hawlucha performs flashy moves in battle to impress its audience, and it's said to be a master of martial arts. You'd tell people you're modest, right after a perfect flying elbow drop.",
  "Mega Hawlucha": "When the crowd is watching, you come alive. Mega Hawlucha's wings flare into a dazzling cape and its showmanship goes into overdrive. Bold, fiery and approachable, you love a big entrance, and nobody leaves your show disappointed.",
  "Dedenne": "You plug yourself into whatever's nearby and recharge. Dedenne uses its whiskers like antennae to tap into power lines and talk to friends far away. Sweet and bold, you've been doing this long enough to know every charging point in town.",
  "Carbink": "You've been under pressure for millions of years, and it made you shine. Carbink was born deep underground and is said to have slept in the earth's crust for hundreds of millions of years. Guarded and steady, you keep to yourself, but the few who find you discover something precious.",
  "Goomy": "You're soft, squishy and a little bit fragile, and you're perfectly fine with that. Goomy is said to be the weakest Dragon Pokémon, and it covers itself in slime to stay hydrated. Fragile and humble, you're somehow the one everyone wants to look after.",
  "Sliggoo": "You've grown a shell to protect your soft heart. Sliggoo's slime-covered body is still delicate, so it carries a shell on its back for safety. Light-hearted with growing ambitions, nobody would guess how much strength is quietly building in you.",
  "Hisuian Sliggoo": "Your home toughened you up, and you've grown a metal shell to show for it. Hisuian Sliggoo's body is protected by a steel shell, and it keeps its slime safely inside. Independent and techy, a bit moody, you've armoured up without losing your soft centre.",
  "Goodra": "You give the best hugs, even if they're a bit slimy. Goodra is said to be one of the friendliest Dragon Pokémon, and it hugs its trainer warmly. Your hugs are slimy, sincere and the best thing on a bad day.",
  "Hisuian Goodra": "You've built a shell to protect the people you love. Hisuian Goodra's shell is made of metal, and it uses it to shield its friends from danger. Independent and techy, a bit moody, everyday kindness flows from you without fuss.",
  "Klefki": "You collect keys, and you'll never give them back. Klefki gathers keys and jingles them to scare away intruders, and it's said to protect valuable things. Every key you've ever found is on your ring, and you remember exactly where each one came from.",
  "Phantump": "You're a lost soul who's found a home in the woods. Phantump is said to be the spirit of a child lost in the forest, and it imitates human voices to lure people in. Hands-on and a bit edgy, there's a warmth under your spooky stump.",
  "Trevenant": "You protect the forest and everything in it. Trevenant controls trees with its roots and punishes anyone who harms the woods. Grounded and a bit mischievous, your everyday care for nature runs deep.",
  "Pumpkaboo": "You light the way for lost spirits. Pumpkaboo carries the spirits of the dead to the afterlife, and its body glows with an eerie light. Under the moody lantern glow, your ambitions are quietly growing.",
  "Gourgeist": "You sing a haunting song that sends shivers down people's spines. Gourgeist wraps its hair-like arms around prey and sings while it absorbs their life force. Steady and moody, your classic charm has a mischievous edge.",
  "Bergmite": "You're a little iceberg, and you protect yourself with your icy shell. Bergmite covers its body in ice to protect itself, and it lives in snowy mountains. You may be small, but you're one tough little iceberg.",
  "Avalugg": "You're a floating iceberg, and you carry others on your back. Avalugg carries Bergmite on its back like an aircraft carrier, and it protects them from danger. Affectionate and bright, your cool, classic presence makes everyone feel safe.",
  "Hisuian Avalugg": "Your icy shell was forged by the harshness of your home. Hisuian Avalugg's ice is mixed with rock, making it incredibly tough. Affectionate and hands-on, you're the steady shelter everyone runs to when the weather turns.",
  "Noibat": "You can hear things nobody else can, and you're always listening. Noibat's ears pick up ultrasonic waves, and it uses them to navigate in the dark. Thoughtful and grounded, a warm-blooded night owl, you hear what people don't say.",
  "Noivern": "Your voice can shatter boulders, and you're a natural leader. Noivern's ears release ultrasonic waves strong enough to crush rocks, and it flies through the night. When you call out, mountains listen, and so do the friends who follow you.",
  "Xerneas": "You bring life wherever you go, and you're a symbol of renewal. Xerneas is said to share eternal life, and its antlers shine with seven colours. Independent and practical, your bold, tireless energy makes things grow.",
  "Yveltal": "You're powerful, independent and a little bit dark. Yveltal is said to absorb life energy when its life comes to an end, and it spreads its wings in a shape like a Y. When you spread your wings, nobody in the room forgets it.",
  "Zygarde": "You protect the balance of nature, and you're always watching. Zygarde is said to monitor the ecosystem and appear when it's threatened. You may keep to the shadows, but the earth has no more loyal friend.",
  "Mega Zygarde": "When you transform, you become the ultimate guardian of the earth. Mega Zygarde gathers all its cells to become its most powerful form. Free-spirited and tireless, nothing can stop you once you've decided to protect something.",
  "Diancie": "You can create diamonds from thin air, and you're a natural beauty. Diancie compresses carbon in its hands to create beautiful diamonds. Out in the world, with the light catching you just right, you absolutely sparkle.",
  "Mega Diancie": "When you transform, you become a dazzling queen of diamonds. Mega Diancie's diamonds grow even larger and more beautiful, and it shines brighter than ever. When you transform, the whole room catches the light.",
  "Hoopa": "You can summon anything through your rings, and you're a little mischievous. Hoopa uses its rings to bend space and summon things from far away, and it loves to play pranks. Give you a ring and an idle afternoon, and something very strange will appear.",
  "Volcanion": "You've got fire and water inside you, and you know how to blow off steam. Volcanion vents steam from the arm on its back, powerful enough to level mountains, and it hides deep in the mountains away from people. Fiery and moody but deeply loyal, you'd much rather be left alone with the friends you trust.",
  "Rowlet": "You can turn your head almost all the way round, and you've always got one eye on your friends. Rowlet sleeps in a cosy nest during the day and flies silently at night. Free-spirited but guarded, nobody would guess how youthful and playful you are until they see you after dark.",
  "Dartrix": "You care a lot about how you look, and you're not ashamed of it. Dartrix preens its feathers constantly and gets upset if they get dirty. Seasoned and a little moody, you're guarded about who sees you before you've had your morning routine.",
  "Decidueye": "You're a cool, collected archer who never misses. Decidueye pulls arrow quills from its wings and fires them with incredible precision. A bit mischievous and moody, the natural, down-to-earth calm you carry is what makes you so deadly accurate.",
  "Hisuian Decidueye": "You're a rugged archer with a fighting spirit. Hisuian Decidueye's harsh home taught it to shoot three arrows at once and fight up close if it had to. Good-natured and grounded, you've got a natural toughness that comes from where you're from.",
  "Litten": "You keep your distance, and you prefer to do things on your own. Litten grooms its fur and coughs up hairballs of fire, and it's said to be quite aloof. Practical and quick, people have to earn the bold, natural affection under your cool exterior.",
  "Torracat": "Your bell glows when you're excited, and you've got a fiery spirit. Torracat's bell-like collar produces flames when it's ready to fight. Bright and bold, the edgy confidence you carry makes people stop and look.",
  "Incineroar": "You play the villain, but you've got a heart of gold. Incineroar loves to show off with flashy moves, but it's said to be fiercely loyal to its friends. Affectionate and bright, nobody's more fun to watch than you when you're in your element.",
  "Popplio": "You blow bubbles, and you're always putting on a show. Popplio blows bubbles from its nose to perform tricks, and it's a natural entertainer. Bold yet modest, you've got a calm, city-minded charm that delights everyone.",
  "Brionne": "You dance to impress, and you're always working on your routine. Brionne makes bubbles with its voice and uses them to perform beautiful dances. Ambitious and bold, people love your youthful, sparkling energy.",
  "Primarina": "You sing to your friends, and your voice can heal hearts. Primarina sings to control its bubbles, and its songs are said to calm the seas. Affectionate and sweet-natured, a bold, moody depth lies behind your beautiful voice.",
  "Pikipek": "You can drill a hole in anything, and you're always busy. Pikipek pecks at trees at a rate of 16 times a second, and it stores berries in the holes it makes. Rat-a-tat-tat: the whole neighbourhood knows when you're working on something.",
  "Trumbeak": "You can make a sound like a trumpet, and you love to make some noise. Trumbeak's beak lets it produce loud noises to communicate with its friends. Sweet-natured and quick, a moody little soarer, people always hear you coming.",
  "Toucannon": "Your beak can fire seeds like a cannon, and you're a natural protector. Toucannon heats its beak to fire seeds at incredible speed, and couples are known for being devoted. Your partner can always rely on you, and so can every chick in your nest.",
  "Yungoos": "You're always hungry, and you'll chase down anything that moves. Yungoos wanders around during the day looking for food, and it's said to have a huge appetite. Bold and modest, people can't help liking your sweet, hands-on determination.",
  "Gumshoos": "You're a natural detective, and you never give up on a case. Gumshoos stakes out its prey for hours, waiting for the right moment to pounce. Level-headed and sweet-natured, your unhurried patience makes you a great friend.",
  "Grubbin": "You've got strong jaws, and you're always digging for something good. Grubbin uses its jaws to dig through the dirt and build nests underground. Affectionate and quick, you're grounded and ambitious about your future.",
  "Charjabug": "You're a portable battery, and you power everything around you. Charjabug stores electricity in its body, and campers sometimes use it to charge their devices. Campers say you're the most dependable battery they've ever packed.",
  "Vikavolt": "You fire beams of electricity from your jaws, and you're a natural engineer. Vikavolt concentrates electricity in its jaws and fires it at its enemies. By the time anyone's understood your last idea, you're already wiring up the next one.",
  "Crabrawler": "You'll punch anything that gets in your way, and you're always ready for a fight. Crabrawler punches its opponents and climbs trees to reach berries. If there's a berry at the top of the tree, you'll punch your way up to it.",
  "Crabominable": "You're a big, furry crab, and you're surprisingly fluffy. Crabominable climbed a mountain and evolved because it wanted to be the best, and its fur keeps it warm. Bold and affectionate, nobody expects such a soft, understated heart from you.",
  "Mega Crabominable": "When you transform, your fur grows into a mighty, icy armour. Mega Crabominable's claws become even bigger and stronger, and it can withstand freezing temperatures. When you transform, your fur turns to icy armour and the whole mountain notices.",
  "Oricorio": "You change your dance style depending on where you are. Oricorio changes its form and dance style depending on the type of nectar it drinks. Affectionate and thoughtful, you're a modest, warm-blooded dancer at heart.",
  "Cutiefly": "You can sense the auras of flowers, and you're always looking for the next bloom. Cutiefly can sense the colour of auras to find flowers that are about to bloom. Light-hearted and quick, your bright, steady energy makes you a natural friend.",
  "Ribombee": "You make pollen puffs to heal your friends, and you're a natural caregiver. Ribombee makes balls of pollen and nectar, and it sells them to its friends. A pollen puff from you is the most thoughtful gift anyone's ever received.",
  "Rockruff": "You're the friendliest pup in the park, with a little bit of bite. Rockruff rubs the rocks on its neck against people as a sign of affection, but it can be a bit rough about it. Bold and approachable, nobody's more loyal than you once you've chosen your person.",
  "Lycanroc": "You're quick, calm and fiercely loyal to your pack. Lycanroc uses the sharp rocks in its mane to strike enemies and runs at incredible speeds. Level-headed and warm-blooded, there's a hands-on, edgy devotion in the way you protect your people.",
  "Wishiwashi": "Alone, you seem small and shy, but together with friends, you're mighty. Wishiwashi gathers in huge schools that combine into one enormous fish. Modest and adaptable, you're at your best surrounded by people who believe in you.",
  "Mareanie": "You'll steal food from the coral reefs, and you're a bit of a trickster. Mareanie eats the coral of Corsola, and it's always looking for its next snack. Cool and calm, a little mischievous, your tireless curiosity keeps you exploring the shoreline.",
  "Toxapex": "You protect yourself with an unbreakable shell, and you're always on guard. Toxapex builds a dome of poisonous spikes around itself to keep enemies out. Adaptable and seasoned, your edgy exterior hides a bright, warm-blooded heart.",
  "Mudbray": "You're happiest when you're stomping around in the mud. Mudbray covers itself in mud to give itself extra grip, and it's a natural worker. Give you a muddy field and a heavy load, and you'll happily work until sundown.",
  "Mudsdale": "You can carry heavy loads with ease, and you're incredibly strong. Mudsdale's legs are powerful enough to kick a truck, and it's a trusted work partner. Level-headed and affectionate, there's an edgy, grounded resilience to the way you work.",
  "Dewpider": "You carry your own bubble everywhere, and you love being in the water. Dewpider makes a water bubble around its head to breathe on land. Your little water bubble goes everywhere with you, along with your endless curiosity.",
  "Araquanid": "You protect the little ones with your bubble shield. Araquanid traps its enemies in its water bubble and protects weaker Pokémon. Steady and affectionate, your cool, calm guardianship makes people feel safe.",
  "Fomantis": "You love the sunshine, and you'll do anything to soak it up. Fomantis sleeps during the day to absorb sunlight, and its leaves are sharp. Bold and bright, people love your outdoorsy, sunny charm.",
  "Lurantis": "You're a natural beauty, and you take care of yourself. Lurantis spends a lot of time grooming itself to look its best. Nobody takes longer getting ready than you, and nobody looks better when you're done.",
  "Morelull": "You glow in the dark, and you're a little bit sleepy. Morelull's spores glow in the dark and help it sleep. Affectionate and unhurried, a bit moody, your compact sweetness lights up the forest floor.",
  "Shiinotic": "Your light can lure people into a deep sleep. Shiinotic's spores glow and are said to put people into a trance. Light-hearted and authentic, a moody, thoughtful glow surrounds you wherever you drift.",
  "Salandit": "You release a sweet-smelling gas, and you're a little bit sneaky. Salandit's poisonous gas has a sweet scent that lures in enemies. Approachable and thoughtful, a fiery affection hides behind your moody little smirk.",
  "Salazzle": "You're the leader of your group, and you rule with a fiery confidence. Salazzle lives with a group of male Salandit and uses its sweet-smelling poison to charm them. Your followers adore you, and you know exactly how to keep it that way.",
  "Stufful": "You're cute and cuddly, but you don't like to be touched. Stufful flails its arms when people try to hug it, and it's surprisingly strong. Try to hug you and you'll flail, but you're secretly delighted someone wanted to.",
  "Bewear": "You give the best hugs, but they're a bit too strong. Bewear waves its arms to show affection, but its hugs can be dangerous. Affectionate and level-headed, nobody's more down-to-earth or loving than you.",
  "Bounsweet": "You smell sweet, and you're always a little bit nervous. Bounsweet gives off a fruity scent that attracts predators, so it's always on guard. Wherever you go, you leave a sweet, fruity scent and a few nervous glances behind.",
  "Steenee": "You kick your way through life, and you're a little bit bold. Steenee's sepals protect its head, and it kicks enemies with its strong legs. Practical and modest, a bit moody, there's an edgy energy to the way you move.",
  "Tsareena": "You're a queen, and you rule with a kick. Tsareena's elegant legs are said to deliver powerful kicks, and it's a symbol of beauty and strength. Every step you take is regal, and every kick is a royal decree.",
  "Comfey": "You make flower garlands, and you're a natural healer. Comfey picks flowers and weaves them into garlands, which it uses to heal others. Your flower garlands heal more than scratches; they make people feel seen.",
  "Oranguru": "You're the wise one of the forest, and you're always offering advice. Oranguru is said to be incredibly intelligent, and it uses fans to command other Pokémon. Every forest needs a wise old friend to ask, and you're the one they come to.",
  "Passimian": "You work in a team, and you're always passing the ball. Passimian live in groups and work together to collect berries. Affectionate and good-natured, people love your genuine, fiery team spirit.",
  "Wimpod": "You're a little bit timid, and you run away when things get scary. Wimpod scurries away from danger and is known for its cowardly nature. Scurrying away isn't cowardice; it's how you live to grow into something mighty.",
  "Golisopod": "You're a warrior with a strong sense of justice. Golisopod's claws are as sharp as blades, and it fights only when it has to. Affectionate and genuine, a light-hearted good nature hides under your armour.",
  "Mega Golisopod": "Your armour gets an upgrade when you decide to stand your ground. Mega Golisopod's shell turns to steel and its claws grow into precise, gleaming instruments. Classic in your sense of honour and techy in your methods, you become a knight in polished plate for the people you love.",
  "Sandygast": "You built yourself from a sandcastle, and you're quietly ambitious about getting bigger. Sandygast controls anyone who puts a hand in its mouth, and it adds the sand of the beach to its body as it grows. Mischievous and adaptable, you're a sunny trickster with big plans.",
  "Palossand": "You've grown into a whole castle, and you're quietly in charge of the beach. Palossand drains the energy of Pokémon that wander into its sand and rebuilds itself if it's destroyed. Thoughtful and adaptable, a bit mischievous, you're an everyday kind of ruler.",
  "Pyukumuku": "When you're cornered, you've got an unexpected way of fighting back. Pyukumuku punches its insides out of its mouth to scare off predators. Light-hearted and good-natured but guarded, you're the quirky friend people can't help but find endearing.",
  "Type: Null": "You were made to be a weapon, but you're more than that. Type: Null wears a heavy mask to control its power, and it was created to fight dangerous threats. Thoughtful and ambitious, a grounded legend in the making, you're slowly learning to trust others.",
  "Silvally": "You broke free from your mask, and you're finally yourself. Silvally was freed from its mask by a bond of trust with a trainer, and it can change its type with memory discs. Light-hearted and level-headed, nobody's more loyal or sweet once you're free to be you.",
  "Minior": "You've got a tough shell, but your heart is full of colour. Minior's shell protects its colourful core, and it falls to the ground when it breaks. Good-natured and practical, the free spirit inside you is bright and beautiful.",
  "Komala": "You're always in a dream, and you're happiest hugging your favourite log. Komala sleeps its entire life, clinging to a log that its parents gave it. Affectionate and ambitious, you're quick and city-minded in your dreams.",
  "Turtonator": "You've got a shell that explodes when people touch it. Turtonator's shell is made of a substance that explodes when it's hit. Bright and practical, a bit guarded and edgy, nobody wants to cross you.",
  "Togedemaru": "You've got a spiky ball of a body, and you're always charged up. Togedemaru uses its spikes as a lightning rod to absorb electricity. Roll up into a ball and you'll happily soak up every bolt in the sky.",
  "Mimikyu": "You wear a costume to feel loved, and you're working hard to fit in. Mimikyu wears a Pikachu disguise because it wants to be liked, and it gets upset if its costume is ruined. All you've ever wanted is to be loved for who you are under the costume.",
  "Bruxish": "You grind your teeth, and your psychic powers can make people's heads spin. Bruxish's teeth produce psychic waves that disorient its prey. Bold and intuitive, your seasoned, cool calm hides a lively brain.",
  "Drampa": "You live in the mountains, but you love visiting kids in town. Drampa lives high in the mountains and comes down to play with children. Sweet-natured and genuine, you're a warm-blooded grandparent figure who brings joy.",
  "Mega Drampa": "When you transform, you become a guardian of the little ones. Mega Drampa's wings grow larger and its body becomes more powerful. The children of your town know you'll always be there to keep them safe.",
  "Dhelmise": "You're a soul in a shipwreck, and you're always looking for your next adventure. Dhelmise is said to be the spirit of seaweed that possessed an anchor. Light-hearted and grounded, your hands-on strength is anchored in a big, cool heart.",
  "Jangmo-o": "You bang your head together to say hello. Jangmo-o hits its scales together to make a sound, and it's always looking for a fight. Headbutting your friends is just how you say hello.",
  "Hakamo-o": "Your scales make a sound like a battle cry, and you're always ready to fight. Hakamo-o hits its scales together before battle to intimidate opponents. The clatter of your scales before a fight is your way of saying you're ready.",
  "Kommo-o": "Your scales clang like a war drum, and you're a seasoned warrior. Kommo-o hits its scales together to intimidate opponents, and its scales are said to be used as armour. Ambitious and free-spirited, nobody's more determined than you.",
  "Tapu Koko": "You're the guardian of your island, and you love a good battle. Tapu Koko is said to be the protector of Melemele Island, and it loves to fight. Your island is safe, mostly because you love picking a fight with anything that threatens it.",
  "Tapu Lele": "You spread healing scales, and you're a little bit mischievous. Tapu Lele is said to be the guardian of Akala Island, and it scatters scales that can heal. Affectionate and intuitive, your legendary ambition drives you forward.",
  "Tapu Bulu": "You're a lazy guardian, but you'll protect your island when it counts. Tapu Bulu is said to be the guardian of Ula'ula Island, and it uses its horns to bring nature to life. You might be a lazy guardian, but you're a guardian all the same.",
  "Tapu Fini": "You create fog to protect your island, and you're a calm, practical guardian. Tapu Fini is said to be the guardian of Poni Island, and it uses water to cleanse spirits. Your fog settles over the island like a promise that everyone's safe.",
  "Cosmog": "You're a little nebula, and you're full of potential. Cosmog's body is made of gas, and it's very curious. Somewhere in that little cloud of stardust is a destiny the size of the sun.",
  "Cosmoem": "You're wrapped up in a shell, and you're getting ready to transform. Cosmoem's shell is incredibly hard, and it's absorbing energy for its evolution. You're not doing much on the outside, but inside, a whole universe is getting ready.",
  "Solgaleo": "You're the sun in your sky, and you're a natural leader. Solgaleo is said to be the beast that devours the sun, and its body shines brightly. Where you go, it feels like the sun has risen early.",
  "Lunala": "You're at your best after dark, and you'd happily swallow the moonlight whole. Lunala's wings soak up light and turn the daytime sky into night. Independent and intuitive, a classic night owl with bold opinions, you bring a quiet, starry gravity to everything.",
  "Nihilego": "People find you a little hard to read, and that's fine by you. Nihilego is an Ultra Beast from another world, drifting about like a jellyfish and acting in ways nobody fully understands. Adaptable and thoughtful, independent to the core, you're out here having an experience nobody else is having.",
  "Buzzwole": "You show off your muscles, and you're proud of every one of them. Buzzwole flexes its arms to communicate and can lift huge weights. Independent and hands-on, your outdoorsy confidence makes every day feel like leg day.",
  "Pheromosa": "You're elegant, aloof and impossible to catch. Pheromosa refuses to touch anything it thinks is dirty and runs faster than the eye can follow. Thoughtful and ambitious, people sense a natural, untouchable glamour about you.",
  "Xurkitree": "You crackle with energy, and you're always looking for a socket. Xurkitree absorbs electricity from power plants and is said to be made of electric wires. Bold yet modest, people sense a fiery, down-to-earth genius buzzing inside you.",
  "Celesteela": "You can fly to the stars, and you've got big ambitions. Celesteela flies by burning gas from its arms like rockets, and it's said to be from another world. Level-headed and free-spirited, your techy dreams reach the skies.",
  "Kartana": "You're small, but you're sharp enough to cut through anything. Kartana's paper-thin body can slice through steel, and it moves with incredible speed. One careful, precise cut from you and the problem's simply gone.",
  "Guzzlord": "You've got a big appetite for life, and you never stop eating. Guzzlord can swallow mountains and buildings, and it's never satisfied. Your hunger for life is endless, and honestly, a little bit admirable.",
  "Necrozma": "You're searching for the light, and you're always looking for answers. Necrozma lost its light long ago and absorbs light from others to survive. Somewhere out there is the light you lost, and you'll keep searching until you find it.",
  "Ultra Necrozma": "When you find your light, you shine brighter than anyone. Ultra Necrozma absorbs enough light to regain its true, radiant form. Ambitious and genuine, an intuitive warmth radiates from you once you've found your spark.",
  "Magearna": "You're a work of art, and you've got a heart of gold. Magearna was built centuries ago by a skilled scientist, and its heart is a mechanical soul. Your heart was built by hand centuries ago, and it's still the sweetest thing about you.",
  "Mega Magearna": "When you transform, your soul shines brighter than ever. Mega Magearna's body becomes even more beautiful and powerful, and its heart glows. Bold and grounded, a legendary sweetness radiates from you.",
  "Mega Magearna (Original)": "You're the original masterpiece, and you're beautiful in your own way. Mega Magearna (Original) takes on the colours of its first form, and it's just as powerful as ever. Bold and grounded, your sweet, legendary heart never changes.",
  "Marshadow": "You're a shadow that can copy anyone's moves. Marshadow lurks in shadows and mimics the movements of others, and it's said to be very shy. Watch someone once and you'll mirror their moves perfectly, then slip back into the shadows.",
  "Poipole": "You're a little bit mischievous, and you love to play. Poipole is a friendly Ultra Beast that sprays poison from its needle. Youthful and level-headed, a down-to-earth, independent little spark of chaos.",
  "Naganadel": "You can fly at incredible speeds, and you're a little bit edgy. Naganadel stores poison in its body and fires it from its needle. Your trails of poison light streak across the sky like graffiti nobody can catch you writing.",
  "Stakataka": "You're made of many parts, and you all work together. Stakataka is formed from a colony of Ultra Beasts that stack together like a wall. Light-hearted and level-headed, a hands-on strength holds the whole wall together.",
  "Blacephalon": "You're a party animal, and you love to blow things up. Blacephalon's head explodes like fireworks, and it loves to surprise people. Bright and quick, people can't help but love your classic, independent sense of fun.",
  "Zeraora": "You're as fast as lightning, and you're always ready for a fight. Zeraora generates electricity in its claws and runs at incredible speeds. By the time the thunder arrives, you've already been and gone.",
  "Mega Zeraora": "When you transform, you become a living lightning bolt. Mega Zeraora's electricity becomes even more powerful, and its speed increases. Transformed, you become a living lightning strike with very good aim.",
  "Meltan": "You're made of liquid metal, and you're always looking for a new shape. Meltan eats metal to grow, and it's said to be a mysterious Pokémon. Every new nut and bolt you find is a little treasure to you.",
  "Melmetal": "You're made of liquid metal, and you're incredibly strong. Melmetal's body is made of metal that can change shape, and it's said to have been worshipped in ancient times. Bold and grounded, a legendary, down-to-earth power sits inside you.",
  "Gigantamax Melmetal": "When you go big, you become a towering giant of metal. Gigantamax Melmetal's body becomes massive and its fists can crush anything. Even as a towering giant, you keep a cool head on those huge shoulders.",
  "Grookey": "You drum your stick on everything, and you're always making music. Grookey taps its stick to create rhythms that make plants grow. Give you a stick and a surface and you'll have the whole forest bopping along.",
  "Thwackey": "You drum faster than anyone, and you're always in the zone. Thwackey drums so fast that it loses itself in the rhythm. Once you're in the rhythm, nothing can pull you out of the zone.",
  "Rillaboom": "You lead from behind the drum kit, and your rhythm keeps everyone moving. Rillaboom's tree-stump drum channels the power of the forest, and the best drummers lead the troop. Modest about your talent and steady in your beat, you'd rather make the band sound good than take a solo.",
  "Gigantamax Rillaboom": "On the big stage, you bring the whole forest with you. Gigantamax Rillaboom's drum grows into a huge kit made of living trees, and every beat shakes the ground. Usually understated, you become pure, outdoorsy spectacle when the crowd's waiting.",
  "Scorbunny": "You can't stand still, and the soles of your feet are basically on fire. Scorbunny's feet heat up as it runs, and it bounds about at top speed. Bright and youthful, quick-tempered but cool-headed underneath, your energy starts every party.",
  "Raboot": "You've hit your moody phase, and you're wearing it well. Raboot's fur works like a hoodie, and it kicks burning pebbles with style. Independent and hands-on, a bit sulky but always fiery, people find your cool-kid energy weirdly charming.",
  "Cinderace": "You're the striker who always shows up on match day. Cinderace juggles pebbles into flaming footballs and plays to the crowd. Bold and natural, slightly elusive off the pitch, your footwork does all the talking.",
  "Gigantamax Cinderace": "When the stadium is packed, you light the whole thing up. Gigantamax Cinderace kicks a fireball the size of a house, and it plays with dramatic flair. Bright yet modest, independent and fiery, you're a natural on the biggest stage.",
  "Sobble": "You cry when you're scared, and your tears can make others cry too. Sobble's tears contain a chemical that makes anyone near it burst into tears. Thoughtful and modest, a calm, cool little spirit, you're far more independent than you look.",
  "Drizzile": "You're clever, and you're always one step ahead. Drizzile makes water balloons to trap its enemies, and it's said to be very intelligent. Every water balloon trap you set is part of a much cleverer plan.",
  "Inteleon": "You're a secret agent, and you've got all the right gadgets. Inteleon hides many secret moves and fires water from its fingertips with deadly precision. Modest and understated, a moody, independent operator who works best in the shadows.",
  "Gigantamax Inteleon": "When you go big, you become a master sniper. Gigantamax Inteleon sits on its own tail to fire water bullets with incredible accuracy. Modest and dramatic, your independence makes you a deadly precise force.",
  "Skwovet": "You hoard berries in your cheeks, and you're always hungry. Skwovet stuffs its cheeks with berries and eats them when it feels anxious. Bold and good-natured, a warm, city-minded little foodie.",
  "Greedent": "You hoard everything, and you never share. Greedent stores food in its tail and is famously greedy. Everything you hoard is safe forever, which is mostly reassuring.",
  "Rookidee": "You're small, but you'll take on anyone. Rookidee is known for its bravery and will challenge much stronger opponents. Bright and hands-on, a bit edgy, your city-minded spirit soars high.",
  "Corvisquire": "You're clever, and you know how to use tools. Corvisquire uses stones to solve problems, and it's said to be very intelligent. Good-natured and practical, a steady city-dweller who's always working out the next move.",
  "Corviknight": "You're the city's taxi service, and you're always reliable. Corviknight carries people through the skies of Galar, and its body is armoured with steel. Guarded and warm-blooded, people trust your genuine, tireless dedication.",
  "Gigantamax Corviknight": "When you go big, you become a storm of steel wings. Gigantamax Corviknight's wings become massive and powerful, and it can whip up hurricanes. When you unfurl those massive steel wings, the whole region looks up.",
  "Blipbug": "You've got a brain full of facts, and you're always learning. Blipbug's hairs pick up information from its surroundings, and it's said to be very intelligent. Independent and good-natured, a bit moody, your grounded curiosity never stops.",
  "Dottler": "You've got psychic powers, and you're always preparing for the future. Dottler hides in its shell to grow its psychic power, and it's said to be very intelligent. Tucked inside your shell, your mind quietly grows sharper every day.",
  "Orbeetle": "You can see everything, and you're a natural leader. Orbeetle uses psychic power to sense its surroundings, and it's said to be the most intelligent Bug Pokémon. You see the whole picture without making a fuss about it.",
  "Gigantamax Orbeetle": "When you go big, your psychic power becomes overwhelming. Gigantamax Orbeetle's psychic power grows so strong it can control anything. Independent and dramatic, your intuitive brilliance becomes truly legendary.",
  "Nickit": "You're a sly fox, and you love to steal food. Nickit wipes away its footprints with its tail to avoid being caught. Your tail sweeps away the evidence before anyone thinks to look.",
  "Thievul": "You're a master thief, and you love a good heist. Thievul marks its targets with its scent and steals from them later. Independent and light-hearted, people can't resist your mischievous, bright charm.",
  "Gossifleur": "You spin through the fields, and you're always spreading joy. Gossifleur twirls its petals to spread pollen, and it's said to be very cheerful. Twirl through a meadow with you and the whole day feels lighter.",
  "Eldegoss": "You spread cotton seeds, and you're a symbol of fertility. Eldegoss's cotton seeds are said to bring good luck, and it spreads them on the wind. Your cotton drifts across the land, quietly bringing luck to whoever catches it.",
  "Wooloo": "You're soft, fluffy and you'd rather roll away than fight. Wooloo curls up in a ball and rolls away from danger, and its wool is said to be very warm. Roll up in your woolly ball and absolutely nothing can bother you.",
  "Dubwool": "Your wool is so springy that you can bounce off any trouble. Dubwool's fleece is prized for making the softest carpets, and its horns are surprisingly strong. Light-hearted and down-to-earth, you're the sweet, sturdy friend whose good nature never runs out.",
  "Chewtle": "When you get your teeth into something, you never let go. Chewtle bites down on anything that moves and holds on for dear life. Bold and ambitious, a classic little scrapper with a friendly face, you've got a determination people can't help admiring.",
  "Drednaw": "You've got a bite that can snap iron, and you're not afraid to use it. Drednaw lunges with its long neck and shatters rocks with its jaw. Grounded and genuinely good-natured, you only bring out the big bite when something really matters.",
  "Gigantamax Drednaw": "When you go big, you stand tall and stomp hard. Gigantamax Drednaw rises on its hind legs and creates earthquakes with every step. Rear up and stomp, and the whole ground knows you've arrived.",
  "Yamper": "You're always running around, and your tail generates electricity. Yamper's tail produces electricity as it runs, and it's very energetic. City-minded and tireless, a fiery little dog with a techy spark.",
  "Boltund": "You run at incredible speed, and your legs are crackling with power. Boltund's legs generate electricity, and it can run at over 50mph. When you hit full speed, it looks like the street is crackling with lightning.",
  "Rolycoly": "You roll along the ground, and you're always glowing. Rolycoly's body is made of coal, and it rolls along like a wheel. Grounded and good-natured, a bit moody, your independent spark burns bright.",
  "Carkol": "You've got a little furnace inside you, and you love the outdoors. Carkol burns coal in its body to fuel its movements, and it's said to be very hard-working. Light-hearted and warm-blooded, a bit moody, there's a tireless warmth to everything you do.",
  "Coalossal": "You're a walking mountain of coal, and you've got fire in your heart. Coalossal's body is made of coal, and it's said to be very protective of its friends. Guarded and moody, your independent, understated strength runs hot.",
  "Gigantamax Coalossal": "When you go big, you become a towering volcano. Gigantamax Coalossal's body becomes a massive pile of burning coal, and it can shoot fireballs. Your volcano of coal burns hot, dramatic and absolutely unmissable.",
  "Applin": "You live inside an apple, and you're a little dragon at heart. Applin hides inside an apple to protect itself, and it's said to be very shy. Behind that sweet apple exterior lives a small, determined dragon.",
  "Flapple": "You've got wings made of apple skin, and you're surprisingly fast. Flapple flies with its apple-skin wings and spits acidic liquid at its enemies. Those apple-skin wings carry you further than anyone expected.",
  "Gigantamax Flapple": "When you go big, you become a giant, flying apple. Gigantamax Flapple's body becomes a massive apple, and it can release a sweet nectar. As a giant flying apple, you're ridiculous and wonderful in equal measure.",
  "Appletun": "You're sweet, soft and you love to be cuddled. Appletun's back is covered in sweet nectar, and it's said to be very gentle. Spend a lazy afternoon with you and everyone goes home a little sweeter.",
  "Gigantamax Appletun": "When you go big, you become a giant, sweet apple pie. Gigantamax Appletun's body becomes a massive apple pie, and it can release a sweet syrup. As a giant apple pie, you're the most comforting showstopper anyone's ever seen.",
  "Silicobra": "You've got a sand-sac on your neck, and you're always ready to spit. Silicobra stores sand in its neck and spits it out to protect itself. Sand sac full, you're ready to puff out a cloud and slither off on your own adventure.",
  "Sandaconda": "You coil your body like a spring, and you're always ready to spray sand. Sandaconda's body can hold over 100kg of sand, and it sprays it at its enemies. Coiled up and quietly loaded with sand, you're stronger than your calm suggests.",
  "Gigantamax Sandaconda": "When you go big, you become a giant sand tornado. Gigantamax Sandaconda's body becomes a massive sand-spewing tornado. As a towering sandstorm, you remind everyone what the desert can do.",
  "Cramorant": "You've always got something in your mouth, and you're always a bit clumsy. Cramorant swallows its prey whole, and sometimes it accidentally swallows other Pokémon. Good-natured and free-spirited, an everyday, edgy charm makes you hard to forget.",
  "Arrokuda": "You've got a sharp jaw, and you're always ready to bite. Arrokuda's jaw is very sharp, and it swims at incredible speeds. Small as you are, that jaw means business.",
  "Barraskewda": "You swim like a torpedo, and you're incredibly fast. Barraskewda swims at speeds of over 100mph, and its jaw is sharp enough to pierce steel. Good-natured and calm, you're a cool, seasoned force in the water.",
  "Toxel": "You store poison in your body, and you're a little bit grumpy. Toxel stores toxins in its body and generates electricity from them. Thoughtful and youthful, there's a fiery, techy edge to you.",
  "Toxtricity": "You're a rock star, and you love to play guitar. Toxtricity strums the electric organ on its chest to create music. Quiet until someone hands you a stage, then the whole room shakes.",
  "Gigantamax Toxtricity": "When you go big, you become a rock legend. Gigantamax Toxtricity's chest becomes a massive guitar, and its music can shake the earth. On the biggest stage, your guitar solo becomes the stuff of legend.",
  "Sizzlipede": "You've got a fiery body, and you're always on the move. Sizzlipede's body burns hot, and it wraps itself around prey to roast it. Bright and bold, a light-hearted, adaptable spark.",
  "Centiskorch": "You run hot, and you hold the people you love close. Centiskorch coils its long body around prey and heats up to over 1,500 degrees. Seasoned, grounded and adaptable, you keep your intensity understated until someone you care about needs warming up.",
  "Gigantamax Centiskorch": "On the big night, you're the bonfire everyone gathers round. Gigantamax Centiskorch's body glows with heat so intense it can melt steel. Seasoned and adaptable, you turn up the drama when the moment calls for something spectacular.",
  "Clobbopus": "You learn by poking things, and you're always curious. Clobbopus uses its tentacles to punch things and figure out what they are, and it's very inquisitive. Light-hearted and natural, a little moody, your tireless curiosity drives you to explore the city's every nook.",
  "Grapploct": "You've got a grip like a vice, and you're a master of submission. Grapploct's whole body is muscle, and it wraps its tentacles around opponents to squeeze them. Bold and independent, a down-to-earth, edgy fighter who never lets go.",
  "Sinistea": "You live inside a teacup, and you're a little bit of a fraud. Sinistea possesses cold tea and a cracked cup, and most of them are fakes. You might be a fake antique, but you're perfectly happy in your cosy cup.",
  "Polteageist": "You're a ghost in a teapot, and you're always brewing up mischief. Polteageist pours its tea into the mouths of its enemies to drain their energy. Thoughtful and light-hearted, a down-to-earth trickster who loves a good cuppa.",
  "Hatenna": "You can sense people's emotions, and you're a bit sensitive to them. Hatenna's hat lets it read people's feelings, and it runs away from anyone who's feeling strong emotions. Approachable but guarded, your intuitive nature can be overwhelming.",
  "Hattrem": "You protect yourself from noisy emotions, and you've got a strong sense of self. Hattrem's braids can lash out at anyone who's feeling too much. Seasoned and thoughtful, your intuitive, edgy mind keeps you safe.",
  "Hatterene": "You're a forest witch, and you love the peace and quiet. Hatterene releases a beam of psychic power from its hat to punish anyone who makes too much noise. Make too much noise in your forest and you'll quickly learn what a sweet, quiet witch can do.",
  "Gigantamax Hatterene": "When you go big, you become a giant, psychic witch. Gigantamax Hatterene's hat becomes massive, and its psychic power is overwhelming. When you rise up, your hat alone could cover a castle.",
  "Impidimp": "You love to play tricks, and you're a little bit naughty. Impidimp sneaks into people's houses to steal food and play pranks. Your pranks are never cruel, just perfectly timed and very hard to prove.",
  "Morgrem": "You're a master of trickery, and you love to lure people in. Morgrem lures people into the forest by pretending to be a lost child. One sweet smile and people would follow you anywhere, possibly into a bog.",
  "Grimmsnarl": "You've got hair as strong as muscles, and you're a natural protector. Grimmsnarl's hair wraps around its body like muscles, giving it immense strength. Your hair might be wrapped like muscles, but you use the strength to look after your patch.",
  "Gigantamax Grimmsnarl": "When you go big, your hair becomes even stronger. Gigantamax Grimmsnarl's hair grows into massive, muscle-like arms that can crush anything. Even towering over the city, you keep a calm head and a cheeky grin.",
  "Obstagoon": "You've got a loud voice, and you're always ready to block. Obstagoon crosses its arms and shouts to intimidate its enemies. Arms crossed and voice booming, you're the rebel nobody gets past.",
  "Perrserker": "You've got a metal helmet, and you're ready for battle. Perrserker's body is covered in steel armour, and its claws are as sharp as blades. Helmet on, claws out, you've got a Viking's fierce sense of loyalty.",
  "Cursola": "You've lost your colour, but you're still full of life. Cursola is said to be the spirit of coral that died due to climate change, and it curses those who touch it. You've lost your colour, but never your spirit.",
  "Sirfetch’d": "You carry a leek, and you're a true knight. Sirfetch'd wields a leek as a sword and a shield, and it never retreats from battle. Leek raised high, you'd rather lose with honour than win without it.",
  "Mr. Rime": "You love to tap dance, and you're a master of comedy. Mr. Rime tap-dances on ice and makes people laugh with its comical movements. Your tap dancing never fails to get a laugh, and that's exactly the point.",
  "Runerigus": "You carry an ancient curse, and you're a little bit protective. Runerigus's body is made of a stone tablet with ancient writing, and it curses anyone who touches it. Leave the old stones alone and you'll leave you alone too.",
  "Milcery": "You're made of cream, and you're incredibly sweet. Milcery was born from the sweet aroma in the air, and it's said to be very gentle. Light-hearted and sweet-natured, a thoughtful, grounded little treat.",
  "Alcremie": "You decorate your body with sweets, and you're a master baker. Alcremie's body is made of cream, and it decorates itself with berries and sweets. Every swirl of cream you decorate yourself with is a little act of joy.",
  "Gigantamax Alcremie": "When you go big, you become a giant, sweet cake. Gigantamax Alcremie's body becomes a massive cake, and it can shoot sweet cream. As a giant cake, you're the sweetest showstopper the world has ever seen.",
  "Falinks": "You work in a team, and you're always in formation. Falinks is made of six individuals that work together in a military formation. Bold and independent, a steady, edgy soldier who's always light-hearted.",
  "Mega Falinks": "When you transform, your team becomes an unstoppable force. Mega Falinks's formation becomes even more powerful, and it can overwhelm any opponent. Six of you, one heartbeat, and absolutely nothing out of step.",
  "Pincurchin": "You chew through problems slowly and steadily, and you get there. Pincurchin grazes on seaweed with its sharp teeth and stores electricity in its spines. Slow and steady, you quietly power up the whole street.",
  "Snom": "You eat snow off the ground, and you're happy with the simple things. Snom eats the snow that piles up on the ground, and the more it eats, the bigger its spikes grow. Young and adaptable, you find joy in the smallest flurries.",
  "Frosmoth": "You've got wings like snowflakes, and you'll stand up for the planet. Frosmoth flies around on icy wings and freezes anyone who damages the environment. Bold and seasoned, you're a steady, soaring protector of the wild places you love.",
  "Stonjourner": "You go on an annual pilgrimage, and nobody quite knows why. Stonjourner gathers in a stone circle once a year to watch the sunrise. Once a year you return to the stone circle, because some traditions are worth keeping.",
  "Eiscue": "You've got an ice cube on your head to keep yourself cool. Eiscue wears a block of ice to keep its face cool, and it fishes using its hair. Hands-on and a bit guarded, you're a classic city penguin who's always perfectly chilled.",
  "Indeedee": "You can read people's feelings, and you always know what they need. Indeedee uses its horns to sense the emotions of others, and it's very good at helping people. Thoughtful and intuitive, your grounded affection makes people feel completely at ease.",
  "Morpeko": "You're happy one minute and grumpy the next, and it's all about how hungry you are. Morpeko changes its form when it's hungry, from cheerful to grumpy. Bold and bright, your mischievous charm makes your mood swings endearing.",
  "Cufant": "You can lift five tons with your trunk, and you're incredibly strong. Cufant's trunk is so powerful that it can lift heavy objects with ease. Hand you a heavy load and you'll lift it like it's nothing.",
  "Copperajah": "You're a gentle giant, and you're incredibly strong. Copperajah's body is made of copper, and it's said to be very calm. Nothing about your strength is in a hurry, and that's what makes it so reassuring.",
  "Gigantamax Copperajah": "When you go big, you become a giant, copper-coated beast. Gigantamax Copperajah's trunk becomes a massive cannon, and it can fire huge blasts of energy. When you raise that giant trunk, the whole region braces itself.",
  "Dracozolt": "You're a Frankenstein's monster, and you're full of power. Dracozolt was revived from fossils, but the pieces didn't quite fit together. Mismatched and a bit wild, you've learned to love the parts that don't quite fit.",
  "Arctozolt": "You're a mismatched mix of parts, and you're always shivering. Arctozolt was revived from fossils, and its upper body is always freezing. Shivering top and sparking bottom, you've made a home in your mismatched body.",
  "Dracovish": "You've got a strong jaw, and you're a natural hunter. Dracovish was revived from fossils, and its jaws are incredibly strong. Those jaws could crush anything, and you're surprisingly happy just showing them off.",
  "Arctovish": "You're a mismatched mix of parts, and you're always freezing. Arctovish was revived from fossils, and its face is always encased in ice. Your face may be frozen, but you've never lost your cool.",
  "Duraludon": "You're built like a skyscraper, and you're incredibly strong. Duraludon's body is made of a light, strong metal, and it lives in caves. Built like a skyscraper and twice as solid, you're always reaching higher.",
  "Gigantamax Duraludon": "You think big, and when you go big, you become the skyline. Gigantamax Duraludon towers like a gleaming skyscraper with lights in its windows. Thoughtful and ambitious, you're the one who imagined the city first and then quietly built it.",
  "Dreepy": "You drift about looking for somewhere to belong, and you make friends easily along the way. Dreepy is the ghost of an ancient Pokémon that returned to its old seas, and it loves riding in Drakloak's head. Grounded and adaptable, you've got a classic, wide-eyed sweetness.",
  "Drakloak": "You carry your little ones everywhere, and you fly into the fight with them. Drakloak keeps a Dreepy in the hollow of its head and fights fiercely to protect it. Bold and young at heart, a free-spirited mischief-maker, you're a big sibling through and through.",
  "Dragapult": "You launch your friends into adventures at alarming speed. Dragapult fires the Dreepy in its horns like missiles, and they love every second. Bright, ambitious and mischievous, you make ordinary days feel like a thrill ride.",
  "Zacian": "You're the hero of an old story, and you carry it lightly. Zacian is a legendary warrior that wields a sword in its jaws and moves with breathtaking speed. Sweet-natured and level-headed, you're also quick to act when someone needs saving.",
  "Zamazenta": "You're the shield in the old legend, and you take that role seriously. Zamazenta guards with an unbreakable shield and stood beside Zacian to save its land. Fiery but light-hearted, you'd stand between your people and any storm.",
  "Eternatus": "You came from another world, and you're incredibly powerful. Eternatus is said to have fallen to earth in a meteorite, and it absorbs energy from the planet. Steady and soaring, there's a cool, mischievous edge to your legendary power.",
  "Kubfu": "You're small, serious about training and very, very determined. Kubfu trains hard every day to master its fighting style, and it's shy around strangers. Quick and fiery with a light-hearted streak, there's a legend in you waiting to grow up.",
  "Urshifu": "You've chosen your path and trained relentlessly to walk it. Urshifu mastered one of two fighting styles in towers of stern discipline. Independent and moody, you're quietly legendary, and you prefer to let your fists speak.",
  "Gigantamax Urshifu (Rapid Strike)": "When you go big, you flow like a river of blows. Gigantamax Urshifu (Rapid Strike) whips up a whirlpool and strikes with dizzying, relentless speed. Good-natured and light-hearted, you bring fire and flow in equal measure.",
  "Gigantamax Urshifu (Single Strike)": "You put everything into one perfect blow. Gigantamax Urshifu (Single Strike) gathers all its power into a single devastating punch that can break through any guard. Moody and mischievous, with a fiery flair for the dramatic, you prefer one decisive move to a hundred small ones.",
  "Zarude": "You live by the rules of your troop, until your heart tells you otherwise. Zarude lives in packs deep in the jungle and fights fiercely, yet one famously raised a human child as its own. Mischievous and ambitious, quick and independent, you're fierce on the outside and devoted underneath.",
  "Regieleki": "You're pure, crackling energy, and you never slow down. Regieleki is said to be made entirely of electricity, and it can move faster than any other Pokémon. Bold and fiery, an edgy legend in a compact package, people feel the static before you even walk in.",
  "Regidrago": "You've got a dragon's head and a heart full of ancient power. Regidrago's body is shaped like a dragon's head, and it's said to hold the power of a dragon. Bold yet modest, your free-spirited, level-headed strength runs deep.",
  "Glastrier": "You've got an icy temper and a loyal heart. Glastrier is a fierce, frozen steed that rampages through snowfields, and it once served a king. Grounded and good-natured, you're a legendary creature of habit who's happy in a city as long as it's cold.",
  "Spectrier": "You're a ghostly steed, and you're incredibly fast. Spectrier's body is made of ghostly energy, and it can see things others can't. Light-hearted and level-headed, a moody, thoughtful edge makes you deeply intriguing.",
  "Calyrex": "You're a king of the forest, and you're incredibly wise. Calyrex is said to be the king of Galar, and it has the power to heal and bring life to plants. Thoughtful and intuitive, a modest, guarded legend whose wisdom is quietly profound.",
  "Wyrdeer": "Your antlers weave illusions, and your calm keeps the herd together. Wyrdeer evolved after learning to bend light with its antlers, and its beard is a sign of age and wisdom. Bold and unhurried, you're a natural, cool-headed leader.",
  "Kleavor": "You've got axes for arms, and you treat every tree with respect. Kleavor's arms became stone axes in a land rich in minerals, and it's said to have taught people how to fell trees. Seasoned and quick, you're a down-to-earth woodsman with a sharp swing.",
  "Ursaluna": "You've got a nose for trouble, and the strength to deal with it. Ursaluna evolved in a peat-rich land and can dig up treasures with its massive arms. Good-natured and outdoorsy, you're a warm, steady presence who keeps the woods safe.",
  "Basculegion": "You carry the memories of the ones who didn't make it, and you swim on for them. Basculegion is said to carry the spirits of Basculin that perished on the long journey upstream. Bold and practical, your calm loyalty to the past is deeply moving.",
  "Sneasler": "You climb sheer cliffs for fun, and you do it with a grin. Sneasler scales rock faces with poison-tipped claws that let it hold on anywhere. Bold and approachable, you're a fiery outdoor adventurer who never takes the easy way up.",
  "Overqwil": "You've got spikes for days, and a temper to match. Overqwil's long spines carry potent poison, and it's quick to puff up when crossed. Edgy and moody but warm underneath, you're the prickly friend who's fiercely loyal to the few you let close.",
  "Enamorus": "You bring spring with you, and you fall in love easily. Enamorus is said to bless the land with new growth and to have a fiery, passionate temperament. Bold yet modest, level-headed and down-to-earth, you're a quietly legendary romantic.",
  "Enamorus (Therian Forme)": "In your true form, you're love in its purest, wildest shape. Enamorus (Therian Forme) takes the form of a beast and brings new life wherever it goes. Bright and ambitious, sweet and independent, you love fiercely and freely.",
  "Sprigatito": "You're cute, you know it, and you're not above using it. Sprigatito's fur releases a sweet, plant-like scent that charms everyone nearby, and it kneads its paws when happy. A little edgy and a bit elusive, you're a natural charmer with a good heart.",
  "Floragato": "You've got flair and a hidden flower up your sleeve. Floragato whips the bud on its vine with dazzling skill and moves like a dancer. Bright and affectionate, level-headed and quick, you make everyday things look a bit more magical.",
  "Meowscarada": "You're a stage magician, and your best trick is making trouble vanish. Meowscarada hides flowers in its cape and uses them to dazzle and distract. Bold and light-hearted, you love the great outdoors and a good flourish.",
  "Fuecoco": "You're relaxed, curious and always a little bit hungry. Fuecoco loves to eat and moves at its own laid-back pace, puffing out the odd ember. Thoughtful and youthful, you're a warm, grounded presence who makes everyone feel at ease.",
  "Crocalor": "You've got a sunny egg on your head and a fiery streak in your heart. Crocalor's head is a flaming egg that burns brighter when it's excited. Bold, bright and good-natured, you've got a surprising edge when someone threatens your crew.",
  "Skeledirge": "You sing, and your song warms the coldest hearts. Skeledirge's fiery bird sings a calming melody, and its fire-breath is said to be strong enough to melt steel. Independent and mischievous, you're warm, fiery and impossible to ignore.",
  "Quaxly": "Your hair is always perfect, and you're very proud of it. Quaxly's head feathers are coated in a water-repellent gel that keeps them neat. Hands-on and calm, you're a classic little perfectionist who's always well turned out.",
  "Quaxwell": "You dance to train, and you train to dance. Quaxwell's legs are strong enough to kick rocks, and it practises its moves constantly. Bold and independent, you're a down-to-earth, good-natured hard worker with rhythm.",
  "Quaquaval": "When you dance, the whole crowd stops to watch. Quaquaval's feathers shimmer as it performs, and its kicks are as graceful as they are powerful. Bright and modest, you're an understated performer until the music starts.",
  "Lechonk": "You've got a nose for the best snacks in town. Lechonk eats herbs and berries all day long, which gives it a sweet smell. Approachable and sweet-natured, a bit moody when you're hungry, you're a city pig with a big heart.",
  "Oinkologne": "You've got a fragrant presence, and people find it oddly calming. Oinkologne gives off a sweet-smelling scent that others find very pleasant. Good-natured and down-to-earth, you're a warm, city-minded host who makes everyone feel welcome.",
  "Tarountula": "You're patient, you're thrifty and you can do a lot with a ball of string. Tarountula spins a thread ball and sets sticky traps around its home. Bright and grounded, steady and independent, you quietly build something useful out of almost nothing.",
  "Spidops": "Your home is your castle, and you guard it with cleverness rather than force. Spidops sets up traps of sticky thread and can deflect almost any attack with its tough legs. Steady and good-natured, you're the hands-on neighbour everyone trusts with their spare key.",
  "Nymble": "You're tiny, bouncy and ready to jump into anything. Nymble's legs are coiled springs that send it leaping far further than you'd expect. Light-hearted and quick, steady and good-natured, you bring energy wherever you land.",
  "Lokix": "You've got a flair for the dramatic kick. Lokix strikes poses before it fights and lands blows with powerful legs. Bold and mischievous, a seasoned outdoor rebel, you're never quite as menacing as you pretend to be.",
  "Pawmi": "You're a tiny spark plug, and you're quietly independent about it. Pawmi stores electricity in its cheeks and releases it through the pads on its forepaws, but it hasn't figured out how to aim yet. Quick and techy, bold yet modest, you're just getting started.",
  "Pawmo": "You've learned to channel your energy, and you're a lot more deliberate about it now. Pawmo zaps opponents with its paws and has started to fight with real technique. Seasoned and independent, slightly edgy, you're happiest when you get to show off what you've learned.",
  "Pawmot": "You're the friend who jump-starts everyone else. Pawmot's fur stores electricity it can use to revive fainted allies with a jolt, and it fights with a boxer's confidence. Good-natured and techy, you're the everyday hero who gets people back on their feet.",
  "Tandemaus": "You and your best friend are a matched set, and you always will be. Tandemaus is a pair of mice that share everything and are never apart. Sweet-natured and light-hearted, quick and tireless, your friendships are the centre of your life.",
  "Maushold": "Your family is everything, and you stick together. Maushold is a family of mice that work, eat and sleep as a unit. Sweet-natured and grounded, you're happiest surrounded by your clan, and you'd do anything for them.",
  "Fidough": "You've got a soft, doughy body and a sweet, loyal heart. Fidough's skin is made of dough, and it's said to be very friendly. Level-headed and sweet-natured, a guarded little puppy with a big heart.",
  "Dachsbun": "You're a loaf of bread, and you're a loyal companion. Dachsbun's body is made of baked bread, and it smells delicious. Grounded and guarded, people love your sweet, everyday loyalty.",
  "Smoliv": "You're small, sour and secretly sweet. Smoliv releases a bitter oil to keep predators away, but it's very gentle with friends. Bold yet modest, outdoorsy and warm, you're a little sprout with a protective streak.",
  "Dolliv": "You share what you have, especially when it's good for others. Dolliv's oil is nourishing, and it happily shares it with other Pokémon. Thoughtful and sweet-natured, you're the friend who always brings a snack for everyone.",
  "Arboliva": "You're a wise old olive tree, and your kindness is legendary. Arboliva's oil is said to have healing properties, and it's known to be very calm. Independent and level-headed, your natural wisdom feels like sitting in the shade on a hot day.",
  "Squawkabilly": "You're loud, bright and you love your gang. Squawkabilly lives in large flocks and is famous for its boisterous calls. Sweet-natured and quick, you bring a splash of city colour wherever you go.",
  "Nacli": "You're made of salt, and you know how to heal a wound. Nacli's salt is said to help heal injuries, and it's always ready to help others. Good-natured and grounded, you're a warm, unhurried soul who leaves people better off.",
  "Naclstack": "You've built your walls brick by brick, and they're made of something useful. Naclstack compresses salt into bricks and uses them as a shield. Thoughtful and steady, a bit guarded, you're tirelessly loyal to whoever's behind your wall.",
  "Garganacl": "People come to you when they're hurt, and you patch them up without fuss. Garganacl rubs salt on injured Pokémon to help them heal, and it's said that a lot of Paldea's salt comes from it. Moody but level-headed, you're the everyday, down-to-earth giant who keeps everyone going.",
  "Charcadet": "You're looking for the right armour, and you'll know it when you find it. Charcadet wears burnt charcoal as a shell and evolves when it finds armour that suits its heart. Thoughtful and youthful, a light-hearted little flame, you're still deciding which kind of hero you'll be.",
  "Armarouge": "You've chosen the armour of an old warrior, and you wear it with pride. Armarouge's shell is said to be made from the armour of a fallen hero, and it shoots blasts of psychic flame. Bold and moody, intuitive and fiery, you take your inspiration seriously.",
  "Ceruledge": "You wield blades of blue flame, and you carry a heavy past. Ceruledge's armour is said to be the remains of a fallen swordsman, and its swords burn with ghostly fire. Guarded and independent, mischievous and fierce, you've turned old grief into strength.",
  "Tadbulb": "You're a little lightbulb of a person, and you brighten every room. Tadbulb shakes its tail to generate electricity and makes its belly glow. Light-hearted and practical, you're the steady, city-minded friend whose glow makes everything feel cosier.",
  "Bellibolt": "You're a big, round homebody with a lot of power. Bellibolt's belly is a natural electricity generator, and its eyes are actually the bumps on its head. Guarded and moody, techy and classic, you're happiest at home charging up.",
  "Wattrel": "You fly through the skies, and you're always looking for the next storm. Wattrel uses the electricity in its wings to fly through storms. Light-hearted and quick, there's a moody, city-minded energy to your flight.",
  "Kilowattrel": "You ride the storm and you know exactly where you're going. Kilowattrel stores electricity in its throat sac and flies huge distances by riding thunderclouds. Steady and edgy, you're a city bird with an excellent sense of direction.",
  "Maschiff": "You guard your house like it's your job, because it is. Maschiff protects its family fiercely and is gentle with the people it loves. Grounded and independent, natural and down-to-earth, you're the loyal guardian of your patch.",
  "Mabosstiff": "You run the pack with a calm, steady authority. Mabosstiff leads its family with a stern face and a soft heart, and it's very gentle with the young. Bold and grounded, a bit mischievous, you're the boss nobody minds having.",
  "Shroodle": "You leave little marks everywhere you go, just to say you were there. Shroodle paints with its tail, dipped in its own poison, on trees and walls. Sweet-natured and hands-on, a cheeky little artist, your tags are a sign of affection.",
  "Grafaiai": "You're a street artist, and every wall is a canvas. Grafaiai paints patterns with its poison-tipped fingers, and no two designs are ever the same. Independent and thoughtful, moody and mischievous, your creativity is uniquely yours.",
  "Bramblin": "You tumble wherever the wind takes you, and you're quietly fine with it. Bramblin is a tumbleweed spirit that drifts across the land, absorbing tiny bits of energy as it goes. Modest and light-hearted, a bit mischievous, you're the ultimate free spirit.",
  "Brambleghast": "You roll in with the wind, and you leave a bit of mystery behind. Brambleghast drifts across plains and coils its thorny body around anything it fancies. Steady and moody, bold and mischievous, you're a classic wanderer.",
  "Toedscool": "You look like a mushroom, but you're something else entirely. Toedscool is a land-dwelling jellyfish that uses its tentacles to grab prey and run away. Level-headed and a bit edgy, quick and guarded, you're never what people expect.",
  "Toedscruel": "You adapted to dry land, and you've thrived there. Toedscruel lives in forests and spreads its tentacles over the ground, moving in groups like a living carpet. Thoughtful and ambitious, a little guarded, you're a classic survivor who's made a home anywhere.",
  "Klawf": "You hang from cliffs and wait for the perfect moment to drop. Klawf clings to rock faces and ambushes prey from above with its huge claws. Seasoned and steady, quick and hands-on, you're the type who strikes at exactly the right time.",
  "Capsakid": "You're tiny, a little spicy, and you know exactly how much heat you bring. Capsakid's red-hot seeds are so spicy that only Pokémon with no sense of taste dare eat them. Bold and light-hearted, a bit moody, you're happiest out in the sunshine stirring things up.",
  "Scovillain": "You've got two moods, and both of them are intense. Scovillain's two heads are sweet and spicy, and the green one is calm while the red one is fiery. Thoughtful and modest, practical and independent, you've learned to balance your inner heat.",
  "Mega Scovillain": "When you go Mega, your inner fire becomes blinding. Mega Scovillain's two heads blaze with an intense, unrelenting heat. Ambitious and independent, a bit moody, you're an everyday spice who becomes something truly volcanic.",
  "Rellor": "You roll a ball of dirt everywhere, and you're very attached to it. Rellor rolls a mud ball around and keeps it safe, treating it like its most precious possession. Good-natured and light-hearted, a bit guarded about your treasures, you're happiest in the warm earth.",
  "Rabsca": "You'll guard something precious with everything you've got. Rabsca carries an egg on its back and uses psychic power to protect it. Thoughtful and intuitive, seasoned and calm, you're a guardian who'd move heaven and earth for what you love.",
  "Flittle": "You hover just above the ground, and you're very hard to catch. Flittle floats a few inches off the ground with psychic power, and it's wary of strangers. Bold and intuitive, quick and natural, you're a tiny spirit with a lot of nerve.",
  "Espathra": "Your gaze could hypnotise a crowd, and your legs could outrun it. Espathra uses psychic power to mesmerise opponents and runs at incredible speed. Down-to-earth and intuitive, bright and guarded, you're usually two steps ahead.",
  "Tinkatink": "You make your own tools, and you're very proud of them. Tinkatink builds its hammer from scrap metal and swings it with surprising power. Bright and sweet-natured, guarded and techy, you're a tiny maker with big ambitions.",
  "Tinkatuff": "You're always on the hunt for better materials. Tinkatuff swipes metal from Pokémon like Corviknight to upgrade its hammer. Bright and modest, sweet and independent, you're a craftsperson who knows exactly what you want.",
  "Tinkaton": "You've got a giant hammer, and you don't need anyone's help to swing it. Tinkaton's hammer is bigger than its body, and it uses it to knock flying Pokémon out of the sky. Thoughtful and practical, grounded and everyday, you're small but mighty.",
  "Wiglett": "You pop your head out to see what's going on, then vanish again. Wiglett lives in the sand and can smell prey from over 50 yards away. Light-hearted and bright, steady and calm, you're a beachside sentry with a youthful sense of fun.",
  "Wugtrio": "You've got three heads, and they always agree on the important stuff. Wugtrio's three heads work together to catch prey from a distance. Level-headed and calm, hands-on and steady, you're a natural team player.",
  "Bombirdier": "You drop things from great heights, and you think it's hilarious. Bombirdier carries a baby in its apron and drops rocks on anyone who gets too close. Independent and free-spirited, guarded and mischievous, you've got a cheeky sense of fun.",
  "Finizen": "You love to play, and you love to make new friends. Finizen is a friendly, playful dolphin that loves to swim with people and Pokémon. Light-hearted and good-natured, quick-burning and youthful, you're the first one in the water.",
  "Palafin": "You're an everyday hero who transforms when it counts. Palafin switches to its Hero Form when it's needed most, and its strength becomes immense. Good-natured and calm, seasoned and cool-headed, you're a quiet hero waiting for the right moment.",
  "Varoom": "You've got an engine for a heart, and you're always revving. Varoom is an engine-shaped Pokémon that makes loud noises to intimidate its enemies. Guarded and mischievous, techy and city-minded, you're a little speed demon.",
  "Revavroom": "You're a souped-up engine, and you're always ready to race. Revavroom's body is a powerful engine, and it can drive at incredible speeds. Bold and level-headed, grounded and techy, you're a born racer with a big roar.",
  "Cyclizar": "People have been hitching rides on you for thousands of years, and you've never minded. Cyclizar is said to have carried people since ancient times, racing over the plains at motorbike speed. Light-hearted and sweet, free-spirited and good-natured, you love giving friends a lift.",
  "Orthworm": "You tunnel through the earth like a train, and you're surprisingly easy-going about it. Orthworm's steel body heats up as it digs, and it lives in the deserts of Paldea. Guarded but warm, techy and adaptable, you get where you're going one steady metre at a time.",
  "Glimmet": "You sparkle, but don't touch. Glimmet's body is made of toxic crystals, and it scatters poison from its petals when threatened. Light-hearted and steady, a bit mischievous, you're a little gem hidden in a cave.",
  "Glimmora": "You've bloomed into something dazzling, and slightly dangerous. Glimmora's crystal petals scatter toxic shards, and it's found in caves where its glow lights the dark. Bold and thoughtful, genuine and outdoorsy, you're beautiful in a way that commands respect.",
  "Mega Glimmora": "When you transform, you become a chandelier of glittering crystal. Mega Glimmora's petals grow larger and blaze with light. Bold and bright, thoughtful and outdoorsy, you turn a dark cave into a cathedral.",
  "Greavard": "You're cheerful, loyal and a little bit spooky. Greavard is a ghost dog that's said to drain the life of people it plays with, though it seems very friendly. Guarded but mischievous, you're a natural, city-minded pup who just wants a game of fetch.",
  "Houndstone": "You'd rather sleep than fight, but you're fiercely loyal when you're awake. Houndstone dozes in graveyards and is said to watch over the people it loved. Light-hearted and mischievous, bright and cool, you're a gentle guardian of old memories.",
  "Flamigo": "You stand on one leg and look completely unbothered. Flamigo balances on one leg to rest and lands powerful kicks with the other. Steady and edgy, seasoned and natural, you're a city bird with real elegance.",
  "Cetoddle": "You're a baby whale who wandered onto land, and you're loving it. Cetoddle lives on snowy mountains and has a big appetite for berries. Bold and good-natured, cool and calm, you're a youthful soul who sees every snowfield as an adventure.",
  "Cetitan": "You're a huge, gentle whale who's very good at getting through the snow. Cetitan's horn can crush icebergs, and its thick blubber keeps it warm. Bright and level-headed, city-minded and down-to-earth, you're a giant with a soft heart.",
  "Veluza": "When things get tough, you shed what you don't need. Veluza sloughs off excess flesh to become lighter and more focused. Bold and intuitive, seasoned and calm, you're a sharp mind who's learned to let go.",
  "Dondozo": "You're huge, you're hungry and you're happiest with your best friend. Dondozo teams up with Tatsugiri, who gives it orders while riding in its mouth. Guarded and calm, adaptable and light-hearted, you're the big, laid-back friend who does whatever your little mate suggests.",
  "Tatsugiri": "You might look like sushi, but you're the brains of the operation. Tatsugiri rides in Dondozo's mouth and gives it orders, using its cute looks to lure prey. Edgy and quick, seasoned and genuine, you know exactly how to get what you want.",
  "Mega Tatsugiri (Curly)": "You look like a tasty little snack, but you're the brains of the operation. Mega Tatsugiri bursts into a giant, glittering platter of sushi, and the curly form curls up proudly at the centre. Quick, edgy and seasoned, you transform every gathering into a feast you're secretly running.",
  "Mega Tatsugiri (Droopy)": "You flop dramatically when you're tired, and somehow it's still impressive. Mega Tatsugiri's glittering sushi platter sags in its droopy form, but its cunning never does. Seasoned and quick, you're the laid-back strategist who wins while looking like you're having a nap.",
  "Mega Tatsugiri (Stretchy)": "You stand tall and proud, and you know you're the star of the table. Mega Tatsugiri's stretchy form stands upright on its shining sushi platter, chin high. Edgy, quick and tireless, you take up space confidently, and you're always plotting your next big move.",
  "Annihilape": "Your anger is so pure it has turned into something almost spiritual. Annihilape's rage became so intense it broke the limits of its body, and it now fights with a ghostly fury. Fiery and guarded, mischievous and secretly affectionate, you're loyal to the bone once your temper's cooled.",
  "Clodsire": "You plant yourself somewhere and let the world come to you. Clodsire sits still at the bottom of rivers and lakes, waiting patiently for prey to swim by. Level-headed and independent, a bit mischievous, you're warm, unbothered and impossible to rush.",
  "Farigiraf": "Your tail has opinions, and it usually agrees with you. Farigiraf's tail has grown into a second head that protects its main body with fierce bites. Bold and unhurried, a natural, warm-hearted soul, you always have someone watching your back.",
  "Dudunsparce": "You dig long tunnels, and you're quietly proud of your work. Dudunsparce digs tunnels for miles, and some have three body segments rather than two. Bold and adaptable, independent and sweet, you're a down-to-earth oddball who's built something remarkable.",
  "Kingambit": "You lead from the front, and your followers would do anything for you. Kingambit is the boss of a group of Bisharp and Pawniard, and it only fights when it has to. Independent and understated, a bit moody, you're an everyday kind of king.",
  "Great Tusk": "You're an echo of the ancient world, and you've got the tusks to prove it. Great Tusk looks like a prehistoric Donphan, tough enough to topple boulders. Independent and grounded, practical and outdoorsy, you're a living reminder that the past is never fully gone.",
  "Scream Tail": "You've got a voice that carries for miles, and a sweet little face that doesn't match it. Scream Tail resembles a prehistoric Jigglypuff, and it's said to scream loudly enough to shake the earth. Bright and practical, light-hearted and everyday, you're a mystery from another time.",
  "Brute Bonnet": "You've got a fierce attitude and spores to back it up. Brute Bonnet resembles a prehistoric Amoonguss, and it releases poison spores to protect itself. Guarded and mischievous, outdoorsy and cool, you're a tough customer from a wilder age.",
  "Flutter Mane": "You drift through time like a ghost, and you're surprisingly practical about it. Flutter Mane resembles a prehistoric Misdreavus, floating on frilly, wing-like hair. Independent and level-headed, down-to-earth for a phantom, you're an everyday mystery.",
  "Slither Wing": "You've got ancient wings and a fiery spirit. Slither Wing resembles a prehistoric Volcarona, crawling along the ground with its wings folded. Light-hearted and moody, natural and fiery, you're an everyday wanderer with a spark of the ancient world.",
  "Sandy Shocks": "You're a magnet from another age, crackling with energy. Sandy Shocks resembles a prehistoric Magneton, made of iron sand with a crackling, electric mane. Light-hearted and moody, techy and fiery, you're an everyday force of nature.",
  "Iron Treads": "You roll towards the future with steady, practical purpose. Iron Treads resembles a futuristic Donphan, all metal plates and rolling armour. Grounded and thoughtful, techy and practical, you're an everyday machine that never stops moving forward.",
  "Iron Bundle": "You're a futuristic little delivery bird, and you're always on the go. Iron Bundle resembles a robotic Delibird, its sack turned into a jet-powered propeller. Bright and ambitious, thoughtful and independent, you're the courier of tomorrow.",
  "Iron Hands": "You've got massive hands from the future, and you know how to use them. Iron Hands resembles a robotic Hariyama, its arms built like industrial machinery. Independent and moody, down-to-earth and fiery, you're a heavyweight with a big heart.",
  "Iron Jugulis": "You're a futuristic flyer with three sharp minds. Iron Jugulis resembles a robotic Hydreigon, its side heads replaced by laser-firing cannons. Bold and level-headed, edgy and mischievous, you're always a step ahead.",
  "Iron Moth": "You're a futuristic moth, glowing with fiery energy. Iron Moth resembles a robotic Volcarona, its wings replaced by flame-firing machinery. Independent and practical, down-to-earth and fiery, you bring warmth to the cold future.",
  "Iron Thorns": "You're a futuristic dinosaur with a static charge. Iron Thorns resembles a robotic Tyranitar, its spines crackling with electricity. Bold and fiery, techy and elusive, you're an armoured force from tomorrow.",
  "Frigibax": "You soak up the heat around you and turn it into growth. Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and stores it as energy. Level-headed and free-spirited, young and independent, you're a little dragon with big ambitions.",
  "Arctibax": "You hide your face behind ice, and you're a fierce fighter. Arctibax freezes the air around its mouth to make an icy mask. Level-headed and moody, free-spirited and city-minded, you protect your heart with a frozen shield.",
  "Baxcalibur": "You've got a giant ice blade on your back, and you're incredibly strong. Baxcalibur's back fin is a giant blade of ice, and it can blast freezing breath. Independent and grounded, free-spirited and modest, you're a giant with a calm, steady presence.",
  "Mega Baxcalibur": "When you transform, your ice blade becomes even more formidable. Mega Baxcalibur's body is covered in sharp ice crystals, and its blade glows with energy. Independent and ambitious, everyday and free-spirited, you're an icy legend in the making.",
  "Gimmighoul": "You live inside a treasure chest, and you're always collecting coins. Gimmighoul hides in a chest and collects coins from passing people. Moody and grounded, natural and edgy, you're a little bit greedy but very cute.",
  "Gholdengo": "You're literally made of coins, and you're surprisingly cheerful about money. Gholdengo is a thousand-and-twenty-four Gimmighoul coins come to life, and it surfs about on a board of gold. Bold and ambitious but light-hearted, you're practical about wealth and generous with your time.",
  "Wo-Chien": "You carry the weight of an old grudge, and you're slowly learning to put it down. Wo-Chien is said to have been sealed away for its resentment, and it drains the life from plants around it. Mischievous and adaptable, an outdoorsy legend, you're happiest in quiet green places.",
  "Chien-Pao": "You're cool, sleek and a little mischievous. Chien-Pao is one of the Treasures of Ruin, sealed away for its envy, and it freezes its surroundings with icy breath. Thoughtful and calm, natural and independent, you're a frosty legend with a sharp wit.",
  "Ting-Lu": "You're a quiet, powerful presence, and you've got a long memory. Ting-Lu is said to have been sealed away for its hatred, and it can cause earthquakes with its stomps. Grounded and city-minded, your hands-on, mischievous legend lives on.",
  "Chi-Yu": "You're a little fire spirit, and you're a lot more powerful than you look. Chi-Yu is one of the Treasures of Ruin, sealed away for its greed, and it controls flames with its mind. Bright and independent, down-to-earth and fiery, you're a small legend with a big impact.",
  "Roaring Moon": "You're a dragon from the distant past, with a wild, untamed spirit. Roaring Moon resembles a prehistoric Salamence, its wings swept into a jagged crescent. Grounded and level-headed, city-minded and everyday, you're a powerful echo of ancient times.",
  "Iron Valiant": "You're a futuristic knight with a blade for every occasion. Iron Valiant resembles a robotic fusion of Gardevoir and Gallade, fighting with elegant, deadly skill. Bold and independent, city-minded and everyday, you're a hero of tomorrow.",
  "Koraidon": "You're always ready for an adventure, and you're the best ride around. Koraidon is a legendary creature from the past that loves to run, and it's said to be very loyal. Bright and ambitious, good-natured and edgy, you're a natural companion.",
  "Miraidon": "You're a legendary machine from the future, and you're full of electric energy. Miraidon is a futuristic creature that can transform into different shapes. Light-hearted and moody, fiery and techy, you're a legend of tomorrow.",
  "Walking Wake": "You stride through the rain like you own it, and maybe you do. Walking Wake resembles an ancient, dragon-like Suicune, with a flowing mane of water. Free-spirited and genuine, elusive and natural, you've got a calm, steady grace.",
  "Iron Leaves": "You're a futuristic knight with a blade of light. Iron Leaves resembles a robotic Virizion, its leafy horns replaced by gleaming, energy-filled swords. Grounded and hands-on, outdoorsy and intuitive, you're a protector of the green spaces of tomorrow.",
  "Dipplin": "You're a sticky, sweet little dragon living inside an apple. Dipplin's apple is coated in a sweet, sticky syrup that it uses to protect itself. Thoughtful and steady, youthful and compact, you're a sweet soul with a strong will.",
  "Poltchageist": "You're a ghost in a teacup, and you love to make a mess. Poltchageist possesses a teacup and spills its tea everywhere, and it's said to drain the life of anyone who drinks it. Grounded and moody, mischievous and independent, you're a trickster in a teacup.",
  "Sinistcha": "You're a ghost in a teapot, and you're a master of the tea ceremony. Sinistcha's tea is said to have healing properties, and it's very proud of its craft. Thoughtful and practical, seasoned and mischievous, you're an elegant host with a secret.",
  "Okidogi": "You've got a mighty chain, and you're a natural fighter. Okidogi's chain is coated in poison, and it can crush anything with its strength. Independent and moody, light-hearted and understated, you're a tough guy with a practical streak.",
  "Munkidori": "You're a little monkey with a lot of psychic tricks. Munkidori can control people's minds with its psychic power, and it's very mischievous. Bold and ambitious, light-hearted and legendary, you're a trickster with a lot of charm.",
  "Fezandipiti": "You're a beautiful bird, and you love to be admired. Fezandipiti's feathers are incredibly beautiful, and it's very proud of its appearance. Independent and practical, mischievous and classic, you're a legendary beauty who knows how to work the room.",
  "Ogerpon": "You wear masks to hide your true self, and you're a fierce protector. Ogerpon wears masks that change its type, and it's said to be very shy. Level-headed and guarded, edgy and legendary, you're a shy hero who protects the people you love.",
  "Archaludon": "You're a metal bridge, connecting people and places. Archaludon's body is shaped like a bridge, and it can generate electricity. Guarded and free-spirited, genuine and techy, you're a natural connector.",
  "Hydrapple": "You're an apple tree with a heart of gold. Hydrapple's body is covered in apples, and it can release a sweet nectar. Thoughtful and natural, free-spirited and outdoorsy, you're a nurturing presence in any garden.",
  "Gouging Fire": "You're a fire beast from the distant past, and you're incredibly strong. Gouging Fire resembles a prehistoric Entei, with a mane of fiery hair. Grounded and hands-on, everyday and fiery, you're a powerful force from another time.",
  "Raging Bolt": "You're a thunder beast from the distant past, full of electric energy. Raging Bolt resembles a prehistoric Raikou, with a long neck and a mane of electric fur. Light-hearted and bright, genuine and thoughtful, you're a gentle giant with a spark.",
  "Iron Boulder": "You're a futuristic rock, and you're incredibly strong. Iron Boulder resembles a robotic Terrakion, with a sharp, metal horn. Grounded and hands-on, outdoorsy and intuitive, you're a powerful force of tomorrow.",
  "Iron Crown": "You're a futuristic king, and you're a natural leader. Iron Crown resembles a robotic Cobalion, with a crown of sharp, metal blades. Thoughtful and techy, everyday and intuitive, you're a leader of tomorrow.",
  "Terapagos": "You're the guardian of a mysterious crystal, and you're incredibly sweet. Terapagos is said to be the source of the Terastal phenomenon, and it's very shy. Grounded and guarded, sweet-natured and legendary, you're a shy guardian with a powerful heart.",
  "Pecharunt": "You're a little bit of a trickster, and you love to cause chaos. Pecharunt can control people with its mochi, and it's very mischievous. Steady and moody, guarded and legendary, you're a cheeky little legend.",
};
